  ('312064161101409594', 'Veneno', 2020, 'Drama', 'Javier Ambrossi, Javier Calvo', null, 'Lola Rodríguez, Isabel Torres, Daniela Santiago, Jedet, Paca la Piraña, Israel Elejalde, Sophia Lamar, Mariona Terés', 'TV-MA', 'Adored for her charisma and her free, explicit and fun way of expressing herself, La Veneno gained popularity thanks to her television appearances in the 90s. However, her life and especially her death remain an enigma.', 'Adored for her charisma and her free, explicit and fun way of expressing herself, La Veneno gained popularity thanks to her television appearances in the 90s. However, her life and especially her death remain an enigma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rSMgruoizGda8Rqe9DsgD2Ln8Uq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100834'),
  ('508018777231917065', 'Vengeance Unlimited', 1998, 'Crime, Drama', 'John McNamara, David Simkins', null, 'Kathleen York, Michael Madsen', null, 'The mysterious Mr. Chapel helps others to gain vengeance against criminals… VENGEANCE UNLIMITED was an American crime drama series broadcast during 1998-1999 on ABC which lasted for just one season of sixteen episodes. The show starred Michael Madsen and Kathleen York. The show originally aired Thursdays at 8:00 pm up against NBC''s Top 5 hits Friends and Jesse.', 'The mysterious Mr. Chapel helps others to gain vengeance against criminals… VENGEANCE UNLIMITED was an American crime drama series broadcast during 1998-1999 on ABC which lasted for just one season of sixteen episodes. The show starred Michael Madsen and Kathleen York. The show originally aired Thursdays at 8:00 pm up against NBC''s Top 5 hits Friends and Jesse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dv2gXMGVPrYe3alX6cLLtlKQlgH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10344'),
  ('55160734047642394', 'Venus''s Groom', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Kitt Sorakit Buasri, Noratape Nontarat, Putthisun Tiyapiboonchaiya', null, 'Blinded by rage and consumed by the need to avenge his brother, Pakin kidnaps a luxury hotel heir, holding him captive in the unforgiving wilderness. But fate plays a cruel trick: his hostage might not be the culprit he believes he is. Beneath identical faces lies a stark difference one is a fire ready to burn, the other is water ready to heal. Can he tell them apart? And in the heart of the wild, how will forced proximity turn a sworn enemy into a lover?', 'Blinded by rage and consumed by the need to avenge his brother, Pakin kidnaps a luxury hotel heir, holding him captive in the unforgiving wilderness. But fate plays a cruel trick: his hostage might not be the culprit he believes he is. Beneath identical faces lies a stark difference one is a fire ready to burn, the other is water ready to heal. Can he tell them apart? And in the heart of the wild, how will forced proximity turn a sworn enemy into a lover?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avRHhgH1rrw3oFuFoZaFnyMREj1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:314668'),
  ('898042389978827394', 'Vera', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ann Cleeves', null, 'Brenda Blethyn, Jon Morrison, Riley Jones, Sarah Kameela Impey, Rhiannon Clements', null, 'A sharp detective with a messy life, DCI Vera Stanhope patrols her “patch” of northeast England, pursuing the truth in cases of murder, kidnapping, and blackmail. Vera is obsessive about her work and faces the world with caustic wit, guile and courage.', 'A sharp detective with a messy life, DCI Vera Stanhope patrols her “patch” of northeast England, pursuing the truth in cases of murder, kidnapping, and blackmail. Vera is obsessive about her work and faces the world with caustic wit, guile and courage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeYImRVVEX6LM2151oEkmNUKLVR.jpg', 14, 'tmdb:tv:39185'),
  ('229004443073318273', 'Verano azul', 1981, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Antonio Mercero', 'José Ángel Rodero, Horacio Valcárcel, Antonio Mercero', 'Antonio Ferrandis, María Garralón, Juanjo Artero, Pilar Torres, Gerardo Garrido, Cristina Torres, José Luis Fernández, Miguel Joven', null, 'The series tells the adventures of a group of youngsters between ages 9 and 17, while on summer vacation in a small coastal town on the Spanish Mediterranean Costa del Sol.', 'The series tells the adventures of a group of youngsters between ages 9 and 17, while on summer vacation in a small coastal town on the Spanish Mediterranean Costa del Sol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Q6lUN6IsVLHbZ7S0z5LtTkcWs1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6066'),
  ('801212745452770729', 'Verbotene Liebe', 1995, 'Drama, Soap', null, null, 'Gabriele Metzger, Isa Jank, Miriam Lahnstein, Wolfram Grandezka, Martina Servatius, Kerstin Landsmann, Thore Schölermann, Jo Weil', null, 'Verbotene Liebe is a German television soap opera Verbotene Liebe was initially based on original story and character outlines from the Australian soap opera Sons and Daughters, before evolving into a show of its own as the series progressed. The show originally focused on two core families: the wealthy Anstetten family and the middle-class Brandner family. More specifically, it dealt with the story of Jan Brandner and Julia von Anstetten, two strangers whose fascination for each other leads them to fall in love, neither of them cognizant of the fact that they are twins separated by their parents. It is this story of forbidden love that gave the series its title.', 'Verbotene Liebe is a German television soap opera Verbotene Liebe was initially based on original story and character outlines from the Australian soap opera Sons and Daughters, before evolving into a show of its own as the series progressed. The show originally focused on two core families: the wealthy Anstetten family and the middle-class Brandner family. More specifically, it dealt with the story of Jan Brandner and Julia von Anstetten, two strangers whose fascination for each other leads them to fall in love, neither of them cognizant of the fact that they are twins separated by their parents. It is this story of forbidden love that gave the series its title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nO6PgeFkvsNN3PsE9xHSzqwCgNC.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:12173'),
  ('1011727860571377020', 'Verden som læreplads', 2026, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Felix Smith', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76jfASCZKtxkAKskMFk2kRHkeNO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317699'),
  ('335626344221400377', 'Verdict', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', 'Paula Knudsen', null, 'Camila Morgado, Fernando Alves Pinto, Victor Hugo Martins, Lena Roque, Lucinha Lins, Arthur Kohl, Pedro Caetano, Alexandre Apolinário', 'TV-MA', 'When a renowned criminal lawyer sees one of the people she loves most become a victim of the Brazilian penitentiary system, she must decide whether to cross the line that separates her between looking for justice or committing an unforgivable crime.', 'When a renowned criminal lawyer sees one of the people she loves most become a victim of the Brazilian penitentiary system, she must decide whether to cross the line that separates her between looking for justice or committing an unforgivable crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ds9h8aZCvoIUrBj979VElZDJhN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123378'),
  ('921185884966567167', 'Veritas: The Quest', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Patrick Massett, John Zinman', null, 'Alex Carter, Ryan Merriman, Cobie Smulders, Eric Balfour, Cynthia Martells, Arnold Vosloo', null, 'Veritas: The Quest is a television program that aired in 2003. It follows a rebellious but intelligent teenager, Nikko Zond, discovering that his father Solomon''s profession is much more mystical and adventurous than he previously thought. Solomon and his team search for the answers to some of the world''s mysteries, a quest began because of the mysterious disappearance of Nikko''s mother during an archaeological dig. Thus begins Nikko''s fantastical journey into an Indiana Jones-style adventure with his father and his colleagues in trying to follow in his mother''s footsteps to discover what strange secrets she was uncovering.', 'Veritas: The Quest is a television program that aired in 2003. It follows a rebellious but intelligent teenager, Nikko Zond, discovering that his father Solomon''s profession is much more mystical and adventurous than he previously thought. Solomon and his team search for the answers to some of the world''s mysteries, a quest began because of the mysterious disappearance of Nikko''s mother during an archaeological dig. Thus begins Nikko''s fantastical journey into an Indiana Jones-style adventure with his father and his colleagues in trying to follow in his mother''s footsteps to discover what strange secrets she was uncovering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpC4Hp18TFbKcJmtEYGpKC1DZ3p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5114'),
  ('160123031431338967', 'Verliebt in Berlin', 2005, 'Soap', 'Michael Esser, Peter Schlesselmann', null, 'Alexandra Neldel, Laura Osswald, Tim Sander, Georgea Regout, Mathis Künzler, Olivia Pascal, Volker Herold, Gabrielle Scharnitzky', 'NR', 'The original season follows the life of the unsophisticated but good-natured Lisa Plenske, and her incongruous job at the ultra-chic Berlin fashion house Kerima Moda; while the second season revolved around Lisa''s ham-fisted but sly half-brother Bruno and junior designer Hannah Refrath.', 'The original season follows the life of the unsophisticated but good-natured Lisa Plenske, and her incongruous job at the ultra-chic Berlin fashion house Kerima Moda; while the second season revolved around Lisa''s ham-fisted but sly half-brother Bruno and junior designer Hannah Refrath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gw00a3X2xZ8avePAMyD4olZtN9u.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3947'),
  ('1056409002632746074', 'Vermeil in Gold', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Kouta Amana', 'Yuya Hirose, Maaya Uchida, Wakana Kuramochi, Yu Okano, Kaori Ishihara, Sakura Nakamura, Kana Hanazawa, Kazuyuki Okitsu', 'TV-14', 'Rather than take a more sensible approach to salvaging his grades in time for graduation, Alto summons a bit of otherworldly help. Only after does he learn he’s bound the legendary she-devil Vermeil into service as his familiar!', 'Rather than take a more sensible approach to salvaging his grades in time for graduation, Alto summons a bit of otherworldly help. Only after does he learn he’s bound the legendary she-devil Vermeil into service as his familiar!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bwAVzmeSKCCQbwixsuhADX5u6j7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:194774'),
  ('857444742421543714', 'Vermin', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Alexis Beaumont, Balak, Hafid F. Benamar', null, 'Cathy Palenne, Monsieur Poulpe, Julien Crampon, Gaël Mectoob', null, 'It’s the story of a praying mantis who goes off the city to become a policeman and is going to suffer a lot. It’s a bit like Zootopia but without being tolerant.', 'It’s the story of a praying mantis who goes off the city to become a policeman and is going to suffer a lot. It’s a bit like Zootopia but without being tolerant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3F7LxfqmFvHhjPI5wIaYAwxRydt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81138'),
  ('1019533764395214655', 'Vermist', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Bas Adriaensen, Philippe De Schepper', null, 'Stan Van Samang, Inge Paulussen, Mathijs Scheepers, Line Pillet', null, 'Vermist is a Dutch language crime drama produced by Belgian broadcaster VT4 and Netherlands production company Eyeworks. It is broadcast on VT4 and a French language version—Urgence disparitions—is shown by W9. Based on the characters and background of the successful Flemish film Vermist, the first episode was broadcast on March 25, 2008. A second season was broadcast in 2010.', 'Vermist is a Dutch language crime drama produced by Belgian broadcaster VT4 and Netherlands production company Eyeworks. It is broadcast on VT4 and a French language version—Urgence disparitions—is shown by W9. Based on the characters and background of the successful Flemish film Vermist, the first episode was broadcast on March 25, 2008. A second season was broadcast in 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WjzB3ZmyXRz1GFkdbs7NehG3Mx.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:35576'),
  ('45743298139511934', 'Vernon Subutex', 2019, 'Drama', 'Cathy Verney', 'Benjamin Dupas', 'Romain Duris, Céline Sallette, Laurent Lucas, Flora Fischbach, Philippe Rebbot, Florence Thomassin, Athaya Mokonzi, Iman Amara-Korba', null, 'Vernon Subutex, the unemployed former owner of legendary record shop Revolver, is evicted from his apartment. In his search for a place to stay, Vernon contacts his former friends who were involved in the music world with him in the 1990s.', 'Vernon Subutex, the unemployed former owner of legendary record shop Revolver, is evicted from his apartment. In his search for a place to stay, Vernon contacts his former friends who were involved in the music world with him in the 1990s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlonNuIues14pAoLXliH5TNahxF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86570'),
  ('1001826209090265629', 'Veronica Mars', 2004, 'Mystery, Drama, Comedy', 'Rob Thomas', null, 'Kristen Bell, Enrico Colantoni, Jason Dohring', 'TV-14', 'In the fictional town of Neptune, California, student Veronica Mars progresses from high school to college while moonlighting as a private investigator under the tutelage of her detective father.', 'In the fictional town of Neptune, California, student Veronica Mars progresses from high school to college while moonlighting as a private investigator under the tutelage of her detective father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOdJETEueGgUqJR4UvwTdUoJhvO.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:1432'),
  ('329929571987358547', 'Veronica''s Closet', 1997, 'Comedy', 'Marta Kauffman, David Crane', null, 'Kirstie Alley, Dan Cortese, Wallace Langham, Daryl Mitchell, Kathy Najimy, Lorri Bagley', 'TV-PG', 'Veronica ''Ronnie'' Chase is the ''Queen of Romance.'' Founder of a successful lingerie empire, and best-selling author of self-help romance books, Ronnie has it all ... money, success, sex appeal and a philandering husband. How she will find true happiness without jeopardizing her business will be her biggest challenge yet.', 'Veronica ''Ronnie'' Chase is the ''Queen of Romance.'' Founder of a successful lingerie empire, and best-selling author of self-help romance books, Ronnie has it all ... money, success, sex appeal and a philandering husband. How she will find true happiness without jeopardizing her business will be her biggest challenge yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pORo0C7IFMiefK2dpgrSWpPSUha.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:603'),
  ('629910487689408995', 'Veronika', 2024, 'Drama', 'Jonas Alexander Arnby, Katja Juras, Anne Lindblom', null, 'Alexandra Rapaport, Tobias Santelmann, Arvin Kananian, Sam Herrgård', null, 'When a police officer with a tablet addiction sees a dead boy, she questions her sanity, but she realizes that she is facing victims of unsolved crimes and that her past can help to catch a killer on the loose.', 'When a police officer with a tablet addiction sees a dead boy, she questions her sanity, but she realizes that she is facing victims of unsolved crimes and that her past can help to catch a killer on the loose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4DKJwKWaq8XzyXp6KPfwEBs8JTl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:245441'),
  ('274601996195507559', 'Versailles', 2015, 'Drama', 'David Wolstencroft, Simon Mirren', null, 'George Blagden, Alexander Vlahos, Tygh Runyan, Stuart Bowman, Elisa Lasowski, Anna Brewster, Evan Williams, Maddison Jaizani', 'TV-MA', 'The story of a young Louis XIV on his journey to become the most powerful monarch in Europe, from his battles with the fronde through his development into the Sun King. Historical and fictional characters guide us in a world of betrayal and political maneuvering, revealing Versailles in all its glory and brutality.', 'The story of a young Louis XIV on his journey to become the most powerful monarch in Europe, from his battles with the fronde through his development into the Sun King. Historical and fictional characters guide us in a world of betrayal and political maneuvering, revealing Versailles in all its glory and brutality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMqCRNpc2FadD0n7vJLRmlS0aEt.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:64353'),
