  ('549962323844273570', 'Vice Principals', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Danny McBride, Jody Hill', null, 'Danny McBride, Walton Goggins, Dale Dickey, Georgia King, Busy Philipps, Sheaun McKinney, Shea Whigham', 'TV-MA', 'After North Jackson High''s long-time principal steps down to tend to his ailing wife, Neal Gamby and Lee Russell, the school''s vice principals, are forced to put their mutual disdain aside and form an unholy alliance in order to sabotage the newly appointed principal, Dr. Belinda Brown.', 'After North Jackson High''s long-time principal steps down to tend to his ailing wife, Neal Gamby and Lee Russell, the school''s vice principals, are forced to put their mutual disdain aside and form an unholy alliance in order to sabotage the newly appointed principal, Dr. Belinda Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbAH3WlLpeAxJ06xpF4Uwg9j7kr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:65150'),
  ('639463058206974030', 'Vice Versa', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'JittiRain', null, 'Tawinan Anukoolprasert, Jitaraphol Potiwihok, Korapat Kirdpan, Pawat Chittsawangdee, Trai Nimtawat, Thanaboon Kiatniran, Lalana Kongthoranin, Maneerat Kam-Uan', null, 'After drowning, Talay wakes up in another universe in a rich kid’s body, where he must find a way home with the help of an old friend.', 'After drowning, Talay wakes up in another universe in a rich kid’s body, where he must find a way home with the help of an old friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJCTEzqidS57AGLTPNHPCxYCnxA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205115'),
