  ('65974954169201670', 'Victoria''s Secret: Angels and Demons', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Michael Gross, Frederique van der Wal, Lyndsey Scott, Sarah Ellison, Conchita Sarnoff, Dorothea Barth Jorgensen', null, 'Truth is not what it seems; as the underworld of fashion, the billionaire class, and Jeffrey Epstein are revealed to all be inextricably intertwined with the rise and fall of this legendary brand.', 'Truth is not what it seems; as the underworld of fashion, the billionaire class, and Jeffrey Epstein are revealed to all be inextricably intertwined with the rise and fall of this legendary brand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mx1dvhNVGAU09zWCeqxPFTZ2au.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119507'),
  ('933133883932683048', 'Victorinos', 2009, 'Soap', 'Miguel Otero Silva', null, 'Mauricio Ochmann, Arap Bethke, Diana Jaramillo, Roberto Manrique, Francisco Bolívar, Carolina Sepulveda, Sara Corrales, Jacqueline Márquez', null, 'Victorinos is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo. It debuted on June 23, 2009, replacing Sin Senos no hay Paraíso and concluded February 5, 2010. The telenovela is a remake of the 1991 RTI Colombia weekly series Cuando Quiero Llorar No Lloro, which in turn is based in the homonymous 1970 novel by Venezuelan writer Miguel Otero Silva. Ramiro Meneses, who is currently directing the Telemundo telenovela, starred as one of the Victorinos in the 1991 RTI series. The serial ran from Monday to Friday to run for over 26 weeks. As with most of its other soap operas, the network broadcasts English subtitles as closed captions on CC3. Ironically, this show was replaced by the original serial of the show, it had replaced.. Telemundo is currently re-airing the series at 12:30/11:30 PM slot', 'Victorinos is a Spanish-language telenovela produced by the United States-based television network Telemundo. It debuted on June 23, 2009, replacing Sin Senos no hay Paraíso and concluded February 5, 2010. The telenovela is a remake of the 1991 RTI Colombia weekly series Cuando Quiero Llorar No Lloro, which in turn is based in the homonymous 1970 novel by Venezuelan writer Miguel Otero Silva. Ramiro Meneses, who is currently directing the Telemundo telenovela, starred as one of the Victorinos in the 1991 RTI series. The serial ran from Monday to Friday to run for over 26 weeks. As with most of its other soap operas, the network broadcasts English subtitles as closed captions on CC3. Ironically, this show was replaced by the original serial of the show, it had replaced.. Telemundo is currently re-airing the series at 12:30/11:30 PM slot', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NW6jhhmGDtQqUhWhGA58MYAQaE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:18846'),
  ('790766554086317337', 'Victorious', 2010, 'Comedy, Kids', 'Dan Schneider', null, 'Victoria Justice, Leon Thomas III, Matt Bennett, Elizabeth Gillies, Ariana Grande, Avan Jogia', 'TV-G', 'Aspiring singer Tori Vega navigates life while attending a performing arts high school called Hollywood Arts.', 'Aspiring singer Tori Vega navigates life while attending a performing arts high school called Hollywood Arts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YJT7qzswtdYhOGfLulXtBhUcl1.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:31251'),
  ('722784848700213017', 'Vida', 2018, 'Drama', 'Tanya Saracho', null, 'Melissa Barrera, Mishel Prada, Ser Anzoategui, Chelsea Rendon, Carlos Miranda, Roberta Colindrez, Adrian Gonzalez', 'TV-MA', 'Two Mexican-American sisters from the Eastside of Los Angeles who couldn''t be more different or distanced from each other are forced to return to their old neighborhood, where they are confronted by the past and surprising truth about their mother’s identity.', 'Two Mexican-American sisters from the Eastside of Los Angeles who couldn''t be more different or distanced from each other are forced to return to their old neighborhood, where they are confronted by the past and surprising truth about their mother’s identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ml7oytvsNekgaZiUvopV7oQeZg.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:77031'),
  ('394330337490247083', 'Video Game High School', 2012, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Comedy', 'Freddie Wong, Matthew Arnold, Brandon Laatsch', 'Matthew Arnold, Will Campos, Brian Firenzi', 'Josh Blaylock, Brian Firenzi, Johanna Braddy, Ellary Porterfield, Joey Scoma, Joel Kelley Dauten, Hallie Ricardo, Anthony Gioe', 'TV-14', 'It''s the near future: You''re dead. Your kids are probably dead. Your grandkids (if they''re alive) are playing video games. Why? Because professional gaming is the biggest sport on earth. Around the world, millions of players duke it out in fighters, RTS’s, First Person Shooters and more. To the victors go the spoils: glory, clan contracts and million dollar endorsements. The best young gamers are recruited by elite boarding schools to sharpen their skills. The best of the best go to VGHS: VIDEO GAME HIGH SCHOOL.', 'It''s the near future: You''re dead. Your kids are probably dead. Your grandkids (if they''re alive) are playing video games. Why? Because professional gaming is the biggest sport on earth. Around the world, millions of players duke it out in fighters, RTS’s, First Person Shooters and more. To the victors go the spoils: glory, clan contracts and million dollar endorsements. The best young gamers are recruited by elite boarding schools to sharpen their skills. The best of the best go to VGHS: VIDEO GAME HIGH SCHOOL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTmfH8JF8GISz4XrZvrwt5aXrF0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61491'),
  ('714583846260142074', 'Video Girl Ai', 1992, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Masakazu Katsura', null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Takeshi Kusao, Yuri Amano, Koji Tsujitani, Hirotaka Suzuoki', null, 'High-school student Yota Moteuchi is so unpopular that his classmates have given him the nickname "Dateless." So it''s no surprise when the love of his life, Moemi, is not interested in Yota but instead is in love with Yota''s best friend, Takashi. Yota turns to a video rental shop for comfort, but little did he suspect that the shop was magical and that the cute girl on his rented tape would pop out of the television and try to fix his ruined love life!', 'High-school student Yota Moteuchi is so unpopular that his classmates have given him the nickname "Dateless." So it''s no surprise when the love of his life, Moemi, is not interested in Yota but instead is in love with Yota''s best friend, Takashi. Yota turns to a video rental shop for comfort, but little did he suspect that the shop was magical and that the cute girl on his rented tape would pop out of the television and try to fix his ruined love life!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55kGXYm6oC2WULfhmipJvTAOqsx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22432'),
  ('971891573806493868', 'Video Nasty', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Justin Daniels Anene, Cal O''Driscoll, Leia Murphy, Valerie O''Connor, Declan Rodgers, Simone Kirby, Emmanuel Ighodaro', null, 'Three mostly normal, slightly weird teens go on an epic quest for a cult VHS collection. But on the way, they somehow get mixed up in a murder.', 'Three mostly normal, slightly weird teens go on an epic quest for a cult VHS collection. But on the way, they somehow get mixed up in a murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4vbbIVBvaWdSuaPCNrLNxgwr3UV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256949'),
  ('819367001710876054', 'Video Star', 2016, 'Talk', null, null, 'Park So-hyun, Kim Sook, Park Na-rae, Sunny, Sandara Park', null, 'Four female hosts blend quick quips and laughter with candor as they invite celebrity guests to open up about their lives.', 'Four female hosts blend quick quips and laughter with candor as they invite celebrity guests to open up about their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sKOJdzo4tmzL0XzjbcEVxejcmx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94454'),
  ('109844601767538805', 'Vienna Blood', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Steve Thompson', 'Steve Thompson', 'Matthew Beard, Juergen Maurer, Charlene McKenna, Conleth Hill, Amelia Bullmore, Josef Ellers, Luise von Finckh, Simon Hatzl', 'TV-14', 'Max Liebermann, a student of Sigmund Freud, helps Detective Rheinhardt in the investigation of a series of disturbing murders around the grand cafes and opera houses of 1900s Vienna.', 'Max Liebermann, a student of Sigmund Freud, helps Detective Rheinhardt in the investigation of a series of disturbing murders around the grand cafes and opera houses of 1900s Vienna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHIkllx1obFjEeI7z558QLoRhiU.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:94000'),
  ('7403082461984951', 'Vienna Crime Squad', 2005, 'Crime', null, null, 'Lilian Klebow, Maria Happel, Brigitte Kren, Andreas Kiendl, Martin Gruber, Max G. Fischnaller', 'NR', 'SOKO Donau is an Austrian television series.', 'SOKO Donau is an Austrian television series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/krjAaeMOZfIYqz3tlnRSQUuUC0.jpg', 20, 'tmdb:tv:41349'),
  ('710806957126760791', 'Vientos de agua', 2006, 'Drama', 'Juan José Campanella', 'Juan José Campanella, Juan Pablo Domenech, Alejo Flah', 'Eduardo Blanco, Ernesto Alterio, Héctor Alterio, Angie Cepeda, Pablo Rago, Marta Etura, Caterina Murino, Claudia Fontán', null, 'Vientos de agua is a 2006 cult Argentine- Spanish mini TV series created by Juan José Campanella. The drama traces a Spaniard''s emigration to Argentina in the 1930s, and, years later, his son''s return to modern-day Spain. It aired in Spain in January 2006, on Telecinco for only one series of 13 episodes. While a hit in Argentina, because of lower ratings in Spain it was taken out of the prime-time slot to 1.00 in morning, and was eventually cancelled due to downloading of series from the internet. Despite a campaign of support to continue into a second series it only produced 13 episodes. Despite this the series was a hit in DVD sellings.', 'Vientos de agua is a 2006 cult Argentine- Spanish mini TV series created by Juan José Campanella. The drama traces a Spaniard''s emigration to Argentina in the 1930s, and, years later, his son''s return to modern-day Spain. It aired in Spain in January 2006, on Telecinco for only one series of 13 episodes. While a hit in Argentina, because of lower ratings in Spain it was taken out of the prime-time slot to 1.00 in morning, and was eventually cancelled due to downloading of series from the internet. Despite a campaign of support to continue into a second series it only produced 13 episodes. Despite this the series was a hit in DVD sellings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fco3uj8dOGxGae7RHsKi0mdxYqU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:15937'),
  ('932412977806227429', 'Vietnam in HD', 2011, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Sammy Jackson', 'Sammy Jackson', 'Adrian Grenier, Michael C. Hall, Tempestt Bledsoe, Dean Cain, Kevin Connolly, Edward Burns, Jerry Ferrara, Armie Hammer', null, 'The firsthand experiences of thirteen Americans during the Vietnam War. The thirteen Americans retell their stories in Vietnam paired with found footage from the battlefield.', 'The firsthand experiences of thirteen Americans during the Vietnam War. The thirteen Americans retell their stories in Vietnam paired with found footage from the battlefield.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MgndssWm8iuTUfsU4PELBJXnbX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42799'),
  ('781324883822302220', 'Vietnam: The War That Changed America', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Ethan Hawke', 'TV-MA', 'The reunion of old friends, first-person accounts, and rarely seen footage paint an extraordinary and deeply profound picture of what it was like to live through one of history''s longest wars.', 'The reunion of old friends, first-person accounts, and rarely seen footage paint an extraordinary and deeply profound picture of what it was like to live through one of history''s longest wars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJiG3rmP8smQ415jJ0J0SG0sDtU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:257945'),
  ('920461390917377896', 'Viewpoint', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Ed Whitmore, Harry Bradbeer', 'Ed Whitmore', 'Noel Clarke, Alexandra Roach, Kíla Lord Cassidy, Catherine Tyldesley, Sarah Niles, Amy Wren, Fehinti Balogun, Phil Davis', null, 'This gripping five-part drama follows a tense police surveillance investigation into a tight knit Manchester community and explores whether it is ever possible to observe the lives of others with true objectivity and zero effect.', 'This gripping five-part drama follows a tense police surveillance investigation into a tight knit Manchester community and explores whether it is ever possible to observe the lives of others with true objectivity and zero effect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJfA6RNIiZkFTd7lB5VyWZFUdhq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124279'),
  ('569763001304705987', 'Vighnaharta Ganesh', 2017, 'Drama', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Vighnaharta Ganesh showcases the journey of the deity Ganesha and presents a magical visual extravaganza with impeccable production design, celestial costumes and ingenious audio-visual experience through Motion Capture technology. This technology will make the emotional journey of how Ganesha transformed from being an ostracized child to "Prathamesh" amongst Gods, a more endearing and realistic experience. Motion Capture technology and animatronics which will be used for the first time on Indian Television, after being extensively used in Hollywood. This technology will replace the age old depiction of Lord Ganesha with an inert mask and bring alive the detailed life-like movements and facial expressions to the fore giving the viewers a delightful visual treat. This magnum opus is supported by a stellar star-cast that includes Uzair Basar playing Ganesha, Akanksha Puri as Parvati, Malkhan Singh as Shiv, Basant Bhatt as Kartikeya and Anand Garodia as Narada Muni.', 'Vighnaharta Ganesh showcases the journey of the deity Ganesha and presents a magical visual extravaganza with impeccable production design, celestial costumes and ingenious audio-visual experience through Motion Capture technology. This technology will make the emotional journey of how Ganesha transformed from being an ostracized child to "Prathamesh" amongst Gods, a more endearing and realistic experience. Motion Capture technology and animatronics which will be used for the first time on Indian Television, after being extensively used in Hollywood. This technology will replace the age old depiction of Lord Ganesha with an inert mask and bring alive the detailed life-like movements and facial expressions to the fore giving the viewers a delightful visual treat. This magnum opus is supported by a stellar star-cast that includes Uzair Basar playing Ganesha, Akanksha Puri as Parvati, Malkhan Singh as Shiv, Basant Bhatt as Kartikeya and Anand Garodia as Narada Muni.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjtGudCLbL8CGmmwHSjOd0lgWFY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75230'),
  ('384047890441857258', 'Vigil', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'Tom Edge', null, 'Suranne Jones, Rose Leslie, Romola Garai, Gary Lewis, Chris Jenks, Jonathan Ajayi, Amir El-Masry, Oscar Salem', 'TV-MA', 'The mysterious disappearance of a Scottish fishing trawler and a death on-board the submarine HMS Vigil bring the police into conflict with the Navy and British security services. DCI Amy Silva and DS Kirsten Longacre lead an investigation on land and at sea into a conspiracy that goes to the very heart of Britain’s national security.', 'The mysterious disappearance of a Scottish fishing trawler and a death on-board the submarine HMS Vigil bring the police into conflict with the Navy and British security services. DCI Amy Silva and DS Kirsten Longacre lead an investigation on land and at sea into a conspiracy that goes to the very heart of Britain’s national security.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zAheY0Upi2MwU3edGtEgb7Ldh3.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:126167'),
  ('1024947105045716384', 'Vigilante', 2023, 'Crime, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Moon Yoo-seok', null, 'Nam Joo-hyuk, Yoo Ji-tae, Kim So-jin, Lee Jun-hyuk, Kwon Hae-hyo, Lee Seung-woo, Lee Seo-hwan', 'TV-MA', 'Kim Ji-yong leads a double life as a Korean National Police University student by day and the Vigilante by night, personally punishing criminals who evade the law. He is surrounded by people who all possess different ulterior motives.', 'Kim Ji-yong leads a double life as a Korean National Police University student by day and the Vigilante by night, personally punishing criminals who evade the law. He is surrounded by people who all possess different ulterior motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lauvBkCZhcZHj5uUwUxwr5GTPps.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205082'),
