  ('1027806529393515210', 'Viña del Mar International Song Festival', 1963, null, 'Gustavo Lorca, Carlos Ansaldo', null, 'Rafael Araneda, Karen Doggenweiler', 'TV-PG', 'A yearly musical contest organized by the municipality of Viña del Mar, Chile which takes place during the last week of February at the Quinta Vergara Amphitheater since February 21, 1960.', 'A yearly musical contest organized by the municipality of Viña del Mar, Chile which takes place during the last week of February at the Quinta Vergara Amphitheater since February 21, 1960.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u5muV6ulY272YIdHSUGDnBb2FtF.jpg', 48, 'tmdb:tv:77728'),
  ('1038233918920590749', 'Vincent', 2005, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ray Winstone, Suranne Jones, Joe Absolom, Angel Coulby, Ian Puleston-Davies', null, 'Vincent is an ITV drama series. An initial series was made and aired in 2005 and starred Ray Winstone, in the title role, and Suranne Jones as two members of a team of private eyes hired by people to spy on their partners or indeed anyone else they need to keep tabs on. The four part series also starred Angel Coulby, Ian Puleston-Davies, Joe Absolom, Eva Pope and Philip Glenister. A second series was broadcast in the autumn of 2006.', 'Vincent is an ITV drama series. An initial series was made and aired in 2005 and starred Ray Winstone, in the title role, and Suranne Jones as two members of a team of private eyes hired by people to spy on their partners or indeed anyone else they need to keep tabs on. The four part series also starred Angel Coulby, Ian Puleston-Davies, Joe Absolom, Eva Pope and Philip Glenister. A second series was broadcast in the autumn of 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxPlwmMh4H0eb7AgGio6qzPxHBg.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:10385'),
  ('602531639605710072', 'Vincenzo', 2021, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Crime', null, null, 'Song Joong-ki, Jeon Yeo-been, Ok Taec-yeon, Kim Yeo-jin, Kwak Dong-yeon, Cho Han-cheul, Lim Cheol-soo, Yoon Byung-hee', 'TV-14', 'At the age of eight, Park Joo Hyeong left for Italy after being adopted. Now an adult, he is known as Vincenzo Cassano and employed by a Mafia family as a consigliere. Due to warring Mafia factions, he flies to South Korea where he gets involved with lawyer Hong Cha Young. She is the type of attorney who will do anything to win a case. Now back in his motherland, he gives an unrivalled conglomerate a taste of his own medicine—with a side of his own version of justice.', 'At the age of eight, Park Joo Hyeong left for Italy after being adopted. Now an adult, he is known as Vincenzo Cassano and employed by a Mafia family as a consigliere. Due to warring Mafia factions, he flies to South Korea where he gets involved with lawyer Hong Cha Young. She is the type of attorney who will do anything to win a case. Now back in his motherland, he gives an unrivalled conglomerate a taste of his own medicine—with a side of his own version of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbkSS1cTjT4DzIwD44bdhTuYgdT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117376'),
  ('653903465464307485', 'Vincenzo Malinconico, avvocato d''insuccesso', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Massimo Reale, Diego De Silva, Salvatore De Mola', null, 'Massimiliano Gallo, Denise Capezza, Francesco Di Leva, Teresa Saponangelo, Lina Sastri, Gianfelice Imparato, Luca Gallone, Chiara Celotto', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5eesqrd7gw2bosN2CCYZojuP7z.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:213120'),
  ('983362606219025235', 'Vinland Saga', 2019, 'Animation, War & Politics, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Yuto Uemura, Shunsuke Takeuchi', 'TV-MA', 'For a thousand years, the Vikings have made quite a name and reputation for themselves as the strongest families with a thirst for violence. Thorfinn, the son of one of the Vikings'' greatest warriors, spends his boyhood in a battlefield enhancing his skills in his adventure to redeem his most-desired revenge after his father was murdered.', 'For a thousand years, the Vikings have made quite a name and reputation for themselves as the strongest families with a thirst for violence. Thorfinn, the son of one of the Vikings'' greatest warriors, spends his boyhood in a battlefield enhancing his skills in his adventure to redeem his most-desired revenge after his father was murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUHlpA5c1NXkds59reY3HMb4Abs.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:88803'),
  ('627510946076033764', 'Vinyl', 2016, 'Drama', 'Terence Winter, Rich Cohen, Mick Jagger', null, 'Bobby Cannavale, Olivia Wilde, Ray Romano, Ato Essandoh, Max Casella, P.J. Byrne, J.C. MacKenzie, Birgitte Hjort Sørensen', 'TV-MA', 'In 1970s New York, jaded record exec Richie Finestra tries to resurrect his failing label and fractured personal life while keeping his finger on the pulse of the city''s new sound.', 'In 1970s New York, jaded record exec Richie Finestra tries to resurrect his failing label and fractured personal life while keeping his finger on the pulse of the city''s new sound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8RbNsFIvqHxwAEvgn2WXmJK8TL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:63535'),
  ('133839568958810879', 'Violence Jack', 1986, 'Animation, Crime', null, null, 'Tessyo Genda, Shigezo Sasaoka, Keiichi Nanba, Yoshino Ootori, Norio Wakamoto, Issei Futamata, Hiromi Tsuru', null, 'After a devastating natural disaster, the Kanto region in Japan is now a wasteland of lawlessness, where the weak are playthings of the strong. Ruled with an iron fist by the Slum King, the people of Kanto have no hope left to them, living at the whims of raiders and bandits. In this hellish world, there is only one man with the power to stand up for the powerless, and his name alone strikes terror into evil hearts -- Violence Jack! Whether he’s saving women from sex camps, protecting the models of Zone C from those who covet their beauty, or exterminating a biker gang bent on destruction; if you oppress the weak, the only thing you can look forward to is a swift death from Jack’s knife!', 'After a devastating natural disaster, the Kanto region in Japan is now a wasteland of lawlessness, where the weak are playthings of the strong. Ruled with an iron fist by the Slum King, the people of Kanto have no hope left to them, living at the whims of raiders and bandits. In this hellish world, there is only one man with the power to stand up for the powerless, and his name alone strikes terror into evil hearts -- Violence Jack! Whether he’s saving women from sex camps, protecting the models of Zone C from those who covet their beauty, or exterminating a biker gang bent on destruction; if you oppress the weak, the only thing you can look forward to is a swift death from Jack’s knife!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cNjyoS0jGCtqvtURw36qtdlXoaK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:116907'),
  ('120500565532216134', 'Violet Evergarden', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yui Ishikawa, Daisuke Namikawa, Takehito Koyasu, Aya Endo, Haruka Tomatsu, Koki Uchiyama, Minori Chihara', 'TV-14', 'The war is over, and Violet Evergarden needs a job. Scarred and emotionless, she takes a job as a letter writer to understand herself and her past.', 'The war is over, and Violet Evergarden needs a job. Scarred and emotionless, she takes a job as a letter writer to understand herself and her past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61EwFPqc0r1uJo6la49J55F8bQ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:75214'),
  ('872607313801902528', 'Violet like the sea', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Francesco Vicario, Francesco Arlanch, Elena Bucaccio', null, 'Francesca Chillemi, Can Yaman, Antonino Bruschetta, Giovanni Scifoni, Giovanni Nasta, Chiara Tron, Lorenzo Scalzo, Alice Arcuri', null, 'Viola Vitale, Miss Italy and fashion journalist, returns to Sicily to look for her father. She starts working for a digital news company and joins police inspector Francesco Demir in solving crime with the help of synesthesia.', 'Viola Vitale, Miss Italy and fashion journalist, returns to Sicily to look for her father. She starts working for a digital news company and joins police inspector Francesco Demir in solving crime with the help of synesthesia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmGnTDwQxcL9y8NuX8XNF0ZDizp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:208878'),
  ('820584683224370511', 'Violetta', 2012, 'Family, Drama, Comedy, Soap', 'Víctor Tevah', 'Sebastián Parrotta, Solange Keoleyan', 'TINI, Jorge Blanco, Diego Dominguez, Mercedes Lambre, Diego Ramos, Clara Alonso, Lodovica Comello, Candelaria Molfese', 'NR', 'A musically talented teenager returns to her native Buenos Aires with her father, Herman, after living in Europe for several years, navigating the trials and tribulations of growing up.', 'A musically talented teenager returns to her native Buenos Aires with her father, Herman, after living in Europe for several years, navigating the trials and tribulations of growing up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3MUGJeKakAZwQa7lNJxTP1pJmD.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61720'),
  ('558177656021986471', 'VIP', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Hye Won, Lee Ok-gyu, Lee Jeong-lim', null, 'Jang Na-ra, Lee Sang-yun, Lee Jae-won, Shin Jae-ha, Lee Chung-ah, Kwak Sun-young, Jung Jun-won, Pyo Ye-jin', null, 'The staff in charge of catering to the desires of a department store''s top clientele try to keep their not-so-luxurious personal lives afloat.', 'The staff in charge of catering to the desires of a department store''s top clientele try to keep their not-so-luxurious personal lives afloat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBIiRnCVOifc1eaW7sCbJHSWJ68.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94642'),
  ('417770255617308366', 'Viper', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', null, 'James McCaffrey, Heather Medway, Joe Nipote, J. Downing', null, 'Viper is an action-adventure TV series about a special task force set up by the federal government to fight crime in the fictional city of Metro City, California that is perpetually under siege from one crime wave after another. The weapon used by this task force is an assault vehicle that masquerades as a Dodge Viper RT/10 roadster and coupe. The series takes place in "the near future". The primary brand of vehicles driven in the show were Chrysler or subsidiary companies. The Viper Defender "star car" was designed by Chrysler Corporation engineers. The exterior design of the car was produced by Chrysler stylist Steve Ferrerio.', 'Viper is an action-adventure TV series about a special task force set up by the federal government to fight crime in the fictional city of Metro City, California that is perpetually under siege from one crime wave after another. The weapon used by this task force is an assault vehicle that masquerades as a Dodge Viper RT/10 roadster and coupe. The series takes place in "the near future". The primary brand of vehicles driven in the show were Chrysler or subsidiary companies. The Viper Defender "star car" was designed by Chrysler Corporation engineers. The exterior design of the car was produced by Chrysler stylist Steve Ferrerio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBNq9usIgXBhUw4jgHpetSvSZKp.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:4636'),
  ('874561871122472015', 'Viral Hit', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Comedy', null, null, 'Satoshi Niwa, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Fairouz Ai, Yui Ishikawa, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Kaito Ishikawa, Yoshino Aoyama, Yuichi Nakamura', 'TV-14', 'Scrawny high school student Hobin Yu is probably the last guy you''d expect to star in a NewTube channel that revolves around fighting. But after following some advice from a mysterious NewTube channel, Hobin is soon knocking out guys stronger than him and raking in more money than he could have ever dreamed of. Can Hobin keep this up, or will he eventually meet his match?', 'Scrawny high school student Hobin Yu is probably the last guy you''d expect to star in a NewTube channel that revolves around fighting. But after following some advice from a mysterious NewTube channel, Hobin is soon knocking out guys stronger than him and raking in more money than he could have ever dreamed of. Can Hobin keep this up, or will he eventually meet his match?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kZBsmNYgjRxFPBfrFxkQGwS7xX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:246029'),
  ('493016086422442619', 'Virdee', 2025, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Amit Dhand', null, 'Staz Nair, Aysha Kala, Nina Singh, Vikash Bhai, Kulvinder Ghir, Sudha Bhuchar, Elizabeth Berrington, Danyal Ismail', null, 'A Bradford cop with his personal life in chaos must hunt down a killer targeting the Asian community.', 'A Bradford cop with his personal life in chaos must hunt down a killer targeting the Asian community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YX79HXdtDdGx2VUb1BQsx7vNhs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233325'),
  ('544517327838635602', 'Virgin River', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sue Tenney', null, 'Alexandra Breckenridge, Martin Henderson, Colin Lawrence, Benjamin Hollingsworth, Lauren Hammersley', 'TV-14', 'After seeing an ad for a midwife, a recently divorced big-city nurse moves to the redwood forests of California, where she meets an intriguing man.', 'After seeing an ad for a midwife, a recently divorced big-city nurse moves to the redwood forests of California, where she meets an intriguing man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHEqfmSWR4Ex4V4AJyUn8HGHHnt.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:88324'),
  ('190782157389385339', 'Virtua Fighter', 1995, 'Animation', null, null, 'Atsuko Tanaka, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Tetsuya Iwanaga, Maya Okamoto, Naoko Matsui, Shin-ichiro Miki, Yasunori Matsumoto', null, 'Akira Yuki has spent years honing his skills under the guidance of his grandfather. Meanwhile, a nefarious robotics scientist, Eva Durix, desires to create the perfect soldier. Eva kidnaps Sarah Bryant, a close acquaintance of Akira and now he must now fight his way to Sarah to save her.', 'Akira Yuki has spent years honing his skills under the guidance of his grandfather. Meanwhile, a nefarious robotics scientist, Eva Durix, desires to create the perfect soldier. Eva kidnaps Sarah Bryant, a close acquaintance of Akira and now he must now fight his way to Sarah to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2FkPPjwn4OR9eB1fJa6iXEMHJd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20351'),
  ('836910316884513095', 'Virtual Hero: La Serie', 2018, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Rubén Doblas Gundersen', null, 'Rubén Doblas Gundersen, Graciela Molina, Núria Trifol, Juan Carlos Gustems, Elisabet Bargalló, Joël Mulachs', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huDoL86ndIZh0n0aDhoW4e8Px2H.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:82532'),
  ('520586790517225838', 'Virtues of Harmony', 2001, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Au Yiu-Hing, 朱禮和, Kwan Shu-ming', null, 'Nancy Sit Ka-Yin, Johnny Siu Juen Dang, Bernice Liu Bik-Yee, Timmy Hung Tin-Ming, Frankie Lam, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Joyce Chan Yin-Hang, Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung', null, 'Virtues of Harmony is a long-running sitcom from Hong Kong, lasting 322 episodes with two direct seasons. Produced by Tsui Yu On, the sitcom was a TVB production and aired five days a week from September 17, 2001 to December 28, 2002. The series chronicles the comical events and life of the Kam household, a rich family during a prosperous time in the Ming Dynasty of China. The series was inspired by the 2000 TVB comedy drama Colourful Life. Originally planned to be an 150-episode sitcom, an extra 200 episodes were added due to the sitcom''s rating success. After the episode finale, a spin-off sequel, Virtues of Harmony II was released in 2003, as well as a spin-off musical, which starred the same cast.', 'Virtues of Harmony is a long-running sitcom from Hong Kong, lasting 322 episodes with two direct seasons. Produced by Tsui Yu On, the sitcom was a TVB production and aired five days a week from September 17, 2001 to December 28, 2002. The series chronicles the comical events and life of the Kam household, a rich family during a prosperous time in the Ming Dynasty of China. The series was inspired by the 2000 TVB comedy drama Colourful Life. Originally planned to be an 150-episode sitcom, an extra 200 episodes were added due to the sitcom''s rating success. After the episode finale, a spin-off sequel, Virtues of Harmony II was released in 2003, as well as a spin-off musical, which starred the same cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jvHCHnZxhYqVZRqifAnF3a40ZQa.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:3427'),
  ('150875907097981838', 'Virtues of Harmony II', 2003, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Yuk-On Tsui', null, 'Nancy Sit Ka-Yin, Frankie Lam, Michael Tse Tin-Wah, Bonnie Chiu Hok-Yee, Danny Lau Dan, Joyce Chan Yin-Hang, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Louis Yuen Siu-Cheung', null, 'The Virtues of Harmony II is a long-running TVB television series, which follows its first series, Virtues of Harmony, a series set in Ancient China. This new, second series of the Virtues of Harmony is set in Modern Hong Kong.', 'The Virtues of Harmony II is a long-running TVB television series, which follows its first series, Virtues of Harmony, a series set in Ancient China. This new, second series of the Virtues of Harmony is set in Modern Hong Kong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/im3qS74ptAtmu7Tz07cN3xnW7xn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4013'),
  ('627077165157087710', 'Virus Buster Serge', 1997, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Haruna Ikezawa, Keiichi Nanba, Mayumi Izuka, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Shin-ichiro Miki, Ai Orikasa, Akiko Hiramatsu, Hirotaka Suzuoki', null, 'Neo Hong Kong, 2097: The world has changed. Advances in genetic engineering and cybernetics have created an environment full of artificially enhanced humans and intelligent super-computers that operate using biological software. But the same technology that has allowed man & machine to merge has made both susceptible to a new kind of threat - digital viruses capable of controlling their hosts. The last line of defense against this insidious foe is an elite task force known as STAND. Equipped with state-of-the-art armored cybernetic suits known as "variable gears," only this special law-enforcement arm can deal with virus-infected war machines on their own terms.', 'Neo Hong Kong, 2097: The world has changed. Advances in genetic engineering and cybernetics have created an environment full of artificially enhanced humans and intelligent super-computers that operate using biological software. But the same technology that has allowed man & machine to merge has made both susceptible to a new kind of threat - digital viruses capable of controlling their hosts. The last line of defense against this insidious foe is an elite task force known as STAND. Equipped with state-of-the-art armored cybernetic suits known as "variable gears," only this special law-enforcement arm can deal with virus-infected war machines on their own terms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRImkeogvAEppG2lgbEAwkFCKsR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34094'),
  ('1108807391869812059', 'Visible Man', 2017, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Erkan Kolçak Köstendil, Selim Bayraktar, Osman Sonant, Betül Akdeniz, Levent Özdilek, Hakan Bulut', null, 'In a world where being invisible is the norm, fainthearted Kurtulus finds himself in the middle of an explosion that would turn him visible, which set by the villain boss Esref Serif.', 'In a world where being invisible is the norm, fainthearted Kurtulus finds himself in the middle of an explosion that would turn him visible, which set by the villain boss Esref Serif.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHHeLEPk0cFA8HrvBsMVROGsl1s.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71747'),
  ('376418159446603849', 'Visible: Out on Television', 2020, 'Documentary', 'David Bender', null, 'Janet Mock, Margaret Cho, Asia Kate Dillon, Neil Patrick Harris, Lena Waithe, Wanda Sykes, Billy Porter, Joey Soloway', 'TV-MA', 'Explore the history of the American LGBTQ movement through the lens of TV in this five-part docuseries. Combining archival footage with new interviews, the series looks at homophobia, the evolution of LGBTQ characters, and coming out in the TV world.', 'Explore the history of the American LGBTQ movement through the lens of TV in this five-part docuseries. Combining archival footage with new interviews, the series looks at homophobia, the evolution of LGBTQ characters, and coming out in the TV world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJocd94qiar0XGWUZdV6ncsoOOF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97363'),
  ('788783065084999711', 'Visionaries: Knights of the Magical Light', 1987, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', 'Flint Dille', null, 'Jim Cummings, Bernard Erhard, Roscoe Lee Browne, Michael McConnohie, Malachi Throne, Jonathan Harris, Beau Weaver, Hal Rayle', null, 'The planet Prysmos suffers a collapse of its high-tech civilization due to a solar re-alignment. Two groups rise to dominance from the devastation to wage war upon each other. One is controlled by honest and law-abiding people and the other by criminals and villains. Following an open challenge thrown down by the great wizard Merklynn, fourteen surviving knights are granted powers of transformation and magical energy. The groups are now divided between the good Spectral Knights and the evil Darkling Lords. The battle for supremacy begins...', 'The planet Prysmos suffers a collapse of its high-tech civilization due to a solar re-alignment. Two groups rise to dominance from the devastation to wage war upon each other. One is controlled by honest and law-abiding people and the other by criminals and villains. Following an open challenge thrown down by the great wizard Merklynn, fourteen surviving knights are granted powers of transformation and magical energy. The groups are now divided between the good Spectral Knights and the evil Darkling Lords. The battle for supremacy begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5PW1FvjWOFdeRmdXlQpmJZbydBh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35551'),
  ('229190244398406506', 'Visions', 2022, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Jeanne Le Guillou, Bruno Dega', null, 'Louane, Soufiane Guerrab, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Marie-Ange Casta, Léon Durieux, Julien Boisselier, Max Boublil, Robinson Stévenin', null, 'A girl has gone missing from a party in the Provence (South of France). Her nephew sees dead people in his surroundings they give him visions. With a teacher and her man a police inspector they try to solve the missing and deaths.', 'A girl has gone missing from a party in the Provence (South of France). Her nephew sees dead people in his surroundings they give him visions. With a teacher and her man a police inspector they try to solve the missing and deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1VDBjGLQ87uHpZDbF1UBgDKYDs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:200689'),
  ('394212382726052046', 'Visitors', 2022, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Simon Astier', 'Joyce Acker', 'Simon Astier, Florence Loiret Caille, Damien Jouillerot, Vincent Desagnat, Tiphaine Daviot, Grégoire Ludig, Julie Bargeton, David Marsais', 'TV-MA', 'After a mysterious explosion rocks the town of Pointe-Claire, rookie cop Richard Garcia and his ragtag group of friends find themselves entangled in an all-out war between rival alien factions.', 'After a mysterious explosion rocks the town of Pointe-Claire, rookie cop Richard Garcia and his ragtag group of friends find themselves entangled in an all-out war between rival alien factions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYTetO99XH19bEA39KjuYeujuhM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:127987'),
  ('388688252189394001', 'Vissermannen', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:316842'),
  ('184055194253939279', 'Visual Prison', 2021, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Makoto Furukawa, Hiroki Nanami, Shun Horie, Takuya Eguchi, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Takuma Nagatsuka, Shogo Yano', 'TV-14', 'Beautiful immortals have gathered in Harajuku to compete for a grand prize: Immense power! For years now the artists behind worldly culture and music have secretly been vampires, including those who produce Visual Kei. Now, they perform their most beautiful songs in the hallowed grounds of the Prison under the Scarlet Moon.', 'Beautiful immortals have gathered in Harajuku to compete for a grand prize: Immense power! For years now the artists behind worldly culture and music have secretly been vampires, including those who produce Visual Kei. Now, they perform their most beautiful songs in the hallowed grounds of the Prison under the Scarlet Moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMqLjdYSbfQVooNjcbavzNLiA32.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121840'),
  ('476001631207459041', 'Vitória', 2025, 'Drama, Soap', 'Cândida Ribeiro, Rita Roberto', null, 'Cláudia Vieira, Jorge Corrula, Vanessa Giácomo, José Raposo, Luísa Cruz, Afonso Pimentel, Joana Santos, Vicente Gil', null, 'Vitória returns determined to recover her children, Afonso, Matilde, and Francisco, after serving an unjust prison sentence. Her father-in-law, Manuel Mendonça, a powerful and manipulative man, has managed to separate his grandchildren from their mother and will do everything to keep her away from her family. With the help of Jorge, a prestigious lawyer and her first love, Vitória will face the Mendonça empire and fight for what she loves most: her children. Vitória is a story of resilience, courage, and the purest of feelings: a mother''s love.', 'Vitória returns determined to recover her children, Afonso, Matilde, and Francisco, after serving an unjust prison sentence. Her father-in-law, Manuel Mendonça, a powerful and manipulative man, has managed to separate his grandchildren from their mother and will do everything to keep her away from her family. With the help of Jorge, a prestigious lawyer and her first love, Vitória will face the Mendonça empire and fight for what she loves most: her children. Vitória is a story of resilience, courage, and the purest of feelings: a mother''s love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrReJqwC0TwvdNBin9hyplSJNpu.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:285711'),
  ('775548062144541012', 'Viva La Bam', 2003, 'Reality, Comedy, Action & Adventure', 'Bam Margera', null, 'Bam Margera, Ryan Dunn, April Margera, Brandon DiCamillo, Chris Raab, Phil Margera, Vincent Margera, Rake Yohn', null, 'Viva La Bam was an American reality television series that stars Bam Margera and his friends and family. The show was a spin-off from MTV''s Jackass, in which Margera and most of the main cast had appeared. Each episode had a specific theme, mission, or challenge which was normally accomplished by performing pranks, skateboarding, and enlisting the help of friends, relations and experts. Although partly improvised, the show was supported by a greater degree of planning and organization.', 'Viva La Bam was an American reality television series that stars Bam Margera and his friends and family. The show was a spin-off from MTV''s Jackass, in which Margera and most of the main cast had appeared. Each episode had a specific theme, mission, or challenge which was normally accomplished by performing pranks, skateboarding, and enlisting the help of friends, relations and experts. Although partly improvised, the show was supported by a greater degree of planning and organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2187ShssSo0D0yRvUL5vwkIRGCu.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:2293'),
  ('362665206777235216', 'Viva La Romance', 2018, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jin Sha, Sun Chengxiao, Li Chun, Ma Di, Qin Hao, Annie Shizuka Inoh, Yang Sun, 张豆豆', null, 'Viva La Romance (妻子的浪漫旅行) Mango TV produced the Chinese observational reality show, which debuted on August 15, 2018. It depicts celebrity wives on vacation while their husbands observe, comment, and communicate from a studio, with the goal of understanding and emotional expression to heal and improve marriage dynamics.', 'Viva La Romance (妻子的浪漫旅行) Mango TV produced the Chinese observational reality show, which debuted on August 15, 2018. It depicts celebrity wives on vacation while their husbands observe, comment, and communicate from a studio, with the goal of understanding and emotional expression to heal and improve marriage dynamics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m9XejRFOOyL7tQdqaVORI2dfERS.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:97199'),
  ('727950525158459489', 'Vivant', 2023, 'Drama', null, null, 'Masato Sakai, Hiroshi Abe, Fumi Nikaido, Tori Matsuzaka, Kazunari Ninomiya, Koji Yakusho, Ryo Ryusei, Kento Hayashi', 'TV-MA', 'Yusuke Nogi of Ryosho''s Energy Development Division said that 10 times the official down payment was mistakenly sent to GFL, a local infrastructure company involved in a solar energy plant to be built in the Balkan Republic in Central Asia. Suspected of involvement, he heads to the Balkan Republic to collect the difference of $90 million. With the cooperation of his CIA friend Sam, Nogi obtained information that the terrorist al-Zaer had laundered the full amount of the contract money into diamonds and brought it out.', 'Yusuke Nogi of Ryosho''s Energy Development Division said that 10 times the official down payment was mistakenly sent to GFL, a local infrastructure company involved in a solar energy plant to be built in the Balkan Republic in Central Asia. Suspected of involvement, he heads to the Balkan Republic to collect the difference of $90 million. With the cooperation of his CIA friend Sam, Nogi obtained information that the terrorist al-Zaer had laundered the full amount of the contract money into diamonds and brought it out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aut8zs5YypvT5chQUuFhActLkHF.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:218038'),
