  ('23256544894306647', 'VR.5', 1995, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Michael Katleman, Adam Cherry, Jeannine Renshaw', null, 'Lori Singer, Anthony Stewart Head, Michael Easton, Will Patton', null, 'VR.5 is an American television program originally broadcast on the Fox network from March 10, 1995 to May 12, 1995. Ten of its thirteen episodes were aired during its original run. The title of the show refers to the degree of immersion the protagonist experiences in the virtual world.', 'VR.5 is an American television program originally broadcast on the Fox network from March 10, 1995 to May 12, 1995. Ten of its thirteen episodes were aired during its original run. The title of the show refers to the degree of immersion the protagonist experiences in the virtual world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A7Ae3Z5UNyOwciavCHJfH34YfId.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1956'),
