  ('656392052989827316', 'Walk the Prank', 2016, 'Family, Comedy, Reality', 'Adam Small, Trevor Moore', null, 'Cody Veith, Jillian Shea Spaeder, Brandon Severs, Tobie Windham, Bryce Gheisar', 'TV-Y7', 'A team of practical jokesters creates hilarious over-the-top pranks for an online hidden camera show.', 'A team of practical jokesters creates hilarious over-the-top pranks for an online hidden camera show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ktiFsOmDQtnMQdWFqPioyJHDDlj.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68208'),
  ('628433286404642859', 'Walker', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Anna Fricke', null, 'Jared Padalecki, Molly Hagan, Keegan Allen, Violet Brinson, Kale Culley, Coby Bell, Odette Annable, Jeff Pierre', 'TV-14', 'Cordell Walker, a widower and father of two with his own moral code, returns home to Austin after being undercover for two years, only to discover there''s harder work to be done at home.', 'Cordell Walker, a widower and father of two with his own moral code, returns home to Austin after being undercover for two years, only to discover there''s harder work to be done at home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uW1W9q0zKPzPdRwIcL3eCDJsfw.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99121'),
  ('451212780211517105', 'Walker Independence', 2022, 'Western, Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Katherine McNamara, Matt Barr, Katie Findlay, Justin Johnson Cortez, Greg Hovanessian, Philemon Chambers, Lawrence Kao, Gabriella Quezada', null, 'Set in the late 1800s, this origin story follows Abby Walker, an affluent Bostonian whose husband is murdered before her eyes while on their journey out West, as she crosses paths with Hoyt Rawlins, a lovable rogue in search of purpose. Abby and Hoyt''s journey takes them to Independence, Texas, a small town with a big future.', 'Set in the late 1800s, this origin story follows Abby Walker, an affluent Bostonian whose husband is murdered before her eyes while on their journey out West, as she crosses paths with Hoyt Rawlins, a lovable rogue in search of purpose. Abby and Hoyt''s journey takes them to Independence, Texas, a small town with a big future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0sgBHsLs0dgC1uYXtxvbZ8eywP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201877'),
  ('45671527127515387', 'Walker, Texas Ranger', 1993, 'Drama, Western, Crime', 'Albert S. Ruddy, Paul Haggis', null, 'Chuck Norris, Clarence Gilyard Jr., Sheree J. Wilson, Judson Mills, Nia Peeples', 'TV-PG', 'Modern-day Texas Ranger, Cordell Walker''s independent crime-solving methods have their roots in the rugged traditions of the Old West. Walker''s closest friend is former Ranger, C.D. Parker, who retired after a knee injury, and now owns "C.D.''s," a Country/Western saloon/restaurant. Rookie Ranger, James "Jimmy" Trivette is an ex-football player who bases his crime-solving methods on reason and uses computers and cellular phones. Alex Cahill is the Assistant DA who shares a mutual attraction with Walker, but often disagrees with his unorthodox approach to law enforcement.', 'Modern-day Texas Ranger, Cordell Walker''s independent crime-solving methods have their roots in the rugged traditions of the Old West. Walker''s closest friend is former Ranger, C.D. Parker, who retired after a knee injury, and now owns "C.D.''s," a Country/Western saloon/restaurant. Rookie Ranger, James "Jimmy" Trivette is an ex-football player who bases his crime-solving methods on reason and uses computers and cellular phones. Alex Cahill is the Assistant DA who shares a mutual attraction with Walker, but often disagrees with his unorthodox approach to law enforcement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lldKpGEOlHJXMkb1pi7s7xCExmX.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:3772'),
  ('779882796543606811', 'Walking on Clouds', 1999, 'Soap, Comedy', 'Euclydes Marinho', 'Letícia Dornelles, Vinícius Vianna, Elizabeth Jhin', 'Marco Nanini, Susana Vieira, Cláudio Marzo, Débora Bloch, Marcos Palmeira, Vivianne Pasmanter, Marcello Novaes, Márcio Garcia', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AzB173IsIJzwmQn8Kgo4ExerMa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45761'),
  ('898884197556843092', 'Walking on the Blade', 2014, 'Drama', null, null, 'Huang Bo, Yuan Quan, Ni Dahong, Sun Jian, Pan Zhilin, Zhang Chenghe, Zheng Qingwen, Li Zhu', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eWyVoT61RELnXCHBPv2rqTfe6vX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114224'),
  ('320521108093522374', 'Walking on Thin Ice', 2025, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', null, 'Jeon Yeong-shin', 'Lee Young-ae, Kim Young-kwang, Park Yong-woo, Lee Soo-bin, Jo Yeon-hee, Hwang Jae-yeol, Do Sang-woo, Won Hyun-jun', null, 'Eun-soo is a housewife, who struggles to pay for her husband''s medical expenses. He is terminally ill. Eun-soo becomes entangled in a bag of drugs with a teacher named Yi-kyeong. He is a mysterious figure. Eun-soo and Yi-kyeong are chased by veteran detective Tae-gu.', 'Eun-soo is a housewife, who struggles to pay for her husband''s medical expenses. He is terminally ill. Eun-soo becomes entangled in a bag of drugs with a teacher named Yi-kyeong. He is a mysterious figure. Eun-soo and Yi-kyeong are chased by veteran detective Tae-gu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1ayYBVKw63GxU9npXQtNjHY81C.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:232557'),
  ('1104437195191006494', 'Walking the Way All Alone', 2026, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, null, null, 'Luo Li was born and raised in the spiritless land of the Silver Continent, where he rose to become the top assassin of the Tianjue Killing Hall. At the cost of his own life, his father, Master Ciyun, secures a slim chance of survival for him—allowing Luo Li to escape Silver Continent and set out for the Central World. There, he will seek the true path of cultivation… and the destiny that awaits him.[大道独行之蝶龙变-Bstation]', 'Luo Li was born and raised in the spiritless land of the Silver Continent, where he rose to become the top assassin of the Tianjue Killing Hall. At the cost of his own life, his father, Master Ciyun, secures a slim chance of survival for him—allowing Luo Li to escape Silver Continent and set out for the Central World. There, he will seek the true path of cultivation… and the destiny that awaits him.[大道独行之蝶龙变-Bstation]', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgrVf9iv1NFYYgPN7YH4W7Z89NG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:317320'),
  ('15863495255392426', 'Walking with Beasts', 2001, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Tim Haines', null, 'Kenneth Branagh, Stockard Channing', 'TV-14', 'Walking With Prehistoric Beasts explores how life on earth first began. Using real footage, the series goes inside the body of our monster ancestors. For the first time, morphing technology is used to reveal how our ancestors evolved.', 'Walking With Prehistoric Beasts explores how life on earth first began. Using real footage, the series goes inside the body of our monster ancestors. For the first time, morphing technology is used to reveal how our ancestors evolved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eYg3iV5T4X08BUBq8wyruTMFk1b.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:1294'),
  ('1111981548987022425', 'Walking with Dinosaurs', 1999, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Tim Haines', 'Georgann Kane', 'Kenneth Branagh', 'TV-14', 'Combining fact and informed speculation with cutting-edge computer graphics and animatronics effects, the series set out to create the most accurate portrayal of prehistoric animals ever seen on the screen.', 'Combining fact and informed speculation with cutting-edge computer graphics and animatronics effects, the series set out to create the most accurate portrayal of prehistoric animals ever seen on the screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1hQdzQvOeZN84N8FTYTcS1YZ8S.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3557'),
  ('958259911665448336', 'Walking with Dinosaurs', 2025, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Bertie Carvel', null, 'Each episode tells the dramatic story of an individual dinosaur whose remains are currently being unearthed by world-leading dinosaur hunters. As the dinosaurs'' bones emerge from the ground, their prehistoric stories are brought to life with state-of-the-art visual effects - making each episode a gripping dinosaur drama based on the very latest evidence.', 'Each episode tells the dramatic story of an individual dinosaur whose remains are currently being unearthed by world-leading dinosaur hunters. As the dinosaurs'' bones emerge from the ground, their prehistoric stories are brought to life with state-of-the-art visual effects - making each episode a gripping dinosaur drama based on the very latest evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWO7ncTLgXsHQWqMNzfpgdvQRBN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:256924'),
  ('222052248833788937', 'Walking with Monsters', 2005, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Chloë Leland', null, 'Kenneth Branagh', 'NR', 'A three-part British documentary film series about life in the Paleozoic, bringing to life extinct arthropods, fish, amphibians, synapsids, and reptiles. Narrated by Kenneth Branagh and using state-of-the-art visual effects, this prequel to Walking with Dinosaurs shows nearly 300 million years of Paleozoic history, from the Cambrian Period (530 million years ago) to the Early Triassic Period (248 million years ago).', 'A three-part British documentary film series about life in the Paleozoic, bringing to life extinct arthropods, fish, amphibians, synapsids, and reptiles. Narrated by Kenneth Branagh and using state-of-the-art visual effects, this prequel to Walking with Dinosaurs shows nearly 300 million years of Paleozoic history, from the Cambrian Period (530 million years ago) to the Early Triassic Period (248 million years ago).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2EtIcPc4SY34dnP3G0u9uLghLU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4971'),
  ('670522744234707225', 'Walkure Romanze', 2013, 'Animation', null, null, 'Ai Shimizu, Kei Mizusawa, Eriko Nakamura, Hitomi Nabatame, Seiichiro Yamashita, Hiroko Taguchi', null, 'Horses dashing gallantly... Knights challenging their own limits... Magnificent, heroic battles highlight the horseback lance sport of jousting. One of the many people fascinated by this proud sport, Takahiro Mizuno, acts as a begleiter (an assistant) to jousting knights as he lives his rather tedious life at Winford Academy.', 'Horses dashing gallantly... Knights challenging their own limits... Magnificent, heroic battles highlight the horseback lance sport of jousting. One of the many people fascinated by this proud sport, Takahiro Mizuno, acts as a begleiter (an assistant) to jousting knights as he lives his rather tedious life at Winford Academy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isTY8Zdxcp1ruYW2uxh213LmcO1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60868'),
  ('970000816851865672', 'Wallace & Gromit''s Cracking Contraptions', 2002, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Nick Park', null, 'Peter Sallis', 'NR', 'A look at some of Wallace''s labour-saving mechanical marvels that rarely work as planned. Having problems getting to sleep? Then try the Snoozatron – it plumps your pillows, plays you soothing music and deposits a teddy into your arms. Or how about taking the strain out of mealtimes with the help of the Autochef, a robot that will cook your eggs just how you like them. Or perhaps you might like to try the Christmas Cardomatic, an ingenious way to create a very unique greetings card!', 'A look at some of Wallace''s labour-saving mechanical marvels that rarely work as planned. Having problems getting to sleep? Then try the Snoozatron – it plumps your pillows, plays you soothing music and deposits a teddy into your arms. Or how about taking the strain out of mealtimes with the help of the Autochef, a robot that will cook your eggs just how you like them. Or perhaps you might like to try the Christmas Cardomatic, an ingenious way to create a very unique greetings card!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vpEk64myGeCCCmnG7r9EiBymfZt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80616'),
  ('572407540381763018', 'Wallace & Gromit''s World of Invention', 2010, 'Animation, Documentary, Comedy', null, 'John Sparkes, Richard Hansom, Alex Pascall', 'Peter Sallis, Ashley Jensen, John Sparkes, Jem Stansfield', 'NR', 'In the series, "Wallace will take a light hearted and humorous look at the real-life inventors, contraptions, gadgets and inventions, with the silent help of Gromit. The series aims to inspire a whole new generation of innovative minds by showing them real, but mind-boggling, machines and inventions from around the world that have influenced his illustrious inventing career" (the BBC press statement). Peter Sallis reprised his role as the voice of Wallace. The filmed inserts are mostly narrated by Ashley Jensen, with one in each episode presented in-vision by Jem Stansfield. John Sparkes also voices a portion in the unseen character of archivist Goronwy.', 'In the series, "Wallace will take a light hearted and humorous look at the real-life inventors, contraptions, gadgets and inventions, with the silent help of Gromit. The series aims to inspire a whole new generation of innovative minds by showing them real, but mind-boggling, machines and inventions from around the world that have influenced his illustrious inventing career" (the BBC press statement). Peter Sallis reprised his role as the voice of Wallace. The filmed inserts are mostly narrated by Ashley Jensen, with one in each episode presented in-vision by Jem Stansfield. John Sparkes also voices a portion in the unseen character of archivist Goronwy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iBGaR6hmCo70w1fiVhQoVcK2DPY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30873'),
  ('358660852509381725', 'Wallander', 2005, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Henning Mankell', null, 'Krister Henriksson, Charlotta Jonsson, Signe Dahlkvist, Mats Bergman, Fredrik Gunnarsson, Douglas Johansson', 'TV-MA', 'Wallander is a Swedish television series adapted from Henning Mankell''s Kurt Wallander novels and starring Krister Henriksson in the title role. The 1st series of 13 films was produced in 2005 and 2006, with one taken directly from a novel and the remainder with new storylines suggested by Mankell. The 2nd series of 13 films was shown between 2009 and 2010. The stories are set in Ystad near the southern tip of Sweden. The three films Before the Frost, Mastermind, and The Secret were premiered in cinemas, with the rest first released as direct-to-DVD movies. The first episode of the second series, Hämnden, was released in Swedish cinemas in January 2009; the rest of the series was made for television. The BBC aired all 26 episodes of the Swedish television versions on BBC Four. A third and final season, containing six 90 minute episodes, will air in 2013 with Charlotta Jonsson as Linda Wallander. The first episode, adapted from the novel The Troubled Man, was released in cinemas in January 2013.', 'Wallander is a Swedish television series adapted from Henning Mankell''s Kurt Wallander novels and starring Krister Henriksson in the title role. The 1st series of 13 films was produced in 2005 and 2006, with one taken directly from a novel and the remainder with new storylines suggested by Mankell. The 2nd series of 13 films was shown between 2009 and 2010. The stories are set in Ystad near the southern tip of Sweden. The three films Before the Frost, Mastermind, and The Secret were premiered in cinemas, with the rest first released as direct-to-DVD movies. The first episode of the second series, Hämnden, was released in Swedish cinemas in January 2009; the rest of the series was made for television. The BBC aired all 26 episodes of the Swedish television versions on BBC Four. A third and final season, containing six 90 minute episodes, will air in 2013 with Charlotta Jonsson as Linda Wallander. The first episode, adapted from the novel The Troubled Man, was released in cinemas in January 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTyD5mKW6Id4vb7qQN5D81s6waX.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:31766'),
  ('899521675926453291', 'Wallander', 2008, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Henning Mankell', 'Henning Mankell', 'Kenneth Branagh, Jeany Spark', null, 'This drama follows Inspector Kurt Wallander – a middle-aged everyman – as he struggles against a rising tide of violence in the apparently sleepy backwaters in and around Ystad in Skane, southern Sweden. Based on the international best-selling books by Henning Mankell.', 'This drama follows Inspector Kurt Wallander – a middle-aged everyman – as he struggles against a rising tide of violence in the apparently sleepy backwaters in and around Ystad in Skane, southern Sweden. Based on the international best-selling books by Henning Mankell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK5jgSqoOfKwNG0WwrFObmIq0YJ.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:7263'),
  ('302398178217814585', 'Wallander: Sidetracked', 2001, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Henning Mankell, Leif Magnusson', 'Rolf Lassgård, Henrik Persson, Siw Erixon, Christer Fant, Lars Melin, Klas-Gösta Olsson, Kerstin Andersson, Jenny Rudell', null, 'It is autumn and the people in the otherwise peaceful small town Ystad settle down. But for Kurt Wallander broken idyll of a young woman burned to death in a cornfield. Soon after hitting a serial killer with a series of increasingly brutal murder. What is the relationship between a retired attorney general, a successful art dealer and an ordinary petty thief? Why scalp killer his victims?', 'It is autumn and the people in the otherwise peaceful small town Ystad settle down. But for Kurt Wallander broken idyll of a young woman burned to death in a cornfield. Soon after hitting a serial killer with a series of increasingly brutal murder. What is the relationship between a retired attorney general, a successful art dealer and an ordinary petty thief? Why scalp killer his victims?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kN9iMw8wXw1cFzIjWYqkx8Gnn5L.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73637'),
  ('444594614677169110', 'Walt Disney Animation Studios: Short Circuit Experimental Films', 2020, 'Animation, Family', null, null, null, 'TV-PG', 'If you could tell any story with the team of talented artists at Walt Disney Animation Studios, what would you create? Welcome to Short Circuit, an experimental, innovative program where anyone at the Studio can pitch an idea and get selected to create their own short film.', 'If you could tell any story with the team of talented artists at Walt Disney Animation Studios, what would you create? Welcome to Short Circuit, an experimental, innovative program where anyone at the Studio can pitch an idea and get selected to create their own short film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNVDjUN5NIlWtVAJnw5U40Bepig.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:98566'),
  ('639186658709804266', 'Wandance', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Koki Uchiyama, Hina Youmiya', 'TV-PG', 'Kabo is a high school student with a stutter who struggles to express his feelings. He finds himself drawn to his classmate Wanda, who pursues dance without worrying about how others see her. Seeking a form of freestyle expression, Kabo takes on the unfamiliar world of dance.', 'Kabo is a high school student with a stutter who struggles to express his feelings. He finds himself drawn to his classmate Wanda, who pursues dance without worrying about how others see her. Seeking a form of freestyle expression, Kabo takes on the unfamiliar world of dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tb09vxLJ5yf7pMbmWqRvWE6bL5y.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262259'),
  ('1113717303819610515', 'WandaVision', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Jac Schaeffer', null, 'Elizabeth Olsen, Paul Bettany, Kathryn Hahn, Teyonah Parris, Randall Park, Kat Dennings', 'TV-14', 'Wanda Maximoff and Vision—two super-powered beings living idealized suburban lives—begin to suspect that everything is not as it seems.', 'Wanda Maximoff and Vision—two super-powered beings living idealized suburban lives—begin to suspect that everything is not as it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frobUz2X5Pc8OiVZU8Oo5K3NKMM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85271'),
  ('91557962190988291', 'Wandee Goodday', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nottakorn', null, 'Sapol Assawamunkong, Sarin Ronnakiat, Thinnaphan Tantui, Nattanon Tongsaeng, Patchatorn Thanawat, Suphakorn Sriphotong, Sattabut Laedeke, Apirak Chaipanha', null, 'Because of a broken heart and drunkenness, Dr. Wandee goes from darling to daring, entangling himself with Muay Thai fighter Yoryak Phadetseuk. A one-night stand somehow turns into a fake boyfriends with benefits relationship.', 'Because of a broken heart and drunkenness, Dr. Wandee goes from darling to daring, entangling himself with Muay Thai fighter Yoryak Phadetseuk. A one-night stand somehow turns into a fake boyfriends with benefits relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paqFs0PdOK2XLi289so8fuPLydE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:237337'),
  ('79274831983424284', 'Wander Over Yonder', 2013, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Craig McCracken, Joe Pitt', null, 'Jack McBrayer, April Winchell, Keith Ferguson, Tom Kenny, Noël Wells', 'TV-Y7', 'The adventures of Wander, an eternally-optimistic intergalactic traveler and constant do-gooder, and his quick-tempered but loyal steed and best friend, Sylvia. The friendliest face in outer space, Wander journeys across the galaxies to spread good cheer and to help anyone he can — much to his overly pragmatic stallion’s chagrin. Their fun-loving escapades often lead them to clash with the evil villain Lord Hater and his army of Watchdogs, who travel from planet to planet trying to make hate the order of the day. Together, the best friends travel through the cosmos, happening upon one freewheeling adventure after another and making new friends and foes.', 'The adventures of Wander, an eternally-optimistic intergalactic traveler and constant do-gooder, and his quick-tempered but loyal steed and best friend, Sylvia. The friendliest face in outer space, Wander journeys across the galaxies to spread good cheer and to help anyone he can — much to his overly pragmatic stallion’s chagrin. Their fun-loving escapades often lead them to clash with the evil villain Lord Hater and his army of Watchdogs, who travel from planet to planet trying to make hate the order of the day. Together, the best friends travel through the cosmos, happening upon one freewheeling adventure after another and making new friends and foes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ow88KmFUXMb6S4EKOWyTBy8ta7O.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45013'),
  ('729779737629030048', 'Wandering Son', 2011, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Kousuke Hatakeyama, Asami Seto, Yoshino Nanjo, Saeko Chiba, Aki Toyosaki, Yui Horie, Nana Mizuki, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka', null, 'Shuichi Nitori transfers to a new elementary school, and there, meets Yoshino Takatsuki. The two children discover they share a similar secret.', 'Shuichi Nitori transfers to a new elementary school, and there, meets Yoshino Takatsuki. The two children discover they share a similar secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eh46V76Xn0aVJvc9i7l3ELSCQg1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43926'),
  ('814633836734899012', 'Wandering Witch: The Journey of Elaina', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Kana Hanazawa, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Miho Okasaki, Konomi Kohara, Yoko Hikasa', 'TV-14', 'Once upon a time, there was a witch named Elaina. Inspired by her favorite book, Elaina ventures out to see the world she''s read so much about. Like a leaf on the wind, she travels from one country to another, looking to sate her inquisitiveness and searching for new experiences. Exploration and curiosity drive her journey. She''s confronted by humanity in all its forms, whether strange, bizarre, or emotional and with each meeting, Elaina would become a small part of their story, and her own world would get a little bit bigger.', 'Once upon a time, there was a witch named Elaina. Inspired by her favorite book, Elaina ventures out to see the world she''s read so much about. Like a leaf on the wind, she travels from one country to another, looking to sate her inquisitiveness and searching for new experiences. Exploration and curiosity drive her journey. She''s confronted by humanity in all its forms, whether strange, bizarre, or emotional and with each meeting, Elaina would become a small part of their story, and her own world would get a little bit bigger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gR0qwFa17c6xHnIauHrpgRJKiaH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:94693'),
  ('841681521477950110', 'Wanderlust', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Nick Payne', null, 'Toni Collette, Steven Mackintosh, Joe Hurst, Emma D''Arcy', 'TV-MA', 'Joy Richards is a therapist trying to find a way to keep the spark with her husband, Alan, after a cycling accident causes her to reassess their relationship. As family, friends, neighbours and clients live their lives, stories of love, lust and forbidden desire emerge.', 'Joy Richards is a therapist trying to find a way to keep the spark with her husband, Alan, after a cycling accident causes her to reassess their relationship. As family, friends, neighbours and clients live their lives, stories of love, lust and forbidden desire emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w62IHw1uF90d9VrK6pvgGHNZhPj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:81902'),
  ('949071995065867323', 'Wanna Be the Strongest in the World', 2013, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayana Taketatsu, Rina Sato, Hisako Kanemoto, Sora Amamiya, Sora Tokui, Fumihiko Tachiki, Chiaki Takahashi, Nobuhiko Okamoto', null, 'Sakura Hagiwara, the main vocalist of the nationally renowned idol group Sweet Diva, suddenly decides to become a female professional wrestler.', 'Sakura Hagiwara, the main vocalist of the nationally renowned idol group Sweet Diva, suddenly decides to become a female professional wrestler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YaxVSLtXRH9qZjF4JIXML0PNDG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:76721'),
  ('537545999219298674', 'Wannous', 2016, 'Drama', 'Shady El-Fakharany', 'Abdul Rahim Kamal', 'Yehia El Fakharany, Nabil Al Helfawi, Hala Sedki, Nicolas Mouawad, Hanan Motawie, Mohamed Shaheen, Mahmoud Hegazy, Mohamed Kelany', null, 'Yaqut, a father, leaves his wife and kids and disappears for 20 years. The Devil, Wanoos, then visits his family, pretending to be their father''s friend, and tells them that he and their father have made millions. A conflict between the children and their mother ensues, and they need to choose between going back to their father and his money, or keeping things the way they are.', 'Yaqut, a father, leaves his wife and kids and disappears for 20 years. The Devil, Wanoos, then visits his family, pretending to be their father''s friend, and tells them that he and their father have made millions. A conflict between the children and their mother ensues, and they need to choose between going back to their father and his money, or keeping things the way they are.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdWyuANiZFetsmV3bFBNUO0pgdj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68015'),
  ('64181554789962828', 'Wanted', 2005, 'Drama', 'Jorge Zamacona', null, 'Gary Cole, Ryan Hurst, Benjamín Benítez, Rashida Jones, Lee Tergesen, Josey Scott', 'TV-MA', 'An elite multi-agency taskforce tracks down Los Angeles''s 100 most wanted fugitives as they struggle to balance their work and personal lives.', 'An elite multi-agency taskforce tracks down Los Angeles''s 100 most wanted fugitives as they struggle to balance their work and personal lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTpvMvHq9H3MDwGoYe706Xt6p6M.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:10388'),
  ('877485591558543463', 'Wanted', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Richard Bell, Rebecca Gibney', null, 'Rebecca Gibney, Geraldine Hakewill, Robyn Malcolm, Kate Box, Paul Gleeson', 'TV-14', 'Two complete strangers, Lola and Chelsea, intervene in a fatal carjacking while waiting at a suburban bus stop, and are subsequently thrust into a chase from authorities across Australia with a vehicle filled with cash. The strangers must rely solely on each other while on the run.', 'Two complete strangers, Lola and Chelsea, intervene in a fatal carjacking while waiting at a suburban bus stop, and are subsequently thrust into a chase from authorities across Australia with a vehicle filled with cash. The strangers must rely solely on each other while on the run.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPQehJH5k3hKHbWSe11ulmaUW3V.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:65628'),
  ('718964816580549362', 'Wanted: Dead or Alive', 1958, 'Western, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Steve McQueen', 'TV-G', 'Wanted: Dead or Alive is an American Western television series starring Steve McQueen as the bounty hunter Josh Randall. It aired on CBS for three seasons from 1958–61. The black-and-white program was a spin-off of a March 1958 episode of Trackdown, a 1957–59 western series starring Robert Culp. Both series were produced by Four Star Television in association with CBS Television. The series launched McQueen into becoming the first television star to cross over into comparable status on the big screen.', 'Wanted: Dead or Alive is an American Western television series starring Steve McQueen as the bounty hunter Josh Randall. It aired on CBS for three seasons from 1958–61. The black-and-white program was a spin-off of a March 1958 episode of Trackdown, a 1957–59 western series starring Robert Culp. Both series were produced by Four Star Television in association with CBS Television. The series launched McQueen into becoming the first television star to cross over into comparable status on the big screen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mYgwFT8JXW6J5YTs8DuzDDOKXlS.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:13837'),
  ('103947063225084981', 'Wanted: The Escape of Carlos Ghosn', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Carlos Ghosn', 'TV-14', 'The riveting story of CEO-turned-fugitive Carlos Ghosn, including his reign of power, shocking arrest, and calculated getaway that stunned the world.', 'The riveting story of CEO-turned-fugitive Carlos Ghosn, including his reign of power, shocking arrest, and calculated getaway that stunned the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2edG1gG9BxbvuDNn2nSJazUjX66.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231319'),
  ('185475193184503160', 'WaPo Bodensee', 2017, 'Crime', null, null, 'Floriane Daniel, Diana Körner, Noah Calvin, Simon Werdelis, Wendy Güntensperger, Tim Wilde', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHqNZ1R2nanme7z7uyxyHb9lqI9.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:69751'),
  ('1110800766305548326', 'War and Beauty', 2004, 'Drama', 'Jonathan Ki-Yee Chik', null, 'Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee, Charmaine Sheh Sze-Man, Gigi Lai Chi, Sheren Tang Shui-Man, Bowie Lam Bo-Yee, Moses Chan Ho, Jade Leung Tsang, Rebecca Chan', null, 'Fifteen years after Qing Emperor Jiaqing was crowned the country appears to be in harmony. However, fights between the imperial concubines escalate. All the imperial concubines including the emperor''s beloved Yu-Yue understand this and becomes nervous when the triennial imperial concubine election approaches. Yu-Yue''s position is threatened by an imperial descendant, Yuk-ying, a powerful eunuch''s adopted daughter, Yi-Sun, and an experienced imperial servant maid On-Seen. They are friends and enemies in the war for the emperor''s love. The four beautiful women are either friends or lovers of an imperial physician Sun Bak Yeung and a trooper Kong-Wu. Plots and lies undermine their love and friendships in the palace.', 'Fifteen years after Qing Emperor Jiaqing was crowned the country appears to be in harmony. However, fights between the imperial concubines escalate. All the imperial concubines including the emperor''s beloved Yu-Yue understand this and becomes nervous when the triennial imperial concubine election approaches. Yu-Yue''s position is threatened by an imperial descendant, Yuk-ying, a powerful eunuch''s adopted daughter, Yi-Sun, and an experienced imperial servant maid On-Seen. They are friends and enemies in the war for the emperor''s love. The four beautiful women are either friends or lovers of an imperial physician Sun Bak Yeung and a trooper Kong-Wu. Plots and lies undermine their love and friendships in the palace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zzD8jGmi9dXI4Y3GAGG1BkpPq7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36562'),
  ('1039187939536985309', 'War and Peace', 2007, 'Drama', 'Leo Tolstoy, Enrico Medioli, Gavin Scott', null, 'Alexander Beyer, Clémence Poésy, Alessio Boni, Malcolm McDowell, Valentina Cervi, Brenda Blethyn, Hannelore Elsner, Dmitriy Isaev', 'NR', 'War and Peace is a 2007 television miniseries broadcast in Belgium and in France in four episodes during October and November 2007. An international co-production of France, Italy and Russia, the ensemble cast are of various nationalities. The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'War and Peace is a 2007 television miniseries broadcast in Belgium and in France in four episodes during October and November 2007. An international co-production of France, Italy and Russia, the ensemble cast are of various nationalities. The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QTiqjGxq6SGXV8BDUofcSo7Owh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35486'),
  ('988258442474905479', 'War and Peace', 2016, 'Drama', null, null, 'Paul Dano, Lily James, James Norton, Gillian Anderson, Jessie Buckley, Aneurin Barnard, Greta Scacchi, Aisling Loftus', 'TV-14', 'The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'The love story of young Countess Natasha Rostova and Count Pierre Bezukhov is interwoven with the Great Patriotic War of 1812 against Napoleon''s invading army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9uqJMuJXTlqgHrzmMjzhUsw7nI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64099'),
  ('138897379835124340', 'War and Remembrance', 1988, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Herman Wouk', 'Dan Curtis, Earl W. Wallace', 'Robert Mitchum, Victoria Tennant, David Dukes, Zevi Wolmark, Robert Hardy, John Gielgud, Steven Berkoff, Robert Morley', 'TV-14', 'Following the attack on Pearl Harbor, the extended Henry and the Jastrow families experience World War II.', 'Following the attack on Pearl Harbor, the extended Henry and the Jastrow families experience World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3EkF2C1R4rOzckdPrZ3BarZJo4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:32675'),
  ('267293780991777395', 'War of Faith', 2024, 'Drama', null, 'Weng Liangping', 'Wang Yibo, Li Qin, Wang Yang, Zhang Tianyang, Wang Xueqi, Lan Xiya, Liu Tingzuo, Zhu Tie', null, 'Set in 1928, it tells the story of Wei Ruolai and his determination to courageously pursue his strong aspirations in serving his country. He regarded Shen Tunan, a senior adviser, as his mentor when he was a low-level employee at a financial institution. Through the excellence of his memory and data analysis ability, Wei Ruolai has been favored by Shen Tunan. However, his line of work made him witness the blatant corruption and darkness in the financial field unleashed by the Kuomintang with his own eyes.', 'Set in 1928, it tells the story of Wei Ruolai and his determination to courageously pursue his strong aspirations in serving his country. He regarded Shen Tunan, a senior adviser, as his mentor when he was a low-level employee at a financial institution. Through the excellence of his memory and data analysis ability, Wei Ruolai has been favored by Shen Tunan. However, his line of work made him witness the blatant corruption and darkness in the financial field unleashed by the Kuomintang with his own eyes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEfojxMIcvNIi7pIRskUMb27exV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:240441'),
  ('390199364916889741', 'War of the Century', 1999, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Samuel West', null, 'The War of the Century: When Hitler Fought Stalin, is a BBC documentary film series that examines Adolf Hitler''s invasion of the Soviet Union in 1941 and the no-holds-barred war on both sides. It not only examines the war but also the terror inside the Soviet Union at the time due to the paranoia of Joseph Stalin - the revenge atrocities, the Great Purge of army officers, the near-lunacy orders, and the paranoia of being upstaged by others, especially Marshal Zhukov. The historical adviser is Ian Kershaw.', 'The War of the Century: When Hitler Fought Stalin, is a BBC documentary film series that examines Adolf Hitler''s invasion of the Soviet Union in 1941 and the no-holds-barred war on both sides. It not only examines the war but also the terror inside the Soviet Union at the time due to the paranoia of Joseph Stalin - the revenge atrocities, the Great Purge of army officers, the near-lunacy orders, and the paranoia of being upstaged by others, especially Marshal Zhukov. The historical adviser is Ian Kershaw.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eByaJaHBAfcSULW0c7IzFSMtVOW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20874'),
  ('14395194189453923', 'War of the Genders', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Chui Jing-Hong', null, 'Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Joyce Chan Yin-Hang', null, 'War of the Genders is a Hong Kong sitcom which aired on TVB Jade from 21 February to 7 July 2000. The series was produced by TVB with Tsui Chong-hong serving as the executive producer. An average of 3.1 million viewers watched the episode finale live, creating the highest rating average below the 2003 Charity Football Competition Real Madrid vs Hong Kong and tied with the 2005 Korean TV drama Dae Jang Geum and the 2008 TVB TV drama Moonlight Resonance.', 'War of the Genders is a Hong Kong sitcom which aired on TVB Jade from 21 February to 7 July 2000. The series was produced by TVB with Tsui Chong-hong serving as the executive producer. An average of 3.1 million viewers watched the episode finale live, creating the highest rating average below the 2003 Charity Football Competition Real Madrid vs Hong Kong and tied with the 2005 Korean TV drama Dae Jang Geum and the 2008 TVB TV drama Moonlight Resonance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOnBdZbIhISlYFkvVCp8NLZ9qyL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:6262'),
  ('802569423478572255', 'War of the Kingdoms', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Wolfgang Hohlbein', 'Christoph Fromm', 'Gijs Naber, Jannis Niewöhner, Dominic Marcus Singer, Lilja van der Zwaag, Rosalinde Mynster, Jördis Triebel, Jörg Hartmann, Maria Erwolter', null, 'Burgundy is surrounded by enemies. Siegfried''s arrival sparks new hope, but King Gunther is hatching a dangerous plan. Much to the displeasure of master-at-arms Hagen, who is secretly in love with the king''s daughter Kriemhild.', 'Burgundy is surrounded by enemies. Siegfried''s arrival sparks new hope, but King Gunther is hatching a dangerous plan. Much to the displeasure of master-at-arms Hagen, who is secretly in love with the king''s daughter Kriemhild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCLTUzEAcguv1F9hBsicEViiePg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:304371'),
  ('120834836359816142', 'War of the Worlds', 1988, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Greg Strangis', null, 'Jared Martin, Adrian Paul, Lynda Mason Green, Catherine Disher, Denis Forest', 'TV-PG', 'Humanity must resume its war against the Martians when they revive after decades of hibernation following their defeat in the 1950s. The fate of Earth may very well rest in the hands of a small yet courageous band: astrophysicist Harrison Blackwood, paraplegic computer wizard Norton Drake, microbiologist Suzanne McCullough and military man Paul Ironhorse.', 'Humanity must resume its war against the Martians when they revive after decades of hibernation following their defeat in the 1950s. The fate of Earth may very well rest in the hands of a small yet courageous band: astrophysicist Harrison Blackwood, paraplegic computer wizard Norton Drake, microbiologist Suzanne McCullough and military man Paul Ironhorse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aooe8m3ZHey7WKNdmlllRYeinpa.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:2255'),
  ('673620802621495383', 'War of the Worlds', 2019, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Howard Overman', null, 'Gabriel Byrne, Léa Drucker, Bayo Gbadamosi, Molly Windsor, Ty Tennant, Lizzie Brocheré, Pearl Chanda, Emilie de Preissac', 'TV-14', 'When astronomers detect a transmission from another galaxy, it is definitive proof of intelligent extra-terrestrial life. The world’s population waits for further contact with bated breath. They do not have to wait long. Within days, mankind is all but wiped out by a devastating attack; pockets of humanity are left in an eerily deserted world. As aliens hunt and kill those left alive, the survivors ask a burning question – who are these attackers and why are they hell-bent on our destruction?', 'When astronomers detect a transmission from another galaxy, it is definitive proof of intelligent extra-terrestrial life. The world’s population waits for further contact with bated breath. They do not have to wait long. Within days, mankind is all but wiped out by a devastating attack; pockets of humanity are left in an eerily deserted world. As aliens hunt and kill those left alive, the survivors ask a burning question – who are these attackers and why are they hell-bent on our destruction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yThmbQkxSzW4HHdAaoj8RYHFH3i.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:86374'),
  ('659335753292800887', 'War Sailor', 2023, 'Drama', 'Gunnar Vikene', null, 'Kristoffer Joner, Ine Marie Wilmann, Pål Sverre Hagen', 'TV-MA', 'When WWII erupts, two sailors on a Norwegian merchant ship face brutal conditions as they fight to survive a conflict they were never asked to join. Based on true stories of Norwegian merchant sailors and their families during and after World War II.', 'When WWII erupts, two sailors on a Norwegian merchant ship face brutal conditions as they fight to survive a conflict they were never asked to join. Based on true stories of Norwegian merchant sailors and their families during and after World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CCiotwDl3QVRTEtNfzs6ZBNCUq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:220538'),
  ('745691073238815988', 'Ward Gaat Hard', 2026, null, null, null, 'Ward Lemmelijn', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:316423'),
  ('1142990541261069511', 'Warehouse 13', 2009, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jane Espenson, D. Brent Mote', null, 'Eddie McClintock, Joanne Kelly, Saul Rubinek, Allison Scagliotti, Aaron Ashmore', 'TV-14', 'After saving the life of the President, two secret service agents - Myka Bering and Pete Lattimer - find themselves assigned to the top secret Warehouse 13. The Warehouse is a massive, top secret facility that houses dangerous and fantastical objects. Together, Pete and Myka along with fellow agents Claudia, Steve Jinks and Warehouse caretaker Artie, must recover artifacts from around the globe before they can cause catastrophic damage.', 'After saving the life of the President, two secret service agents - Myka Bering and Pete Lattimer - find themselves assigned to the top secret Warehouse 13. The Warehouse is a massive, top secret facility that houses dangerous and fantastical objects. Together, Pete and Myka along with fellow agents Claudia, Steve Jinks and Warehouse caretaker Artie, must recover artifacts from around the globe before they can cause catastrophic damage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9s6DKKvwqeOpDX7GXjiq0gz4m90.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:15819'),
  ('493068030093334690', 'Warlords of Sigrdrifa', 2020, 'Animation, Drama, Mystery, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sayaka Kikuchi, Nene Hieda, Hibiku Yamamura, Mao Ichimichi, Ai Kayano, Mikako Komatsu, Yui Horie, Sumire Uesaka', 'TV-14', 'When the Pillars suddenly appear on Earth, threatening all life, it''s only the act of the god Odin that offers humanity salvation. Providing a means of fighting back, he gives Earth the Valkyries, young female pilots with supernatural powers and spirit fighter planes. These skilled troublemakers, all young, risk their lives in a long-running war—but the final battle is fast approaching!', 'When the Pillars suddenly appear on Earth, threatening all life, it''s only the act of the god Odin that offers humanity salvation. Providing a means of fighting back, he gives Earth the Valkyries, young female pilots with supernatural powers and spirit fighter planes. These skilled troublemakers, all young, risk their lives in a long-running war—but the final battle is fast approaching!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDeQsdZji4O6fGv3OJP00BI6AP9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99910'),
  ('111163326334517539', 'Warm and Cozy', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Han Hee', 'Hong Jeong-eun, Hong Mi-ran', 'Yoo Yeon-seok, Kang So-ra, Kim Seung-o, Jung Jin-young, Seo Yi-an, Lee Sung-jae, Kim Hee-jung, Go Kyung-pyo', null, 'A workaholic with a rage problem and a laid-back guy from a wealthy family meet at a restaurant named "Warm and Cozy" on the beautiful island of Jeju.', 'A workaholic with a rage problem and a laid-back guy from a wealthy family meet at a restaurant named "Warm and Cozy" on the beautiful island of Jeju.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2S3UaUP93ofMCmA7IlRsHFWjQaF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62645'),
