  ('284362355427452460', 'Weightlifting Fairy Kim Bok-joo', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Yang Hui-seung, Oh Hyun-jong, Kim Soo-jin', 'Kim Soo-jin', 'Lee Sung-kyung, Nam Joo-hyuk, Lee Jae-yoon, Gyeong Su-jin, Choi Woong, Ji Il-ju, Cho Soo-hyang, Cho Hye-jeong', 'TV-PG', 'A competitive swimmer crosses paths with his childhood friend, a rising weight lifting star, and realizes that she has a secret crush on his cousin.', 'A competitive swimmer crosses paths with his childhood friend, a rising weight lifting star, and realizes that she has a secret crush on his cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oARcy8kubYekRqii04obOlvw442.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68349'),
