  ('1049771753955670971', 'What a Wonderful Life', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Lu Jin', 'Li Sheng, Shawn Wei, Tu Songyan, Leon Jay Williams, Liu Zhenjun', null, 'After graduating from university, Sai Xiao Hua is determined to stay in Beijing. She finally finds a job, but after an emotional entanglement with her boss Qiao Ma, she gets fired again. She then decides to open a small supermarket selling organic vegetables, together with her former classmate You Liang.', 'After graduating from university, Sai Xiao Hua is determined to stay in Beijing. She finally finds a job, but after an emotional entanglement with her boss Qiao Ma, she gets fired again. She then decides to open a small supermarket selling organic vegetables, together with her former classmate You Liang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fqUOvBWCeJti6s2ESAhl1prEVhJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:135650'),
  ('553456630635016256', 'What About Brian', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dana Stevens', null, 'Barry Watson, Matthew Davis, Rick Gomez, Amanda Detmer, Rosanna Arquette', 'TV-PG', 'Serial monogamist Brian O''Hara hits his mid-30s and suddenly realizes he''s the last bachelor standing in his circle of friends. Not averse to the happily ever after his friends have achieved, Brian wonders whether he''ll ever find Mrs. Right. The fact that he''s in love with his best friend''s girlfriend doesn''t help his chances.', 'Serial monogamist Brian O''Hara hits his mid-30s and suddenly realizes he''s the last bachelor standing in his circle of friends. Not averse to the happily ever after his friends have achieved, Brian wonders whether he''ll ever find Mrs. Right. The fact that he''s in love with his best friend''s girlfriend doesn''t help his chances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPFkV9pGB1oNlN8iEahlQnnj8AQ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3535'),
  ('199924996733267051', 'What Comes After Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Moon Hyun-sung', null, 'Lee Se-young, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Hong Jong-hyun, Anne Nakamura', null, 'While studying in Japan, Hong meets Jungo and goes through a sad love and breakup. Five years later, the two are reunited in Korea.', 'While studying in Japan, Hong meets Jungo and goes through a sad love and breakup. Five years later, the two are reunited in Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AXBu3RzzkQIltrvUMRY64pQuZX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:231281'),
  ('302457435085766483', 'What Did You Eat Yesterday?', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Fumi Yoshinaga', null, 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Seiyo Uchino, Hayato Isomura, Koji Yamamoto, Misako Tanaka, Makita Sports, Meiko Kaji, Airi Matsuyama', null, 'Lawyer Shiro pours his heart into home-cooked meals for his partner, hairstylist Kenji, as they navigate life as a middle-aged gay couple in Tokyo.', 'Lawyer Shiro pours his heart into home-cooked meals for his partner, hairstylist Kenji, as they navigate life as a middle-aged gay couple in Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtwr94gRDeHEWv1L6SnUBecHpOh.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:89613'),
  ('171896933269137311', 'What Happened Next?', 2019, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Maksim Morozov, Darya Morozova', null, 'Nurlan Saburov, Tambi Masaev, Aleksey Shcherbakov, Ilya Makarov, Emir Kashokov', null, 'A black comedy show in which four comedians listen to a story from the life of a celebrity and try to guess its ending, while using all sorts of jokes and obscene language, sometimes bordering on insults to the guest.', 'A black comedy show in which four comedians listen to a story from the life of a celebrity and try to guess its ending, while using all sorts of jokes and obscene language, sometimes bordering on insults to the guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQ5ZxvrpyEqYTivhFyOoUW460lh.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:110162'),
  ('491617983209062808', 'What Happened, Brittany Murphy?', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Brittany Murphy, Simon Monjack, Kathy Najimy, Lisa Rieffel, Shawn Levy, Taryn Manning, Amy Heckerling, Marti Faulkner', 'TV-MA', 'An in-depth, intimate character portrait exploring the life and career and mysterious circumstances surrounding the tragic death of 90’s actress and rising star, Brittany Murphy. The series goes beyond the conspiracy theories and headlines, featuring new interviews by those closest to Brittany and new archival footage.', 'An in-depth, intimate character portrait exploring the life and career and mysterious circumstances surrounding the tragic death of 90’s actress and rising star, Brittany Murphy. The series goes beyond the conspiracy theories and headlines, featuring new interviews by those closest to Brittany and new archival footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvjooU9XSedeinHoQKJe9a7MkpS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:131875'),
  ('83640625356073626', 'What Happens to My Family?', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', null, 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Yoo Dong-geun, Kim Hyun-joo, Kim Sang-kyung, Yoon Park, Park Hyung-sik, Son Dam-bi, Nam Ji-hyun, Seo Kang-joon', null, 'Every family has its issues but what happens when the patriarch in the family is not happy with the behaviors of his children? Cha Bong Soon does not intend to just sit back and take bad treatment from his three adult children – Cha Kang Shim, Cha Kang Jae and Cha Dal Bong – and decides to take legal action against them. With such chaos going on in her family, Kang Shim has a tough time focusing on her job as secretary to the president of Daeoh Company and constantly at odds with the president''s son, Moon Tae Joo, the company director. Will Tae Joo get sucked into the Cha family drama as well?', 'Every family has its issues but what happens when the patriarch in the family is not happy with the behaviors of his children? Cha Bong Soon does not intend to just sit back and take bad treatment from his three adult children – Cha Kang Shim, Cha Kang Jae and Cha Dal Bong – and decides to take legal action against them. With such chaos going on in her family, Kang Shim has a tough time focusing on her job as secretary to the president of Daeoh Company and constantly at odds with the president''s son, Moon Tae Joo, the company director. Will Tae Joo get sucked into the Cha family drama as well?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMIX1wrhFTvTX3nVzdLiFD4hIbw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70525'),
  ('251079140995927482', 'What I Like About You', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Wil Calhoun, Dan Schneider', 'Scott Weinger', 'Amanda Bynes, Jennie Garth, Wesley Jonathan, Nick Zano, Allison Munn, Leslie Grossman', 'TV-PG', 'Valerie Tyler is a 28-year-old organization freak who loves her 16-year-old sister Holly. Even if Holly is rambunctious. Spontaneous. Impulsive. Disconcerting. And definitely disorganized. Then Holly moves in with Val, and the sisters discover they may make better siblings than roomies.', 'Valerie Tyler is a 28-year-old organization freak who loves her 16-year-old sister Holly. Even if Holly is rambunctious. Spontaneous. Impulsive. Disconcerting. And definitely disorganized. Then Holly moves in with Val, and the sisters discover they may make better siblings than roomies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSBXCHUwMR3uCCeheTCeb6lzpEI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:33'),
  ('1041776110471984444', 'What If?', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Tim van Aelst', 'Bart Cannaerts', 'Ben Segers, Bruno Vanden Broecke, Ruth Beeckmans, Günther Lesage, Bert Haelvoet, Koen De Graeve, Robrecht Vanden Thoren, Nico Sturm', null, 'A sketch show with each sketch beginning with the question “what if.” A roller coaster of sketches that immerses you in life as it almost could be.', 'A sketch show with each sketch beginning with the question “what if.” A roller coaster of sketches that immerses you in life as it almost could be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eD5338nr6ujyX18nvYfu6SVIyfh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:50116'),
  ('697430689530320368', 'What If...?', 2021, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jeffrey Wright', 'TV-14', 'Taking inspiration from the comic books of the same name, each episode of this animated anthology series questions, revisits and twists classic Marvel Cinematic moments.', 'Taking inspiration from the comic books of the same name, each episode of this animated anthology series questions, revisits and twists classic Marvel Cinematic moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lztz5XBMG1x6Y5ubz7CxfPFsAcW.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:91363'),
  ('753226682073899012', 'What is Fatmagul''s Fault?', 2010, 'Family, Drama', 'Vedat Türkali', 'Ece Yörenç, Melek Gençoğlu', 'Beren Saat, Engin Akyürek, Buğra Gülsoy, Kaan Taşaner, Engin Öztürk, Fırat Çelik, Sumru Yavrucuk, Esra Dermancıoğlu', 'NR', 'Fatmagul, a simple happy village girl, is violated by 4 drunk rich young men, the extreme hardship she faces forced to marry a rapist and the great remorse felt by others for their inaction when innocence was violated forms the story.', 'Fatmagul, a simple happy village girl, is violated by 4 drunk rich young men, the extreme hardship she faces forced to marry a rapist and the great remorse felt by others for their inaction when innocence was violated forms the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zRbndORP3qUuIFOxhgPmgEA3Mul.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:44807'),
  ('788211126219028202', 'What It Feels Like for a Girl', 2025, 'Drama', 'Paris Lees', null, 'Calam Lynch, Ellis Howard, Hannah Walters, Laura Haddock, Michael Socha, Laquarn Lewis, Hannah Jones, Adam Ali', null, 'To find yourself, sometimes you need to lose yourself. It''s Y2K, and Byron''s flirting with discovery and destruction, love and anarchy. Inspired by Paris Lees''s raw, riotous memoir.', 'To find yourself, sometimes you need to lose yourself. It''s Y2K, and Byron''s flirting with discovery and destruction, love and anarchy. Inspired by Paris Lees''s raw, riotous memoir.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycHMy83cCswVyqYEOBQAH2feKzT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:286654'),
  ('200573519409608665', 'What Life Took From Me', 2013, 'Drama', 'Caridad Bravo Adams', null, 'Angelique Boyer, Sebastián Rulli, Luis Roberto Guzmán, Daniela Castro, Sergio Sendel, Grettell Valdéz, Eric del Castillo, Ana Bertha Espín', 'TV-PG', '"What Life Took From Me" is a Mexican telenovela produced by Angelli Nesma Medina for Televisa. It is a remake of Bodas de odio, produced by Ernesto Alonso in 1983. In 2003, "True Love", the first remake, was produced by Carla Estrada. Unlike Bodas de odio and "True Love", "What Life Took From Me" has been adapted to the present time.', '"What Life Took From Me" is a Mexican telenovela produced by Angelli Nesma Medina for Televisa. It is a remake of Bodas de odio, produced by Ernesto Alonso in 1983. In 2003, "True Love", the first remake, was produced by Carla Estrada. Unlike Bodas de odio and "True Love", "What Life Took From Me" has been adapted to the present time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHPdvdPE0U2B4nuQaU0IrWtqoQ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58450'),
  ('507421559005867957', 'What Lives Inside', 2015, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Robert Stromberg', null, 'Colin Hanks, J.K. Simmons, Catherine O''Hara, Barak Hardley', null, 'While mourning the loss of his world-famous puppeteer father, Taylor finds himself mysteriously transported to the magical world of his father''s show.', 'While mourning the loss of his world-famous puppeteer father, Taylor finds himself mysteriously transported to the magical world of his father''s show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8QHO6GVBCpCi3BE7yOaFXnv6Ph.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62878'),
  ('972103313523788282', 'What on Earth?', 2015, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Steven Kearney, Andrew Gough', 'TV-14', 'Satellites orbit Earth at 17,000 miles an hour, capturing images of our world that are breathtaking, but some are bizarre. This unique perspective reveals objects that seem to make no sense &amp; phenomena that defy explanation. Such images force the question, what on Earth is that?', 'Satellites orbit Earth at 17,000 miles an hour, capturing images of our world that are breathtaking, but some are bizarre. This unique perspective reveals objects that seem to make no sense &amp; phenomena that defy explanation. Such images force the question, what on Earth is that?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/re0tUOekrGIw7S66FyTp929pthP.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:70189'),
  ('895546032757708520', 'What Remains', 2013, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Tony Basgallop', null, 'David Threlfall, Denise Gough, Lisa Millett, Alexander Arnold, David Bamber, Claudie Blakley, Jessica Gunning, Victoria Hamilton', null, 'When the decomposed body of Melissa Young is found by a couple in their new flat, Detective Len Harper is determined to discover what happened to her and why nobody noticed she was missing.', 'When the decomposed body of Melissa Young is found by a couple in their new flat, Detective Len Harper is determined to discover what happened to her and why nobody noticed she was missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzrZ4X7KX0IntJko33JkxfdVoKd.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57857'),
  ('754822019067344463', 'What the Future Holds', 2018, 'Drama', 'Mariano Barroso, Alejandro Hernández', 'Mariano Barroso, Alejandro Hernández', 'Oriol Pla, Aura Garrido, Jesús Carroza, Xavi Sáez, Karra Elejalde, Pere Ponce, Pep Munné, Javier Beltrán', null, 'In 1966, Justo Gil arrives in Barcelona as a migrant with the purpose of gaining enough money to give his sick mother the best care. His great charisma allows him to socialize with the youngsters of the upper-class, until an unexpected turn of events makes him become an informer of the political police, in order to pursue communist cells.', 'In 1966, Justo Gil arrives in Barcelona as a migrant with the purpose of gaining enough money to give his sick mother the best care. His great charisma allows him to socialize with the youngsters of the upper-class, until an unexpected turn of events makes him become an informer of the political police, in order to pursue communist cells.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orO64X1eYaLjdVckIlNQg4k1RTJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80070'),
  ('371096997824064298', 'What the Hell Is Love', 2023, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Chun-Hua Lin, Han-Jie Wu, Chan Chun-chieh', 'JC Lin, Rexen Cheng, Vera Yen, Stone Yang, Sheng-Ping Chu, Hsu Chieh-Hui, Daniel Chen, Lotus Wang', null, 'If the law and its enforcement has worked, then the world needs gods no more... When facing the dilemma with no right answer in this world full of ambiguity, Lou I-fang, the Master of the shrine and the Chief of the village will stand out to do justice right. Together with his assistant and fellow lawyers, they team up to bring hope to people whenever crime or unfairness emerge. If only they could also face the doubts within themselves...', 'If the law and its enforcement has worked, then the world needs gods no more... When facing the dilemma with no right answer in this world full of ambiguity, Lou I-fang, the Master of the shrine and the Chief of the village will stand out to do justice right. Together with his assistant and fellow lawyers, they team up to bring hope to people whenever crime or unfairness emerge. If only they could also face the doubts within themselves...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feBlI5EZly1f0VGFWIPeMIcB3Jl.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195191'),
  ('394357860194593630', 'What We Do in the Shadows', 2019, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jemaine Clement', 'Jemaine Clement, Taika Waititi', 'Kayvan Novak, Matt Berry, Natasia Demetriou, Harvey Guillén, Mark Proksch', 'TV-MA', 'A documentary-style look into the daily (or rather, nightly) lives of a group of vampires in Staten Island who have “lived” together for hundreds and hundreds of years.', 'A documentary-style look into the daily (or rather, nightly) lives of a group of vampires in Staten Island who have “lived” together for hundreds and hundreds of years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wa3ZQE9kLnqwN3vQ0NNjg1NPsCa.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:83631'),
  ('227764103800440065', 'What Would You Do?', 2008, 'News, Reality', null, null, 'John Quiñones, Sara Haines', null, 'An American television news magazine and hidden camera show. Actors act out scenes of conflict or illegal activity in public settings while hidden cameras videotape the scene, and the focus is on whether or not bystanders intervene, and how. Variations are also usually included, such as changing the genders, the races or the clothing of the actors performing the scene, to see if bystanders react differently. Quiñones appears at the end to interview the bystanders about their reactions. As the experiment goes on, psychology professors, teachers, or club members watch and discuss the video with Quiñones, explaining and making inferences on the bystanders'' reactions.', 'An American television news magazine and hidden camera show. Actors act out scenes of conflict or illegal activity in public settings while hidden cameras videotape the scene, and the focus is on whether or not bystanders intervene, and how. Variations are also usually included, such as changing the genders, the races or the clothing of the actors performing the scene, to see if bystanders react differently. Quiñones appears at the end to interview the bystanders about their reactions. As the experiment goes on, psychology professors, teachers, or club members watch and discuss the video with Quiñones, explaining and making inferences on the bystanders'' reactions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kH6xLAmesAoWS66pvBjrjr5AO6e.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:16234'),
  ('142007176216852027', 'WHAT? DOOR!', 2023, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jaehyun, Sungho, Riwoo, Taesan, Leehan, Woonhak', null, 'Knock, knock! Who''s there? BOYNEXTDOOR! This variety show focuses on k-pop boygroup BOYNEXTDOOR and shows off the group''s fun times off stage.', 'Knock, knock! Who''s there? BOYNEXTDOOR! This variety show focuses on k-pop boygroup BOYNEXTDOOR and shows off the group''s fun times off stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcFp8uHf8jOrB3TBEOQKl2tptGZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:245349'),
  ('921286774537303768', 'What''s Happening Now!!', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Eric Monte', null, 'Haywood Nelson, Ernest Lee Thomas, Anne-Marie Johnson, Shirley Hemphill, Fred Berry, Ken Sagoes, Martin Lawrence, Reina King', 'TV-G', 'What''s Happening Now!! is an American sequel series of What''s Happening!! It ran in syndication from 1985 to 1988. Like the previous series, What''s Happening Now!! is loosely based on the motion picture Cooley High.', 'What''s Happening Now!! is an American sequel series of What''s Happening!! It ran in syndication from 1985 to 1988. Like the previous series, What''s Happening Now!! is loosely based on the motion picture Cooley High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jAdacJlx81TNdN26eucSaGBcCr.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:67'),
  ('376364805465489876', 'What''s Happening!!', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Eric Monte', null, 'Ernest Lee Thomas, Haywood Nelson, Fred Berry, Danielle Spencer, Shirley Hemphill', null, 'What''s Happening!! is an American television sitcom that aired on ABC from August 5, 1976 to April 28, 1979. The show premiered as a summer series. With good ratings and reviews, and after the failure of several other shows on the network, What''s Happening!! returned in November 1976 as a weekly series. It remained a regular show until 1979; ratings were modest. What''s Happening!! was loosely based on the motion picture Cooley High, also written by Eric Monte.', 'What''s Happening!! is an American television sitcom that aired on ABC from August 5, 1976 to April 28, 1979. The show premiered as a summer series. With good ratings and reviews, and after the failure of several other shows on the network, What''s Happening!! returned in November 1976 as a weekly series. It remained a regular show until 1979; ratings were modest. What''s Happening!! was loosely based on the motion picture Cooley High, also written by Eric Monte.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaDvj8di0QjPuxqnANxT9ybn0E1.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1869'),
  ('463353685289348098', 'What''s My Line?', 1950, 'Family, Comedy', null, null, 'John Charles Daly', 'TV-G', 'Four panelists must determine guests'' occupations - and, in the case of famous guests, while blindfolded, their identity - by asking only "yes" or "no" questions.', 'Four panelists must determine guests'' occupations - and, in the case of famous guests, while blindfolded, their identity - by asking only "yes" or "no" questions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A9T7xSQFnlxFgZkqC4lmHYPXhq4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26663'),
  ('407346861626417486', 'What''s My Name | Muhammad Ali', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Antoine Fuqua', 'Steven Leckart', 'Muhammad Ali, Dick Cavett, Ernie Terrell, George Foreman, Howard Cosell, Jackie Robinson, Martin Luther King Jr., Malcolm X', 'TV-14', 'Explore Ali’s challenges, confrontations, comebacks and triumphs through recordings of his own voice. The two-part documentary paints an intimate portrait of a man who was a beacon of hope for oppressed people around the world and, in his later years, was recognized as a global citizen and a symbol of humanity and understanding.', 'Explore Ali’s challenges, confrontations, comebacks and triumphs through recordings of his own voice. The two-part documentary paints an intimate portrait of a man who was a beacon of hope for oppressed people around the world and, in his later years, was recognized as a global citizen and a symbol of humanity and understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nMgIVQVRDTSae95VivppOTm39N9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87148'),
  ('888551250546272299', 'What''s New, Scooby-Doo?', 2002, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Sander Schwartz', null, 'Frank Welker, Casey Kasem, Mindy Cohn, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-Y7', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery, Inc. gang are launched into the 21st century, with new mysteries to solve.', 'Scooby-Doo and the Mystery, Inc. gang are launched into the 21st century, with new mysteries to solve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sX80eWq4XHvFGUmCg803iifUcG.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:652'),
