  ('437408718591361428', 'What''s with Andy?', 2001, 'Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Andy Griffiths', null, 'Ian James Corlett', null, 'Andy Larkin isn''t like other children. He''s not into sports, science or even video games. Andy spends his time mastering the art of being a prankster. In fact, he strives to be the greatest practical joker the world has ever seen. However, Andy''s mischievous antics often backfire and he suffers greatly for his art.', 'Andy Larkin isn''t like other children. He''s not into sports, science or even video games. Andy spends his time mastering the art of being a prankster. In fact, he strives to be the greatest practical joker the world has ever seen. However, Andy''s mischievous antics often backfire and he suffers greatly for his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdHT0xD9GVYeBcnPftB3XzKAhdh.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:1762'),
  ('947573097593261001', 'What''s Wrong with My Big Brother', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Su Shangqing, Ajie, Zhang Yutong, Shuang Zhao, Qiao Shiyu, Titus Jin, Chen Zhangtaikang', null, 'The hilarious adventures of the eldest apprentice of a sect who has a problem with his brain. Dongfang Xianyun is reincarnated as the eldest disciple of the Care-free sect. But the only thing that goes through his mind is to make sure he doesn''t end up dying by the hands of the "main character". Read as he makes no sense to his sibling disciples while avoiding flags left and right.', 'The hilarious adventures of the eldest apprentice of a sect who has a problem with his brain. Dongfang Xianyun is reincarnated as the eldest disciple of the Care-free sect. But the only thing that goes through his mind is to make sure he doesn''t end up dying by the hands of the "main character". Read as he makes no sense to his sibling disciples while avoiding flags left and right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZO9a1A2LfoYvXbK78xNtbFzgsl.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:79514'),
  ('1017653109076440388', 'What''s Wrong with Secretary Kim', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Park Joon-hwa', 'Paek Sun-woo, Choi Bo-rim', 'Park Seo-jun, Park Min-young, Lee Tae-hwan, Pyo Ye-jin, Kim Hye-ok, Kim Byeong-ok, Kang Ki-young, Kang Hong-suk', null, 'Lee Young-Joon''s family runs a large company and he works as the vice-president of the company. He is smart, rich and handsome, but he is arrogant. His secretary is Kim Mi-So. She has worked for him for years and she is perfect for him, but Kim Mi-So decides to quit her job.', 'Lee Young-Joon''s family runs a large company and he works as the vice-president of the company. He is smart, rich and handsome, but he is arrogant. His secretary is Kim Mi-So. She has worked for him for years and she is perfect for him, but Kim Mi-So decides to quit her job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmq7vKRPoK2VHOTeaUdwwe3l5bB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:79434'),
