  ('605777372546969938', 'When Supernatural Battles Became Commonplace', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Haruka Yamazaki, Saori Hayami, Nanami Yamashita, Risa Taneda', 'TV-14', 'A group of five boys and girls suddenly acquire supernatural powers. Ready to fight in galactic battles to defend human cause… they are struck by the realization that there are no wars, no conspiracies, no evils empires, no nothing in their high school life. They instead decide to idly have fun by wasting their powers away.', 'A group of five boys and girls suddenly acquire supernatural powers. Ready to fight in galactic battles to defend human cause… they are struck by the realization that there are no wars, no conspiracies, no evils empires, no nothing in their high school life. They instead decide to idly have fun by wasting their powers away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3tXVmSvkMRu9OyJhAfxt0zIE7r.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61423'),
  ('421269981326224259', 'When the Camellia Blooms', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Lim Sang-choon', null, 'Gong Hyo-jin, Kang Ha-neul, Kim Ji-seok, Son Dam-bi, Oh Jung-se, Yeom Hye-ran, Ji Su-yeon, Goh Doo-shim', null, 'Dongbaek is a single mother. When a potential new love enters her life, she finds ways to defy the social stigmas surrounding her.', 'Dongbaek is a single mother. When a potential new love enters her life, she finds ways to defy the social stigmas surrounding her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCrYA7xyHJtPnTWZU60pVBRSFZc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93097'),
  ('951938894998960371', 'When the Devil Calls Your Name', 2019, 'Comedy', null, 'Noh Hye-young', 'Jung Kyung-ho, Park Sung-woong, Lee Sul, Lee El, Kim Won-hae, Oh Eui-sik, Yoon Kyung-ho, Nam Ji-hyun', null, 'Music producer and composer Ha Rib made a contract with the devil to trade his soul for fame. This devilish transaction brought him all the fame he could ask for, producing many hit songs. As the contract expiration draws near, he bargains with the devil for an extension. For that, he must find another person to sell the soul. Ha Rib finds a perfect candidate, but contemplates because she would have to suffer for 10 years for his selfish fame.', 'Music producer and composer Ha Rib made a contract with the devil to trade his soul for fame. This devilish transaction brought him all the fame he could ask for, producing many hit songs. As the contract expiration draws near, he bargains with the devil for an extension. For that, he must find another person to sell the soul. Ha Rib finds a perfect candidate, but contemplates because she would have to suffer for 10 years for his selfish fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIfvyflJHbV3VKMt0Ql5wuvsJjj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90699'),
  ('738195863884887047', 'When the Dust Settles', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ida Maria Rydén, Dorthe Warnø Høgh', 'Ida Maria Rydén, Dorthe Warnø Høgh', 'Katinka Lærke Petersen, Karen-Lise Mynster, Jacob Lohmann, Malin Crépin, Arian Kashef, Viola Martinsen, Peter Christoffersen, Filippa Suenson', null, 'The equally important and heartbreaking story of eight strangers whose lives and fates intertwine after a tragic terrorist attack shocks Copenhagen.', 'The equally important and heartbreaking story of eight strangers whose lives and fates intertwine after a tragic terrorist attack shocks Copenhagen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLBQD4oJXtyI48lz2YkrmfEFwCq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:98911'),
  ('974118040862864078', 'When the Levees Broke: A Requiem in Four Acts', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Spike Lee', null, 'Ray Nagin, Garland Robinette, Kathleen Blanco, Darleen Asevedo, Jay Asevedo, Harry Belafonte, Wendell Pierce, Mike Myers', 'TV-14', 'Spike Lee''s award-winning documentary follows the events that preceded and followed Hurricane Katrina''s catastrophic passage through New Orleans in 2005.', 'Spike Lee''s award-winning documentary follows the events that preceded and followed Hurricane Katrina''s catastrophic passage through New Orleans in 2005.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o8YXm3gkRtGy0yQKfWvYNQXoblU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16468'),
  ('637766239279447014', 'When the Phone Rings', 2024, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Kim Ji-woon', 'Kim Ji-woon', 'Yoo Yeon-seok, Chae Soo-bin, Heo Nam-jun, Jang Gyu-ri, Lee Doo-seok', 'TV-14', 'A rising politician and his mute wife''s tense marriage begins to unravel after a call from a kidnapper turns their lives upside down.', 'A rising politician and his mute wife''s tense marriage begins to unravel after a call from a kidnapper turns their lives upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glWP5Y7CVeqrOjJpLckQjuLFjQJ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:253905'),
  ('287042537039452354', 'When the Stars Gossip', 2025, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Park Shin-woo, Kim Jin-sung, Seo Sook-hyang', 'Seo Sook-hyang', 'Lee Min-ho, Gong Hyo-jin, Oh Jung-se, Han Ji-eun, Kim Ju-hun, Lee El, Lee Cho-hee, Heo Nam-jun', 'TV-MA', 'From two different worlds and with separate missions, an astronaut and a space tourist entangle in space — only to start falling for each other.', 'From two different worlds and with separate missions, an astronaut and a space tourist entangle in space — only to start falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pdOiUbJ0vEJfh5OGFG8y1e4InQ7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:154822'),
  ('364695932309818159', 'When the Streetlights Go On', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Eddie O''Keefe, Chris Hutton', 'Queen Latifah, Mark Duplass, Kristine Froseth, Sophie Thatcher, Chosen Jacobs, Sam Strike, Julia Sarah Stone, Ben Ahlers', 'TV-MA', 'A double-homicide in a small midwestern suburb rattles the lives of a group of teenagers and sends investigators searching for answers in the fall of 1995. A meditation on growing up, the passing of time, and the insidious violence that lurks in the suburbs.', 'A double-homicide in a small midwestern suburb rattles the lives of a group of teenagers and sends investigators searching for answers in the fall of 1995. A meditation on growing up, the passing of time, and the insidious violence that lurks in the suburbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i7rVHmZaHfk0yBNyyS1rEDxNqb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99294'),
  ('547548483251883627', 'When the Sun Shines', 1990, null, null, null, 'Roger Kwok Chun-On, Hacken Lee, Wing Lam, Isabel Leung Pooi-Woo, Joseph Lee Kwok-Lun, Cheung Fung-Lei, Dickson Lee Kar-Sing, Kiki Sheung', null, 'Tin Kai-On moves to Hong Kong from his hometown and initially resents his father''s new wife, but gradually comes to accept her. Kai-On lives with his cousin, who dislikes him, and befriends his cousin''s sister, who is tomboyish. Kai-On also has a crush on his neighbor, who initially rejects him. Kai-On, his cousin, and a childhood rival eventually become close friends and start a successful business together.', 'Tin Kai-On moves to Hong Kong from his hometown and initially resents his father''s new wife, but gradually comes to accept her. Kai-On lives with his cousin, who dislikes him, and befriends his cousin''s sister, who is tomboyish. Kai-On also has a crush on his neighbor, who initially rejects him. Kai-On, his cousin, and a childhood rival eventually become close friends and start a successful business together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hsHJAPAHQ0H69NEiMrgY6as7Cqg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225595'),
