  ('246390734088770707', 'Where My Heart Is', 2021, 'Drama', 'George Moura, Sérgio Goldenberg', null, 'Letícia Colin, Mariana Lima, Fábio Assunção, Daniel de Oliveira, Manu Morelli, Camila Márdila, Ana Flavia Cavalcanti, Michel Melamed', null, 'Amanda faces her own private war, faced with an intimate and destructive relationship with drugs, constant family pressure and the fragility of her marriage with Miguel.', 'Amanda faces her own private war, faced with an intimate and destructive relationship with drugs, constant family pressure and the fragility of her marriage with Miguel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmnRgU0HvfsTHcc9LfI1YlExCJc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:124831'),
  ('405978476132128398', 'Where no one looks - The Elisa Claps case', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Pablo Trincia', null, 'Pablo Trincia, Federica Sciarelli, Filomena Claps, Gildo Claps, Amie Benguit', null, 'The murder of Elisa Claps represents one of the most discussed Italian crime cases of recent decades. In this docu-series the entire story is reconstructed, from the disappearance of the girl on 12 September 1993 until the discovery of her mummified corpse in March 2010.', 'The murder of Elisa Claps represents one of the most discussed Italian crime cases of recent decades. In this docu-series the entire story is reconstructed, from the disappearance of the girl on 12 September 1993 until the discovery of her mummified corpse in March 2010.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6n2iv73S1CCv8AH45Y045hGk3cg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:239470'),
  ('101825621627031659', 'Where on Earth Is Carmen Sandiego?', 1994, 'Mystery, Animation, Kids', 'Phil Harnage', null, 'Rita Moreno, Jennifer Hale, Scott Menville, Rodger Bumpass', 'TV-Y', 'It''s all up to you. You must gather clues, note locations and facts, and finally fit all the clues together to help catch the greatest criminal mastermind in history--none other than the infamous Carmen Sandiego. She''s bold, beautiful, and until now, uncatchable. But with your help, the ACME Detective agency might just have a chance at bringing her in.', 'It''s all up to you. You must gather clues, note locations and facts, and finally fit all the clues together to help catch the greatest criminal mastermind in history--none other than the infamous Carmen Sandiego. She''s bold, beautiful, and until now, uncatchable. But with your help, the ACME Detective agency might just have a chance at bringing her in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lj5HNwvZKVvIco8wHBfFlrFmpw2.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:3945'),
  ('539063864447706447', 'Where Stars Land', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kang Eun-kyung', 'Kang Eun-kyung, Lim Hye-min', 'Lee Je-hoon, Chae Soo-bin, Lee Dong-gun, Kim Ji-soo, Kim Kyung-nam, Lee Soo-kyung, Kim Dae-gun, Rowoon', null, 'At Incheon International Airport, brilliant but distant engineer Lee Soo-yeon and clumsy, idealistic rookie Han Yeo-reum cross paths as they navigate tough challenges, personal secrets, and unexpected connections in their new jobs.', 'At Incheon International Airport, brilliant but distant engineer Lee Soo-yeon and clumsy, idealistic rookie Han Yeo-reum cross paths as they navigate tough challenges, personal secrets, and unexpected connections in their new jobs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TEIkad4Nj1ZY5elC1sett6JAeK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82298'),
  ('44022679455780325', 'Where the Heart Is', 1997, 'Drama', 'Ashley Pharoah', null, 'Christian Cooke, Thomas Byrne', 'TV-PG', 'Where the Heart Is is a British television family drama series set in the fictional Yorkshire town of Skelthwaite. It focuses on the professional and personal lives of the district nurses who work in the town.', 'Where the Heart Is is a British television family drama series set in the fictional Yorkshire town of Skelthwaite. It focuses on the professional and personal lives of the district nurses who work in the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gjwVDpZHpcEPfz2AuqJBt3ue9na.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:750'),
  ('828900214793957332', 'Where Your Eyes Linger', 2020, 'Drama', 'Hwang Da-seul, Shin Ji-an', 'Shin Ji-an', 'Han Gi-chan, Jang Eui-soo, Choi Yeon-cheong, Chun Jae-young, Cheon Seung-ho, Jung Seo-in', null, 'Friendship evolves into something more between two high school students: a playful chaebol heir and the diligent bodyguard who''s always by his side.', 'Friendship evolves into something more between two high school students: a playful chaebol heir and the diligent bodyguard who''s always by his side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LnkeZTnRMNPhxzqmwz6f88NGYC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103752'),
  ('1018704254149365088', 'Where''s the Logic?', 2015, 'Comedy, Talk', 'Vyacheslav Dusmukhametov', null, 'Azamat Musagaliev', null, 'Humanity knows two types of logic: male and female. In the new TNT show, we do not push them together, but rather make them work for one common result. Star couples, partners on the set, just good friends and acquaintances will together try to build logical links between the most seemingly illogical events, objects or facts.', 'Humanity knows two types of logic: male and female. In the new TNT show, we do not push them together, but rather make them work for one common result. Star couples, partners on the set, just good friends and acquaintances will together try to build logical links between the most seemingly illogical events, objects or facts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHil8jpAG6OqQYIqGh96yA4b71m.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:82317'),
  ('445907572579677530', 'Where''s Wally?', 1991, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Rowby Goren, Martin Handford', null, 'Townsend Coleman, Jim Cummings, Brad Garrett, Julian Holloway, David Workman, Roger Rose', null, 'With the help of his magic walking stick, Wally and his dog Woof travel through space and time or to far off magical lands, solving mysteries and lending a helping hand wherever they can.', 'With the help of his magic walking stick, Wally and his dog Woof travel through space and time or to far off magical lands, solving mysteries and lending a helping hand wherever they can.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmE8xt1GWI4ySqyRE4j4CIw6WXm.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4112'),
  ('1115416215882878919', 'Where''s Wanda?', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Oliver Lansley, Zoltan Spirandelli', null, 'Heike Makatsch, Axel Stein, Lea Drinda, Nikeata Thompson, Leo Simon, Palina Rojinski, Kostja Ullmann, Devid Striesow', 'TV-14', 'After the Klatts'' daughter goes missing, they take matters into their own hands and hatch a wild plan: Spy on the neighborhood. As they make their way into small-time espionage, shocking secrets come to light one by one.', 'After the Klatts'' daughter goes missing, they take matters into their own hands and hatch a wild plan: Spy on the neighborhood. As they make their way into small-time espionage, shocking secrets come to light one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO4zLRhA88KbV92uWiwKvtXI66G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:234310'),
  ('325134830536858092', 'WHIH Newsfront', 2015, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama, News', null, null, 'Leslie Bibb, Al Madrigal', null, 'WHIH Newsfront is a television program presented by Christine Everhart in the WHIH World News network, informing about major events from political, scientific, and entertainment news, in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.', 'WHIH Newsfront is a television program presented by Christine Everhart in the WHIH World News network, informing about major events from political, scientific, and entertainment news, in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RAbC1bwYvE3kYr6PdYFUo6vmO6.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69069'),
  ('323061454833821165', 'While You Were Sleeping', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', null, null, 'Suzy, Lee Jong-suk, Jung Hae-in, Lee Sang-yeob, Hwang Young-hee, Shin Jae-ha, Kim Won-hae, Park Jin-joo', 'TV-14', 'Nam Hong Ju, endowed with the ability to foresee events, resides with her widowed mother who runs a small restaurant. Despite her gift, she often finds herself powerless to change the outcomes. On the other side of the street, Jung Jae Chan, a rookie prosecutor, and his younger brother Seung Won become their new neighbors. An unusual dream involving Hong Ju, ruthless attorney Lee Yu Beom, and a life-saving intervention leads Jae Chan to realize their destinies are intertwined, as they begin sharing dreams and connecting in mysterious ways.', 'Nam Hong Ju, endowed with the ability to foresee events, resides with her widowed mother who runs a small restaurant. Despite her gift, she often finds herself powerless to change the outcomes. On the other side of the street, Jung Jae Chan, a rookie prosecutor, and his younger brother Seung Won become their new neighbors. An unusual dream involving Hong Ju, ruthless attorney Lee Yu Beom, and a life-saving intervention leads Jae Chan to realize their destinies are intertwined, as they begin sharing dreams and connecting in mysterious ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFp7pVJbB5aD5y0A0AEBP4vmzCg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70649'),
  ('294017674323280162', 'Whiskey Cavalier', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'David Hemingson', null, 'Scott Foley, Lauren Cohan, Ana Ortiz, Tyler James Williams, Vir Das, Josh Hopkins', 'TV-14', 'Following an emotional breakup, tough but tender FBI super-agent Will Chase (codename: “Whiskey Cavalier”) is assigned to work with badass CIA operative Frankie Trowbridge (codename: “Fiery Tribune”). Together, they lead an inter-agency team of flawed, funny and heroic spies who periodically save the world (and each other) while navigating the rocky roads of friendship, romance and office politics.', 'Following an emotional breakup, tough but tender FBI super-agent Will Chase (codename: “Whiskey Cavalier”) is assigned to work with badass CIA operative Frankie Trowbridge (codename: “Fiery Tribune”). Together, they lead an inter-agency team of flawed, funny and heroic spies who periodically save the world (and each other) while navigating the rocky roads of friendship, romance and office politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDw6JCPcMbGYaeMWz1AEcwdlGaA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:82094'),
  ('189219731498845849', 'Whiskey on the Rocks', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, War & Politics', 'Henrik Jansson-Schweizer', 'Henrik Jansson-Schweizer', 'Rolf Lassgård, Anders Mossling, Niklas Engdahl, Kęstutis Jakštas, Mark Noble, Filip Berg, Artur Svorobovich, Rolf Lydahl', 'TV-MA', 'In the middle of the Cold War, a Soviet submarine runs aground outside Karlskrona and suddenly Sweden finds itself at the center of events. Prime Minister Thorbjörn Fälldin tries to resolve the conflict and avoid a world war between two nuclear powers while struggling with a wise foreign minister and a belligerent commander-in-chief.', 'In the middle of the Cold War, a Soviet submarine runs aground outside Karlskrona and suddenly Sweden finds itself at the center of events. Prime Minister Thorbjörn Fälldin tries to resolve the conflict and avoid a world war between two nuclear powers while struggling with a wise foreign minister and a belligerent commander-in-chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFKnR4F6lqcoUDgNts87EsW3Sv9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:274061'),
  ('653554146701455439', 'Whisper Me a Love Song', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Hana Shimano, Asami Seto, Kana Sasakura, Mikako Komatsu, Konomi Kohara, Ai Kakuma, Yuna Nemoto, Reina Ueda', null, 'Bubbly, energetic first-year high school student Himari falls head over heels for her senpai, Yori, after hearing her band perform on the first day of school. Himari tells Yori she just loves her, and, to Himari''s surprise, Yori says she loves Himari back! But when Himari realizes that she and her senpai are feeling two different kinds of love, she begins to ask herself what "love" really means.', 'Bubbly, energetic first-year high school student Himari falls head over heels for her senpai, Yori, after hearing her band perform on the first day of school. Himari tells Yori she just loves her, and, to Himari''s surprise, Yori says she loves Himari back! But when Himari realizes that she and her senpai are feeling two different kinds of love, she begins to ask herself what "love" really means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rxfd5kFRMjU0YWeSAKyyH48dbt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:218291'),
  ('1138688530657839231', 'Whispered Words', 2009, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', null, null, 'Ayahi Takagaki, Megumi Takamoto, Chiwa Saito, Emiri Kato, Hitomi Harada, Wataru Hatano, Ai Maeda, Ayana Taketatsu', 'TV-14', 'Murasame Sumika is popular in the high school for her excellence in the marks and sports. However, she has a secret: she is in love with her classmate Kazama Ushio, but she hasn''t noticed Sumika''s feelings. On the other hand Ushio also has a liking to the love between girls but she only shows any interest in cutesy girls. Sumika, a card-carrying badass who helps run her family''s dojo, does not fit this bill even a little. Cue angst, as she is forced to watch from the sidelines as Ushio falls for girl after girl, none of them her. Ushio is always eager to share news about her latest crush. With the duo''s knack for attracting trouble, it looks like Sumika''s trials have only just begun.', 'Murasame Sumika is popular in the high school for her excellence in the marks and sports. However, she has a secret: she is in love with her classmate Kazama Ushio, but she hasn''t noticed Sumika''s feelings. On the other hand Ushio also has a liking to the love between girls but she only shows any interest in cutesy girls. Sumika, a card-carrying badass who helps run her family''s dojo, does not fit this bill even a little. Cue angst, as she is forced to watch from the sidelines as Ushio falls for girl after girl, none of them her. Ushio is always eager to share news about her latest crush. With the duo''s knack for attracting trouble, it looks like Sumika''s trials have only just begun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilxH4QQFrxtTiU1XMF6moQftVW0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42407'),
  ('777790039069924855', 'Whispers of Fate', 2025, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Teng Ping', null, 'Luo Yunxi, Xiao Shunyao, Ao Ziyi, Fang Yilun, Bao Shangen, Chen Yao, Lin Yun, Yang Shize', null, 'When an influential and fearsome clan is massacred in mysterious circumstances, the clan’s talented disciple Tang Lici finds himself accused of masterminding the crime. Accusers say that Tang Lici is a traitor who murdered his master. A decade later, suspicions about Tang Lici linger, but much darker forces are conspiring to unleash chaos into the realm. Torn by his duality and his apparent inability to distinguish between good and evil, Tang Lici finds himself drawn back into the wider world to help defeat the evil conspiracy – armed only with his wits and his martial arts skills. His path soon crosses with former acquaintances, with some swearing enmity and others allied to his cause. Can he and his companions help defeat the forces of wickedness – or will his dual nature prove his undoing?', 'When an influential and fearsome clan is massacred in mysterious circumstances, the clan’s talented disciple Tang Lici finds himself accused of masterminding the crime. Accusers say that Tang Lici is a traitor who murdered his master. A decade later, suspicions about Tang Lici linger, but much darker forces are conspiring to unleash chaos into the realm. Torn by his duality and his apparent inability to distinguish between good and evil, Tang Lici finds himself drawn back into the wider world to help defeat the evil conspiracy – armed only with his wits and his martial arts skills. His path soon crosses with former acquaintances, with some swearing enmity and others allied to his cause. Can he and his companions help defeat the forces of wickedness – or will his dual nature prove his undoing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMSdtWjv5H9E46YnByBw1RAsoDp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:252414'),
  ('930034811710303787', 'Whistle!', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Daisuke Higuchi', null, 'Minako Komukai, Takeshi Maeda, Hidenobu Kiuchi, Ryotaro Kosaka, Shōdai Moriuchi, Shizuka Hasegawa, Minako Komukai', null, 'Kazamatsuri Shou''s dream has always been to become a professional soccer player, but he has one problem: he''s not very good at the game. He was accepted to the prestigious Musashi no Mori Junior High, known for its top rate soccer team, but he was never able to rise beyond the rank of third stringer. After transferring to Sakura Jousui Junior High, he can finally play soccer. And, with the support of his new friends and teammates, his strong determination, and lots of hard work, his soccer skills are developing rapidly and setting Shou well on his way to achieving his dream.', 'Kazamatsuri Shou''s dream has always been to become a professional soccer player, but he has one problem: he''s not very good at the game. He was accepted to the prestigious Musashi no Mori Junior High, known for its top rate soccer team, but he was never able to rise beyond the rank of third stringer. After transferring to Sakura Jousui Junior High, he can finally play soccer. And, with the support of his new friends and teammates, his strong determination, and lots of hard work, his soccer skills are developing rapidly and setting Shou well on his way to achieving his dream.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhSbrNS1Tx3o6iWuE3BsqGriqAF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28397'),
  ('544156023292734463', 'White Album', 2009, 'Drama, Animation', null, null, 'Tomoaki Maeno, Aya Hirano, Nana Mizuki, Romi Park, Daisuke Sakaguchi, Nozomi Masu, Show Hayami, Megumi Takamoto', null, 'Touya Fujii is a twenty-year-old college student dating a rising singer named Yuki Morikawa. Along the way, they are faced with numerous challenges throughout the course of events at Fuji’s college. Be prepared for an exciting journey!', 'Touya Fujii is a twenty-year-old college student dating a rising singer named Yuki Morikawa. Along the way, they are faced with numerous challenges throughout the course of events at Fuji’s college. Be prepared for an exciting journey!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6Grq2AKqzvTQTbpG6uhHTvi5Qf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:28502'),
  ('45942879110334815', 'White Album 2', 2013, 'Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Takahiro Mizushima, Madoka Yonezawa, Hitomi Nabatame', 'TV-MA', 'One evening in fall, with one month left before the school festival, the last member of the ruined light music club, Haruki Kitahara, looks out the window and plays his guitar in the direction of the festival stage set up outside. This was the simple little adventure that the conscientious honor student had hoped for two and a half years to achieve before his graduation in half a year. But then, when a flowing piano melody and a bell-like singing voice joined the clumsy sound of his guitar...', 'One evening in fall, with one month left before the school festival, the last member of the ruined light music club, Haruki Kitahara, looks out the window and plays his guitar in the direction of the festival stage set up outside. This was the simple little adventure that the conscientious honor student had hoped for two and a half years to achieve before his graduation in half a year. But then, when a flowing piano melody and a bell-like singing voice joined the clumsy sound of his guitar...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfXaBIMrRj9kbslzVONAgncERx8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70072'),
  ('35589817506894291', 'White Cat Legend', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Yulin, 郭胜, Shan Xin, Teng Xin', null, 'We follow the daily life of Shen Shi, a young man looking for his brother. To find him, he goes to the Dali Temple. One thing led to another, he eventually became an officer for Li Bing, a senior official with the appearance of a white cat.', 'We follow the daily life of Shen Shi, a young man looking for his brother. To find him, he goes to the Dali Temple. One thing led to another, he eventually became an officer for Li Bing, a senior official with the appearance of a white cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qa70BcxTel8iERiTWImwSuPecyI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:97878'),
  ('1044815897856017493', 'White Christmas', 2011, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', null, 'Park Yeon-seon', 'Sung Joon, Kim Sang-kyung, Lee Soo-hyuk, Baek Sung-hyun, Kim Young-kwang, Kwak Jung-wook, Hong Jong-hyun, Esom', null, 'Kim Yo Han is a psychiatrist who gets involved in a serial murder when his car broke down on Christmas Eve during a sudden storm and he is forced to take shelter at a private high school. Seven students and a teacher are also there over the winter break, but they are gradually murdered one by one as they receive letters from a killer who wants revenge for the death of his mother and sister.', 'Kim Yo Han is a psychiatrist who gets involved in a serial murder when his car broke down on Christmas Eve during a sudden storm and he is forced to take shelter at a private high school. Seven students and a teacher are also there over the winter break, but they are gradually murdered one by one as they receive letters from a killer who wants revenge for the death of his mother and sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1GZvI3nauHM36aCPmNIyYm1KpG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45311'),
  ('635511790453407281', 'White Collar', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jeff Eastin', null, 'Matt Bomer, Tim DeKay, Willie Garson, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Marsha Thomason, Sharif Atkins', 'TV-PG', 'In exchange for his freedom, charming con artist Neal Caffrey provides his expertise to help straight-man FBI agent Peter Burke catch elusive white-collar criminals.', 'In exchange for his freedom, charming con artist Neal Caffrey provides his expertise to help straight-man FBI agent Peter Burke catch elusive white-collar criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/417XNiGvdzCsG9kDnnQJYaBsIrx.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:21510'),
  ('573555159558097976', 'White Deer Plain', 2017, 'War & Politics, Drama', 'Chen Zhongshi', 'Chen Zhongshi, Shen Jie', 'Zhang Jiayi, He Bing, Qin Hailu, Liu Peiqi, Li Hongtao, Ge Zhijun, Lei Jiayin, Zhai Tianlin', null, 'Set in the eponymous White Deer Village in Shaanxi Province where the two most important families – Bai and Lu – and their sons have always lived together in peace. But the turmoil leads to a fierce struggle for land ownership. A young woman new to the village soon finds herself caught between the two camps. Director Liu Jin uses the story of these two families as a metaphor for the fate of the Chinese people as first Chinese war lords are overrun by Japanese invaders, then civil war follows hot on the heels of the Second World War and finally the victorious Maoists begin waving their red flags. The drama is based off the novel by Chen Zhong Shi.', 'Set in the eponymous White Deer Village in Shaanxi Province where the two most important families – Bai and Lu – and their sons have always lived together in peace. But the turmoil leads to a fierce struggle for land ownership. A young woman new to the village soon finds herself caught between the two camps. Director Liu Jin uses the story of these two families as a metaphor for the fate of the Chinese people as first Chinese war lords are overrun by Japanese invaders, then civil war follows hot on the heels of the Second World War and finally the victorious Maoists begin waving their red flags. The drama is based off the novel by Chen Zhong Shi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fCnx6KoUH8n7vMkBMavh9ArhUV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72312'),
  ('976635027063020080', 'White Famous', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Buddy Lewis, Chris Spencer, Tom Kapinos', null, 'Jay Pharoah, Jacob Ming-Trent, Utkarsh Ambudkar, Lonnie Chavis', 'TV-MA', 'Floyd Mooney is a young African-American comedian whose star is on the rise. But the path to stardom is a minefield that Floyd must navigate to maintain his credibility while attempting to become “white famous.”', 'Floyd Mooney is a young African-American comedian whose star is on the rise. But the path to stardom is a minefield that Floyd must navigate to maintain his credibility while attempting to become “white famous.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDnHjFeEX0Xf695sQGEjCFCo7Sc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73924'),
