  ('890061444026533110', 'Who''s the Murderer', 2016, 'Crime, Mystery, Reality', 'He Chen, Yan Ji', null, null, null, 'The cast is introduced to the settings and suspects of a murder case for the new episode. The cast then chooses their role in the episode, as a particular suspect or the detective.', 'The cast is introduced to the settings and suspects of a murder case for the new episode. The cast then chooses their role in the episode, as a particular suspect or the detective.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dmWr4vJgvGMH8m60fuTh0wzYGde.jpg', 11, 'tmdb:tv:74561'),
  ('149135860755963481', 'Who''s The Winner', 1991, 'Crime, Action & Adventure', null, null, null, null, 'Shek Chi Hong is an honest and kind person. To earn a living, Chi Hong aspires to be a chef in Man Long’s casino but he ends up becoming a dealer instead. After witnessing his teacher''s death, he is more determined not to take up gambling. But somehow, he has no choice but to learn the gambling skills as it is part of the nature of his work. He goes through many turbulence in his life, losing many friends and comrades as well as love.', 'Shek Chi Hong is an honest and kind person. To earn a living, Chi Hong aspires to be a chef in Man Long’s casino but he ends up becoming a dealer instead. After witnessing his teacher''s death, he is more determined not to take up gambling. But somehow, he has no choice but to learn the gambling skills as it is part of the nature of his work. He goes through many turbulence in his life, losing many friends and comrades as well as love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oysj5ui9fZJ9TAkPIVswlid5OsV.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:99030'),
  ('912870121000629311', 'Whoopi', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Terry Turner', null, 'Whoopi Goldberg, Wren T. Brown, Elizabeth Regen, Omid Djalili, Gordana Rashovich', 'TV-PG', 'Whoopi was an American situation comedy, starring Whoopi Goldberg. The series revolved around the events and people at her hotel, the Lamont Hotel, in New York City. The show aired on Tuesdays from September 9, 2003, on NBC to April 20, 2004.', 'Whoopi was an American situation comedy, starring Whoopi Goldberg. The series revolved around the events and people at her hotel, the Lamont Hotel, in New York City. The show aired on Tuesdays from September 9, 2003, on NBC to April 20, 2004.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fYRMjpZUBxvzU4xqvXTISJ34Bsa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:673'),
  ('183525787637361867', 'Whose Line Is It Anyway?', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Mark Leveson, Dan Patterson', 'Dan Patterson', 'Clive Anderson', 'TV-PG', 'An un-scripted comedy show in which four guest performers improvise their way through a series of games, many of which rely on audience suggestions.', 'An un-scripted comedy show in which four guest performers improvise their way through a series of games, many of which rely on audience suggestions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSUa3Jg437IJjjC2I785mQvMeQM.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:3269'),
  ('288165702134312483', 'Whose Line Is It Anyway?', 1998, 'Reality', null, null, 'Drew Carey, Ryan Stiles, Colin Mochrie, Laura Hall', 'TV-14', 'The show where everything''s made up and the points don''t matter. Not a talk show, not a sitcom, not a game show, Whose Line Is It Anyway? is a completely unique concept to network television. Four talented actors perform completely unrehearsed skits and games in front of a studio audience. Host Drew Carey sets the scene, with contributions from the audience, but the actors rely completely on their quick wit and improvisational skills. It''s genuinely improvised, so anything can happen - and often does.', 'The show where everything''s made up and the points don''t matter. Not a talk show, not a sitcom, not a game show, Whose Line Is It Anyway? is a completely unique concept to network television. Four talented actors perform completely unrehearsed skits and games in front of a studio audience. Host Drew Carey sets the scene, with contributions from the audience, but the actors rely completely on their quick wit and improvisational skills. It''s genuinely improvised, so anything can happen - and often does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAIiJFlGCnmNO1fLtXxsM0IKo8H.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:61018'),
  ('456549460324864236', 'Whose Line Is It Anyway?', 2013, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Aisha Tyler, Ryan Stiles, Colin Mochrie, Wayne Brady, Laura Hall, Linda Taylor', 'TV-PG', 'Comedian Aisha Tyler hosts this improv comedy show where the actors on the show - Wayne Brady, Colin Mochrie, Ryan Stiles along with a special guest each episode -must put their comedic skills to the test through a series of spontaneous improv games, prompted only by random ideas supplied by the studio audience.', 'Comedian Aisha Tyler hosts this improv comedy show where the actors on the show - Wayne Brady, Colin Mochrie, Ryan Stiles along with a special guest each episode -must put their comedic skills to the test through a series of spontaneous improv games, prompted only by random ideas supplied by the studio audience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZHAjDQQu3tly31K2sdAXKHqf7C.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:64978'),
  ('653347122297100742', 'Whose Vote Counts, Explained', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Joe Posner', null, 'Carol Anderson, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Carol Berkin, Stacey Abrams, George Will, Lawrence Lessig, Desmond Meade', 'TV-PG', 'The right to vote is at the foundation of America''s democracy. But not every vote is created equal. How does the system work, and can it be fixed?', 'The right to vote is at the foundation of America''s democracy. But not every vote is created equal. How does the system work, and can it be fixed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WOcIuTwCCW5aBZSqZsZFks988h.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:110343'),
  ('112668107050069586', 'Why Are You Like This?', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Naomi Higgins, Humyara Mahbub, Mark Bonanno', null, 'Naomi Higgins, Olivia Junkeer, Wil King', null, 'Penny and Mia are best friends, but they are not good for each other or anyone else. Leaving a path of destruction in their wake wherever they go, they say and do what they want - regardless of the consequences.', 'Penny and Mia are best friends, but they are not good for each other or anyone else. Leaving a path of destruction in their wake wherever they go, they say and do what they want - regardless of the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEeQkh4viZHrxnZzYR6y9xApYhO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:118945'),
  ('905399141465550290', 'Why Didn''t I Tell You a Million Times?', 2023, 'Drama, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mao Inoue, Takeru Satoh, Kenichi Matsuyama, Shim Eun-kyung, Kami Hiraiwa, Yusuke Shoji, Shota Shunputei, Yoshiyoshi Arakawa', null, 'When childhood friends Yui and Naoki are by chance reunited as adults, they begin to feel they were destined for each other. However, just as Naoki prepares to propose to Yui, he becomes embroiled in a mysterious incident and dies. Now Naoki''s soul wanders the world unable to express his true feelings for Yui. Yuzuru, a detective and the only person who can see Naoki, goes in pursuit of the truth behind Naoki’s death. At Naoki tries to use Yuzuru to talk to Yui, but will he be able to convey his message of love?', 'When childhood friends Yui and Naoki are by chance reunited as adults, they begin to feel they were destined for each other. However, just as Naoki prepares to propose to Yui, he becomes embroiled in a mysterious incident and dies. Now Naoki''s soul wanders the world unable to express his true feelings for Yui. Yuzuru, a detective and the only person who can see Naoki, goes in pursuit of the truth behind Naoki’s death. At Naoki tries to use Yuzuru to talk to Yui, but will he be able to convey his message of love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWbqcByrxw0n1u9fIcYH4sTb3C1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:216227'),
  ('58000468858505924', 'Why Didn''t They Ask Evans?', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Hugh Laurie', null, 'Will Poulter, Lucy Boynton, Maeve Dermody, Conleth Hill, Daniel Ings, Jonathan Jules, Alistair Petrie, Nicholas Asbury', 'TV-14', 'A dying man''s enigmatic last words send vicar''s son, Bobby Jones, and his socialite friend, Lady Frankie Derwent, on a crime-solving adventure.', 'A dying man''s enigmatic last words send vicar''s son, Bobby Jones, and his socialite friend, Lady Frankie Derwent, on a crime-solving adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8T8G7k5Le8e1r2Y2trCcywXTYRo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157372'),
  ('489040982259905340', 'Why Does Nobody Remember Me in This World?', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Shoya Chiba, Kana Ichinose, Haruka Shiraishi, Lynn, Hana Hishikawa, Seiichiro Yamashita, Sayumi Suzushiro', 'TV-14', 'In a world where humans triumphed in a great war, Kai guards sealed crypts containing their enemies. But when “World Rebirth” overwrites history, he’s thrust into an alternate reality where humanity lost the war and he’s been forgotten by everyone he knows. Now, this lost hero must rise to restore the world’s balance!', 'In a world where humans triumphed in a great war, Kai guards sealed crypts containing their enemies. But when “World Rebirth” overwrites history, he’s thrust into an alternate reality where humanity lost the war and he’s been forgotten by everyone he knows. Now, this lost hero must rise to restore the world’s balance!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAezbCXT3h5TyWsNoF5CXIc5AhU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244672'),
  ('1064583125246944554', 'Why Her?', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', null, null, 'Seo Hyun-jin, Hwang In-yeop, Huh Joon-ho, Bae In-hyuk, Lee Jin-hyuk, Lee Ju-woo, Lee Kyu-sung, Lee Kyung-young', null, 'A painful but exciting story of Oh Soo-jae, a cold lawyer who has become empty while pursuing only success, and Gong Chan, a law school student who is not afraid of anything to protect her.', 'A painful but exciting story of Oh Soo-jae, a cold lawyer who has become empty while pursuing only success, and Gong Chan, a law school student who is not afraid of anything to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OmQlGvYOWt8HLTfduyG4SMTTeZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136644'),
  ('1139959264185685148', 'Why I Dress Up for Love', 2021, 'Drama', null, null, 'Haruna Kawaguchi, Ryusei Yokohama, Yui Natsukawa, Ryuhei Maruyama, Anne Nakamura, Osamu Mukai, Mizuki Yamashita, Fumiya Takahashi', null, 'A busy publicist learns to open her mind and heart when she moves into a luxury apartment with a friend and her three free-spirited roommates.', 'A busy publicist learns to open her mind and heart when she moves into a luxury apartment with a friend and her three free-spirited roommates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjacRFi2FIMB6Anj3jfltHP5hts.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123491'),
  ('19382293318314825', 'Why R U?', 2020, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Candy On', null, 'Suppapong Udomkaewkanjana, Pruk Panich, Karn Kritsanaphan, Sittichok Pueakpoolpol, Arachaporn Pokinpakorn, Akalavut Mankalasut, Taralatah', null, 'Zon, an aspiring sci-fi writer, faces challenges as romantic tensions arise with Saifah, mirrored in his sister''s BL novel, while Tutor navigates his own struggles.', 'Zon, an aspiring sci-fi writer, faces challenges as romantic tensions arise with Saifah, mirrored in his sister''s BL novel, while Tutor navigates his own struggles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaI8gbPRmTeIrjRcI46Rn5IGdXC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:93972'),
  ('986193063290921554', 'Why Raeliana Ended Up at the Duke''s Mansion', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yume Miyamoto, Yuuichirou Umehara, Shuichiro Umeda, Shunichi Toki, Akira Ishida, Tomokazu Sugita, Yumika Yano, Junichi Suwabe', 'TV-14', 'Living inside a fairy tale may sound like a dream, but for this heroine, it’s more of a nightmare. After her mysterious death, Rinko is reborn as Raeliana—a loved and wealthy character in a novel. But she knows the ending: her murder at the hands of her fiancé. So, she hatches a plan to stay alive, one that involves a devilish duke and a phony engagement. Can she rewrite her story?', 'Living inside a fairy tale may sound like a dream, but for this heroine, it’s more of a nightmare. After her mysterious death, Rinko is reborn as Raeliana—a loved and wealthy character in a novel. But she knows the ending: her murder at the hands of her fiancé. So, she hatches a plan to stay alive, one that involves a devilish duke and a phony engagement. Can she rewrite her story?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruRJfBa0ehd39BgyvoJclg0SkDh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205366'),
  ('555157029399253243', 'Why the Hell Are You Here, Teacher!?', 2019, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Soborou', null, 'Sumire Uesaka, Kazutomi Yamamoto, Yuko Goto, Ryota Suzuki, Shizuka Ishigami, Nozomi Yamamoto, Yusuke Kobayashi, Toshiki Masuda', 'TV-MA', 'Ichiro Sato is about as average as a student can get... except for his above-average ability to land himself in totally awkward, intensely risqué situations with his no-nonsense teacher, Kana Kojima! Ichiro has his hands full dealing with these steamy shenanigans and unexpected encounters in the most unlikely places. At least it can’t get any worse, right?', 'Ichiro Sato is about as average as a student can get... except for his above-average ability to land himself in totally awkward, intensely risqué situations with his no-nonsense teacher, Kana Kojima! Ichiro has his hands full dealing with these steamy shenanigans and unexpected encounters in the most unlikely places. At least it can’t get any worse, right?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yss3gl6mMNT9Txvdtvnu2KTWt9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86836'),
  ('810627160399019374', 'Why Try to Change Me Now', 2023, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Zhang Dalei', 'Anyang Zhang, Rui Xiao, Bo Pang', 'Dong Zijian, Hai Qing, Qiu Tian, Liang Jingdong, Wang Zheng, Dong Baoshi, Jing Ai, Zhang Ninghao', null, 'In the 1990s, a series of murders rocks a run-down industrial city in north-eastern China.', 'In the 1990s, a series of murders rocks a run-down industrial city in north-eastern China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7tMzfCvDBaTuDKOABJXmufZuOsp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:136440'),
  ('245133228740455661', 'Why Women Kill', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Marc Cherry', null, 'Allison Tolman, Lana Parrilla, Nick Frost, B.K. Cannon, Jordane Christie, Matthew Daddario, Veronica Falcón, Virginia Williams', 'TV-MA', 'Three women living in three different decades: a housewife in the ''60s, a socialite in the ''80s and a lawyer in 2018, deal with infidelity in their marriages.', 'Three women living in three different decades: a housewife in the ''60s, a socialite in the ''80s and a lawyer in 2018, deal with infidelity in their marriages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fI3E1G5N8oimMeyYn5UzWRT2cST.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:87428'),
  ('242197156397147571', 'Why Women Love', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', null, 'Xinyue Chen', 'Boogie Wang, Jin Chen, Wang Shuang, Peng Yaqi, Zheng Miao, He Zeyuan, Wang Zheng, Nadia Chan Chung-Ling', null, 'Zhao Jiangyue, the no-nonsense head of a tech firm, is a master at business but clueless in matters of the heart. When Gu Jiaxin, heir to a business group and a successful racing driver, is assigned as her temporary assistant, they clash.', 'Zhao Jiangyue, the no-nonsense head of a tech firm, is a master at business but clueless in matters of the heart. When Gu Jiaxin, heir to a business group and a successful racing driver, is assigned as her temporary assistant, they clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzBscjJvsw8WD0UI0MaWBcDqEwy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:157255'),
  ('645143244911300806', 'Wicked Attraction', 2008, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'NR', 'Wicked Attraction is a true-crime documentary television series on Investigation Discovery which began airing in the United States in 2008. The series focuses on how two seemingly ordinary people can come together to commit heinous crimes, thereby forming a "wicked attraction."', 'Wicked Attraction is a true-crime documentary television series on Investigation Discovery which began airing in the United States in 2008. The series focuses on how two seemingly ordinary people can come together to commit heinous crimes, thereby forming a "wicked attraction."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFOKscbRK2nk2SD109HJX5S3buo.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:39538'),
  ('720148408852798022', 'Wicked City', 2015, 'Drama, Crime', 'Steven Baigelman', null, 'Erika Christensen, Ed Westwick, Taissa Farmiga, Anne Winters, Karolina Wydra, Gabriel Luna, Evan Ross, Jaime Ray Newman', 'TV-14', 'Detectives Jack and Paco investigate a murder spree on the rock ’n’ roll, cocaine-infused revelry of the Sunset Strip.', 'Detectives Jack and Paco investigate a murder spree on the rock ’n’ roll, cocaine-infused revelry of the Sunset Strip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myEcHo82olJ5HM5IC9hTCehSpIV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62927'),
  ('141065570987972850', 'Wicked City', 2022, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, null, null, 'A group of urban witches push their powers to new heights and uncover dark secrets that attract dangerous enemies their way.', 'A group of urban witches push their powers to new heights and uncover dark secrets that attract dangerous enemies their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfMPjMaxBA2kmSB6RLNKsa56CDO.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:214986'),
  ('1087751185507229691', 'Wicked Science', 2004, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jonathan M. Shiff', null, 'André de Vanny, Bridget Neval, Benjamin Schmideg, Greta Larkins, Emma Leonard, Brook Sykes, Matylda Buczko, Nikolai Nikolaeff', 'TV-Y7', 'Toby Johnson is a regular easy-going student struggling with homework and girls. Elizabeth Hawke is the teacher''s pet and nobody at school likes her. One day they get hit by a ray - a unique magnetic pulse that changes every thing. Suddenly they are both scientific geniuses! Elizabeth revels in her new found power and want to dominate the school. She decides she must eliminate Toby.', 'Toby Johnson is a regular easy-going student struggling with homework and girls. Elizabeth Hawke is the teacher''s pet and nobody at school likes her. One day they get hit by a ray - a unique magnetic pulse that changes every thing. Suddenly they are both scientific geniuses! Elizabeth revels in her new found power and want to dominate the school. She decides she must eliminate Toby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3RxN4rhyYhOY4rdSARoYsJQLIhZ.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:15851'),
  ('112463773084107332', 'Wicked Tuna', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Reality', null, null, 'Dave Marciano, Dave Carraro, T.J. Ott, Tyler McLaughlin', 'TV-14', 'Fishing is a hard life, and harder with bluefin stocks depleted. In Gloucester, Massachusetts, there''s a special breed of fishermen. For generations they''ve used rod and reel to catch the elusive bluefin tuna. They depend on these fish for their livelihood, and the competition is brutal. Over the next 10 weeks, the most skilled fishermen will set out in the frigid waters of the North Atlantic in hopes of catching the valuable bluefin tuna. When one bluefin can bring in as much as $20,000—they''ll do whatever it takes to hook up.', 'Fishing is a hard life, and harder with bluefin stocks depleted. In Gloucester, Massachusetts, there''s a special breed of fishermen. For generations they''ve used rod and reel to catch the elusive bluefin tuna. They depend on these fish for their livelihood, and the competition is brutal. Over the next 10 weeks, the most skilled fishermen will set out in the frigid waters of the North Atlantic in hopes of catching the valuable bluefin tuna. When one bluefin can bring in as much as $20,000—they''ll do whatever it takes to hook up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1N5U6tTEl36OcLXgt4UnaPtC3M.jpg', 13, 'tmdb:tv:62598'),
  ('357661185031414353', 'Wicked Tuna: Outer Banks', 2014, 'Reality', null, null, 'Dave Marciano, Britton Shackelford, Tyler McLaughlin, Greg Meyer, TJ Ott', 'TV-14', 'The long, cold winter has just hit New England, and while the bluefin tuna season has come to an end in Gloucester, Mass., it’s just getting started in the Outer Banks of North Carolina. After a disappointing season, several of Gloucester’s top fishermen head south to try to salvage their finances by fishing for the elusive bluefin tuna in unfamiliar Carolina waters before the experienced locals beat them to the catch. It’s a whole new battlefield and the Northern captains must conquer new styles of fishing, treacherous waters and the wrath of the Outer Banks’ top fishermen. They’re gambling on what could be a massive payday … or a huge financial loss.', 'The long, cold winter has just hit New England, and while the bluefin tuna season has come to an end in Gloucester, Mass., it’s just getting started in the Outer Banks of North Carolina. After a disappointing season, several of Gloucester’s top fishermen head south to try to salvage their finances by fishing for the elusive bluefin tuna in unfamiliar Carolina waters before the experienced locals beat them to the catch. It’s a whole new battlefield and the Northern captains must conquer new styles of fishing, treacherous waters and the wrath of the Outer Banks’ top fishermen. They’re gambling on what could be a massive payday … or a huge financial loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZLdxqTHRvXD7DNXQgjMGAFnZKD.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:64054'),
  ('500111785550500966', 'Wie is de Mol?', 1999, 'Mystery, Reality', 'Michiel Devlieger, Tom Lenaerts, Michel Vanhove', null, 'Rik van de Westelaken', null, 'Ten candidates have to complete assignments to earn money. However, one of the group members is the Mole. The Mole''s goal is to make the assignments fail and keep the amount of money earned as low as possible. The other candidates do not know who the Mole is and need to unmask them. At the end of every episode, the candidates take a multiple-choice test about the mole''s identity. The person who gives the least amount of correct answers is "executed" and must leave. This process continues until only two contestants and the Mole remain. The winner is the person with the most correct answers in the final test and they get all of the money earned in previous stages of the game.', 'Ten candidates have to complete assignments to earn money. However, one of the group members is the Mole. The Mole''s goal is to make the assignments fail and keep the amount of money earned as low as possible. The other candidates do not know who the Mole is and need to unmask them. At the end of every episode, the candidates take a multiple-choice test about the mole''s identity. The person who gives the least amount of correct answers is "executed" and must leave. This process continues until only two contestants and the Mole remain. The winner is the person with the most correct answers in the final test and they get all of the money earned in previous stages of the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkEsscRSAWuaYi8ijbTiceGbVTz.jpg', 26, 'tmdb:tv:14784'),
  ('439081489558460243', 'Wielerclub Wattage', 2023, null, null, null, 'Ruben Van Gucht, Mark Uytterhoeven, Jan Bakelants, Tom Boonen, Dirk De Wolf', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haXZrHGd24CNXjBf37vqMhgSyUI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:301078'),
  ('97220288709918194', 'Wild Abandon', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Hakan Günday, Onur Saylak', 'Hakan Günday', 'Öner Erkan, Uğur Yücel, Haluk Bilginer, Songül Öden, Nezaket Erden, Gazanfer Ündüz, Erdem Şenocak, Serkan Altunorak', 'TV-MA', 'In the haze of a midlife crisis, an architect begins living a double life as a punk while members of his family lead their own crisis-ridden lives.', 'In the haze of a midlife crisis, an architect begins living a double life as a punk while members of his family lead their own crisis-ridden lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izMNeTaDDIMMrjxWp2OkBxR60wC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158809'),
  ('217503482091336827', 'Wild Ambition Bloom', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Rayzha Alimjan, Tony Yang, Mao Zijun, Tang Zeng, Chai Biyun, Xuan Yan, Zhang Jiayue', null, 'In 1916, Chu Shaohua marries Chen Dashun, the eldest son of the Chen family’s pharmacy, to save her brother. With integrity and sharp business skills, she earns the respect of Chen’s father and becomes the manager. After the sudden deaths of Chen’s father and Dashun, the pharmacy passes to Chen Ershun, who squanders the family fortune, driving it to ruin. Through hardship, Chu Shaohua establishes Huashun Pharmacy to support the family. Just as she plans to start a new life with her first love, Xia Chu, Chen Ershun and his mother block her path. When bandits raid the Chen household, Chu loses her daughter and, devastated, leaves for Shanghai. There, her outstanding performance at Yongxin Department Store draws the attention of business talent Wen Zhiqiu, who invites her to co-found a new venture. Step by step, she rises to become a bold and trustworthy woman entrepreneur.', 'In 1916, Chu Shaohua marries Chen Dashun, the eldest son of the Chen family’s pharmacy, to save her brother. With integrity and sharp business skills, she earns the respect of Chen’s father and becomes the manager. After the sudden deaths of Chen’s father and Dashun, the pharmacy passes to Chen Ershun, who squanders the family fortune, driving it to ruin. Through hardship, Chu Shaohua establishes Huashun Pharmacy to support the family. Just as she plans to start a new life with her first love, Xia Chu, Chen Ershun and his mother block her path. When bandits raid the Chen household, Chu loses her daughter and, devastated, leaves for Shanghai. There, her outstanding performance at Yongxin Department Store draws the attention of business talent Wen Zhiqiu, who invites her to co-found a new venture. Step by step, she rises to become a bold and trustworthy woman entrepreneur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1kC9v1RPvrAF7VuQf20MqufnwHA.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254488'),
  ('482573448734438110', 'Wild and Free: Cabo', 2024, 'Reality', null, null, 'Fernando Lozada, Niurka Marcos, Carlos ''Capi'' Pérez, Kristal Silva, Victoria Volkova, Celeste Cheles, Fede del Real, Yámir Gonzalez', 'TV-MA', 'Eight hot, young singles arrive to an amazing villa in Los Cabos, San Lucas for the vacation of a lifetime.', 'Eight hot, young singles arrive to an amazing villa in Los Cabos, San Lucas for the vacation of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q14a64vyhYDPfZatcP4yHX76A44.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:251026'),
  ('530110157926907784', 'Wild Angel', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Soap', 'Enrique Torres', 'Enrique Torres', 'Natalia Oreiro, Facundo Arana, Victoria Onetto, Gabriela Sari, Veronica Vieyra, Marcelo Mazzarello, Segundo Cernadas, Lydia Lamaison', null, 'An orphan who''s working in a Mansion, falls in love with the owners'' son.', 'An orphan who''s working in a Mansion, falls in love with the owners'' son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cMMiFdM9KZqJAjHTisSRYSR3YlN.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16135'),
  ('1130628682600688820', 'Wild Arabia', 2013, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Alexander Siddig', 'TV-PG', 'Deep in the Gulf region is one of the world''s last great wildernesses - a mysterious and magical landscape hidden to the world for decades. Observe the dramatic and varied geology and extraordinary wildlife in the world premiere of ''WILD ARABIA''. With unparalleled access, Animal Planet takes viewers to the crossroads of three continents to a clandestine kingdom of rich culture and breathtaking beauty. Once the trade hub of the ancient world, Arabia has transitioned into a secluded splendor where the modern world brushes up against a vast and ageless sweeping terrain. Feast your eyes on the scenic and sculptural sand dunes of Saudi Arabia and Oman, which are populated by camel trains and elegant white gazelles. Discover the scores of undersea volcanoes in the deep trenches off the coast of Yemen, and uncover the secrets of the Tigris-Euphrates River Delta.', 'Deep in the Gulf region is one of the world''s last great wildernesses - a mysterious and magical landscape hidden to the world for decades. Observe the dramatic and varied geology and extraordinary wildlife in the world premiere of ''WILD ARABIA''. With unparalleled access, Animal Planet takes viewers to the crossroads of three continents to a clandestine kingdom of rich culture and breathtaking beauty. Once the trade hub of the ancient world, Arabia has transitioned into a secluded splendor where the modern world brushes up against a vast and ageless sweeping terrain. Feast your eyes on the scenic and sculptural sand dunes of Saudi Arabia and Oman, which are populated by camel trains and elegant white gazelles. Discover the scores of undersea volcanoes in the deep trenches off the coast of Yemen, and uncover the secrets of the Tigris-Euphrates River Delta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSbv75P2tJ2ZQ5hoajZuJhHbqX0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:55757'),
  ('953081637439756260', 'Wild at Heart', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ashley Pharoah', null, 'Stephen Tompkinson, Deon Stewardson', 'TV-PG', 'The Trevanion family decide to make a fresh start and emigrate to South Africa to set up an animal reserve.', 'The Trevanion family decide to make a fresh start and emigrate to South Africa to set up an animal reserve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2G2OOYHpY0vIzP9OMvlMTlbsUNa.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:1193'),
  ('572131367295327870', 'Wild at Heart', 2013, 'Drama, Soap', 'Carlos Romero, Inés Rodena', 'Julio Garibay, Tere Medina, Carlos Romero', 'Ana Brenda Contreras, Daniel Arenas, Elizabeth Álvarez, César Évora Díaz, René Strickler, Sergio Goyri, María Elena Velasco, Rocío Banquells', 'TV-14', 'Corazón indomable is a Mexican telenovela produced by Nathalie Lartilleux for Televisa. It is a remake of Marimar, produced in 1994, and starring Thalía and Eduardo Capetillo. Ana Brenda Contreras and Daniel Arenas star as the protagonists, while Ingrid Martz, Elizabeth Álvarez, Carlos de la Mota and René Strickler star as the antagonists.', 'Corazón indomable is a Mexican telenovela produced by Nathalie Lartilleux for Televisa. It is a remake of Marimar, produced in 1994, and starring Thalía and Eduardo Capetillo. Ana Brenda Contreras and Daniel Arenas star as the protagonists, while Ingrid Martz, Elizabeth Álvarez, Carlos de la Mota and René Strickler star as the antagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yXpYJyLptcASCUQxLI4bbE4SmZ2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:58539'),
  ('445868132511381712', 'Wild Babies', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Helena Bonham Carter', 'TV-PG', 'The adventures of lion cubs, elephants, penguins, pangolins and more as they learn to cope with the ups and downs of life in the wild and try their best to reach adulthood in an unforgiving world.', 'The adventures of lion cubs, elephants, penguins, pangolins and more as they learn to cope with the ups and downs of life in the wild and try their best to reach adulthood in an unforgiving world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui3SWr6Vgpw5bdev3zdz4xXWn8G.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201006'),
  ('1113980489184976662', 'Wild Bill', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Dudi Appleton, David Griffiths, Jim Keeble', null, 'Rob Lowe, Aloreia Spencer, Bronwyn James, Anjli Mohindra, Anthony Flanagan, Divian Ladwa', 'TV-14', 'U.S. police chief Bill Hixon lands in the British town of Boston, Lincolnshire, with his 14-year-old daughter Kelsey in tow hoping they can flee their painful recent past. But this unfamiliar, unimpressed community will force Bill to question everything about himself and leave him asking whether it''s Boston that needs Bill, or Bill that needs Boston?', 'U.S. police chief Bill Hixon lands in the British town of Boston, Lincolnshire, with his 14-year-old daughter Kelsey in tow hoping they can flee their painful recent past. But this unfamiliar, unimpressed community will force Bill to question everything about himself and leave him asking whether it''s Boston that needs Bill, or Bill that needs Boston?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIvBbZ1yq3tzIXKqhU3VxYPbizF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:83074'),
  ('686141605973750689', 'Wild Bloom', 2022, 'Drama', null, 'Zhang Ting, Xian Zhang, Zheng Shilong', 'Zhao Liying, Ou Hao, Li Guangjie, Huang Chengcheng, Liu Wei, Ke Lan, Ren Zhong, Wang Jinsong', null, 'During the 1990s, Xu Ban Xia is a woman with vision and strength who overcomes many obstacles in the male-dominated steel industry to carve out a place for herself. Xu Ban Xia''s mother died during childbirth while her father never cared for her. In spite of this, Xu Ban Xia has grown tough, proud and fearless in the face of challenges. Xu Ban Xia and her good friends Xiao Chen and Tong Xiao Qi venture into the transport of scrap steel. In an industry where men have an absolute advantage, Xu Ban Xia relies on her adventurous spirit and pragmatic attitude to weather many untold hardships and even survives death. She eventually opens up an international steel import business. Xu Banxia develops a keen sense for the market to gradually expands their business, pushing herself to grow in her field while also finding love.', 'During the 1990s, Xu Ban Xia is a woman with vision and strength who overcomes many obstacles in the male-dominated steel industry to carve out a place for herself. Xu Ban Xia''s mother died during childbirth while her father never cared for her. In spite of this, Xu Ban Xia has grown tough, proud and fearless in the face of challenges. Xu Ban Xia and her good friends Xiao Chen and Tong Xiao Qi venture into the transport of scrap steel. In an industry where men have an absolute advantage, Xu Ban Xia relies on her adventurous spirit and pragmatic attitude to weather many untold hardships and even survives death. She eventually opens up an international steel import business. Xu Banxia develops a keen sense for the market to gradually expands their business, pushing herself to grow in her field while also finding love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8rC5JOmnlCb41sqYnSVM9toecf.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138289'),
  ('1062533473411418719', 'Wild Cards', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy, Mystery', 'Michael Konyves', null, 'Vanessa Morgan, Giacomo Gianniotti', 'TV-14', 'A spirited con woman and a demoted by-the-book detective are given the chance to redeem themselves. The catch? They have to find a way to work together each using their unique skills to solve crimes.', 'A spirited con woman and a demoted by-the-book detective are given the chance to redeem themselves. The catch? They have to find a way to work together each using their unique skills to solve crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIhkV9LNwViVD2bylPTFQvDD21e.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:240932'),
  ('597472219070093127', 'Wild Cherry', 2025, 'Drama', 'Nicôle Lecky', null, 'Eve Best, Carmen Ejogo, Imogen Faires, Amelia May, Sophie Winkleman, Nicôle Lecky, Hayat Kamille, Katarina Čas', null, 'Two pampered teenage daughters. Two very different mothers. The rich life is easy – until a shocking scandal reveals toxic secrets and the ugly side of glamour.', 'Two pampered teenage daughters. Two very different mothers. The rich life is easy – until a shocking scandal reveals toxic secrets and the ugly side of glamour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxn4ylDZSnQq83H0jXAmueBFV8A.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:275557'),
  ('359121611909736198', 'Wild China', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Gavin Maxwell', 'George Chan, Gavin Maxwell', 'Bernard Hill, 李易', null, 'The dazzling array of mysterious and wonderful creatures that live in China''s most beautiful landscapes.', 'The dazzling array of mysterious and wonderful creatures that live in China''s most beautiful landscapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YP8fFb0GI4j1QxuYHxLpyGmQUY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20574'),
  ('709295234344535000', 'Wild Crime', 2021, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Eighty-five million acres make up the National Park System, and only 33 special agents nationwide are responsible for investigating crimes that occur on this public land. This documentary series follows the uniquely qualified team that leads the investigations as they seek to bring law and order to some of America’s most rugged and remote landscapes, tackling a new case each season.', 'Eighty-five million acres make up the National Park System, and only 33 special agents nationwide are responsible for investigating crimes that occur on this public land. This documentary series follows the uniquely qualified team that leads the investigations as they seek to bring law and order to some of America’s most rugged and remote landscapes, tackling a new case each season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNtr8sOVDlK1gcXfnJknjjvOzQU.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:135134'),
  ('113217336832819133', 'Wild District', 2018, 'Drama', 'Cristian Conti', 'Cristian Conti', 'Juan Pablo Raba, Cristina Umaña, Paula Castaño, Juan Fernando Sánchez, Camila Sodi, Albi De Abreu, Susana Torres', 'TV-MA', 'After surrendering to Bogotá police, an ex-guerrilla avoids prison by working undercover to investigate a ruthless enforcer of government corruption.', 'After surrendering to Bogotá police, an ex-guerrilla avoids prison by working undercover to investigate a ruthless enforcer of government corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/coyfjuyskcsuQXQEWoYqXWUEvVf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83245'),
  ('34745228202991625', 'Wild Flower', 2011, 'Soap, Drama', 'Hugo León Ferrer', null, 'Roberto Manrique, Tony Dalton, Mónica Spear, José Luis Reséndez, María Elisa Camargo, Gregorio Pernía, Géraldine Zivic, Norkys Batista', 'TV-14', 'The young Amanda Monteverde, after losing her mother and her brother, has to take care of her three younger sisters. To escape from that stormy past, they move to Nueva Esperanza, a small town that is starting in the oil industry. There he will experience even more difficult situations, but he will also know love in three men: Sacramento, the man who will be his faithful friend and his innocent love; Pablo Aguilar, the man who will be his madness and his passion, and finally Don Rafael Urrieta, the most powerful man in the town, who will try to be practically his master and master as he is of most of those lands. Amanda will have to grow, look for a future and happiness in the village. The first attempt to find this happiness is made by trying to enter a bar in the village, "Las 4 P", where the locals try to achieve a more cheerful life, along with music, liquor, singing, the dances and "the women of the consolations". This is the name with which Amanda began to call the profession of the two women, Sara and Calzones, who were the ones who offered her some protection upon arrival in such an unknown place. The need for money to protect her sisters and make them stay by her side and the desperation of not being able to get the means to do so lead Amanda to accept this kind of life to achieve it. However, on the day of her initiation, where she will be known under the nickname "Wild Flower", fate will lead her to become a woman of one man: "The wife of Don Rafael Urrieta"; a powerful and cruel man who keeps his wife, Catalina, locked in his farm in inhumane conditions for having been unfaithful. Don Rafael decides that "Flor" is only for him, but that exclusivity is only of body, because "Flor" reserves his heart for the man who someday makes her discover love.', 'The young Amanda Monteverde, after losing her mother and her brother, has to take care of her three younger sisters. To escape from that stormy past, they move to Nueva Esperanza, a small town that is starting in the oil industry. There he will experience even more difficult situations, but he will also know love in three men: Sacramento, the man who will be his faithful friend and his innocent love; Pablo Aguilar, the man who will be his madness and his passion, and finally Don Rafael Urrieta, the most powerful man in the town, who will try to be practically his master and master as he is of most of those lands. Amanda will have to grow, look for a future and happiness in the village. The first attempt to find this happiness is made by trying to enter a bar in the village, "Las 4 P", where the locals try to achieve a more cheerful life, along with music, liquor, singing, the dances and "the women of the consolations". This is the name with which Amanda began to call the profession of the two women, Sara and Calzones, who were the ones who offered her some protection upon arrival in such an unknown place. The need for money to protect her sisters and make them stay by her side and the desperation of not being able to get the means to do so lead Amanda to accept this kind of life to achieve it. However, on the day of her initiation, where she will be known under the nickname "Wild Flower", fate will lead her to become a woman of one man: "The wife of Don Rafael Urrieta"; a powerful and cruel man who keeps his wife, Catalina, locked in his farm in inhumane conditions for having been unfaithful. Don Rafael decides that "Flor" is only for him, but that exclusivity is only of body, because "Flor" reserves his heart for the man who someday makes her discover love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFIGlDGpRLIhD9C5nER4xZLkQjt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:39563'),
  ('690869110398739488', 'Wild Heart', 2023, 'Drama', 'Çağatay Tosun', null, 'Halit Özgür Sarı, Yurdaer Okur, Dolunay Soysert, Bertan Asllani, Bertan Aslani, Rojbin Erden, Sezer Arıçay, Seray Özkan', null, 'It tells the story of a child who was kidnapped from a deep-rooted family and fell into the streets, and his struggle to reinvent himself after years later returning to his home.', 'It tells the story of a child who was kidnapped from a deep-rooted family and fell into the streets, and his struggle to reinvent himself after years later returning to his home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eixnqRSbRDrcLP6UuVlh8UrYTbf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:231503'),
  ('446463895891609114', 'Wild Isles', 2023, 'Documentary', null, null, 'David Attenborough', 'TV-Y', 'This nature documentary introduces viewers to the fauna and flora of Britain and Ireland across four main areas: woodlands, grasslands, freshwater and marine.', 'This nature documentary introduces viewers to the fauna and flora of Britain and Ireland across four main areas: woodlands, grasslands, freshwater and marine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IQm2H0D9rkJCziGZrEcPROWUhI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208230'),
  ('483419177681196868', 'Wild Kratts', 2011, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Martin Kratt, Chris Kratt', 'Chris Kratt, Martin Kratt', 'Chris Kratt, Martin Kratt, Athena Karkanis, Jonathan Malen, Heather Bambrick', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of Chris and Martin Kratt as they encounter incredible wild animals, combining science education with fun and adventure as the duo travels to animal habitats around the globe.', 'The adventures of Chris and Martin Kratt as they encounter incredible wild animals, combining science education with fun and adventure as the duo travels to animal habitats around the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Nn1AZb6LJv0WedeK7o4yU6Aioh.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:35094'),
  ('11284529363126999', 'Wild Palms', 1993, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Bruce Wagner, Oliver Stone', 'Bruce Wagner', 'Jim Belushi, Dana Delany, Robert Loggia, Kim Cattrall, Angie Dickinson, Ernie Hudson, Bebe Neuwirth, Bob Gunton', 'NR', 'A man uncovers a dangerous web of schemes and deceit when he accepts the presidency of a TV company.', 'A man uncovers a dangerous web of schemes and deceit when he accepts the presidency of a TV company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFmm48ctKF4es5bLqIT21cFkwLS.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:3283'),
  ('952246995936984896', 'Wild Republic', 2021, 'Drama, Action & Adventure', 'Jan Martin Scharf, Arne Nolting, Klaus Wolfertstetter', null, 'Verena Altenberger, Emma Nova, Merlin Rose, Maria Dragus, Béla Gabor Lenz, Rouven Israel, Aaron Altaras, Camille Dombrowsky', 'TV-MA', 'In the midst of the impassable landscape at the foot of the Alps, a young group of serious offenders is undergoing an experiential educational program intended to rehabilitate them. All of a sudden, a member of the program dies a violent death. Nobody knows exactly what happened, and the youths face a difficult decision. Should they wait for the authorities to recover the body and investigate the crime? Or, escape and take their fate into their own hands? The group doesn''t have much in common with each other, though one thing unites them; all of them have had really bad experiences with the authorities and don‘t expect to be treated fairly. Since they don''t know who the perpetrator is, they only have one option: to run. Up the mountains, up the highest peaks of the Alps. It seems hopeless until they stumble onto a complex cave system where they can find shelter from wind, weather, and their pursuers.', 'In the midst of the impassable landscape at the foot of the Alps, a young group of serious offenders is undergoing an experiential educational program intended to rehabilitate them. All of a sudden, a member of the program dies a violent death. Nobody knows exactly what happened, and the youths face a difficult decision. Should they wait for the authorities to recover the body and investigate the crime? Or, escape and take their fate into their own hands? The group doesn''t have much in common with each other, though one thing unites them; all of them have had really bad experiences with the authorities and don‘t expect to be treated fairly. Since they don''t know who the perpetrator is, they only have one option: to run. Up the mountains, up the highest peaks of the Alps. It seems hopeless until they stumble onto a complex cave system where they can find shelter from wind, weather, and their pursuers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrktuA8dfZzGYzbqMEJIskJKKiX.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:123348'),
  ('343998501437015270', 'Wild Russia', 2008, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-G', 'Through unprecedented access we showcase the spectacle that is Wild Russia. From east to west, via mountains, volcanoes, deserts, lakes and Arctic ice, this breathtaking six-part series uses stunning cinematography to chart the dazzling natural wonders of this vast country.', 'Through unprecedented access we showcase the spectacle that is Wild Russia. From east to west, via mountains, volcanoes, deserts, lakes and Arctic ice, this breathtaking six-part series uses stunning cinematography to chart the dazzling natural wonders of this vast country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ymCHIuHZOQjcdwYjB6xrhLHKHo.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:28312'),
  ('886323379584131644', 'Wild Vacation Rentals', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Sherry Cola, D''Arcy Carden', null, 'Comedians and best friends D''Arcy Carden and Sherry Cola hit the road to discover the wildest vacation rentals across America.', 'Comedians and best friends D''Arcy Carden and Sherry Cola hit the road to discover the wildest vacation rentals across America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzsMYXU52SqjQ3CmMxM8SEf24Sb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:313755'),
  ('131681501585116905', 'Wild Wild Country', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Ma Anand Sheela, Jane Stork, Jon Bowerman, Ma Prem Sunshine, Philip Toelkes, Bhagwan Shree Rajneesh, George Meredith, Krishna Devi', 'TV-MA', 'When a controversial cult leader builds a utopian city in the Oregon desert, conflict with the locals escalates into a national scandal.', 'When a controversial cult leader builds a utopian city in the Oregon desert, conflict with the locals escalates into a national scandal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kprB5Jj2LYQAYlqVQMEucT2vGt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:77601'),
  ('690190063715447023', 'Wildboyz', 2003, 'Reality, Comedy', 'Jeff Tremaine', null, 'Chris Pontius, Steve-O', null, 'Jackass stars Chris Pontius and Steve-O travel the globe to places like India, Mexico, Africa, Thailand, Argentina, Thailand, Argentina, for a nature show with a Jackass twist.', 'Jackass stars Chris Pontius and Steve-O travel the globe to places like India, Mexico, Africa, Thailand, Argentina, Thailand, Argentina, for a nature show with a Jackass twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UAt71W3AkW1dRzCR71ioZT5pY3.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:20'),
  ('173998859116409899', 'WildC.A.T.S: Covert Action Teams', 1994, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Jim Lee', 'Jim Lee, John Besmehn, Brandon Choi', 'Janet-Laine Green, Denis Akiyama, Colin O''Meara, Dean McDermott, Rod Wilson, Ruth Marshall, Maurice Dean Wint, Sean McCann', 'TV-G', '10,000 years ago, amidst a war that spanned millennia, the Kherubim and Daemonites crashed on the planet Earth. While the Kherubim assimilated, the Daemonites carried their plans of domination underground, until which time they could resurface and conquer not only Earth… but the entire galaxy. Now… the time has come, necessitating the Kherubim and their descendants to emerge, mobilize and form the Covert Action Teams (WildC.A.T.s). Their mission: to fight the evil Daemonite forces and ensure the safety and sovereignty of the planet. Watch how it begins and ends as Warblade, Zealot, Grifter, Spartan, Voodoo, Maul, and Void go head to head with Lord Helspont and the evil Daemonites to determine the fate of the universe.', '10,000 years ago, amidst a war that spanned millennia, the Kherubim and Daemonites crashed on the planet Earth. While the Kherubim assimilated, the Daemonites carried their plans of domination underground, until which time they could resurface and conquer not only Earth… but the entire galaxy. Now… the time has come, necessitating the Kherubim and their descendants to emerge, mobilize and form the Covert Action Teams (WildC.A.T.s). Their mission: to fight the evil Daemonite forces and ensure the safety and sovereignty of the planet. Watch how it begins and ends as Warblade, Zealot, Grifter, Spartan, Voodoo, Maul, and Void go head to head with Lord Helspont and the evil Daemonites to determine the fate of the universe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZ7xXDR1b65yXUth2Wc6B3N5s8e.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9987'),
  ('347933680209391655', 'Wilder', 2017, 'Crime', 'Béla Batthyany, Alexander Szombath', 'Béla Batthyiany, Alex Szombath', 'Sarah Spale, Marcus Signer, Andreas Matti, Ruth Schwegler, Emanuela von Frankenberg, László I. Kish, Julian Koechlin, Sabina Schneebeli', null, 'A detective returns to her home town in the Swiss mountains, to remember her brother who died in an accident many years ago along with several other children. After a murder in town, she stays and starts to investigate.', 'A detective returns to her home town in the Swiss mountains, to remember her brother who died in an accident many years ago along with several other children. After a murder in town, she stays and starts to investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGAEXPdj0HDNkuIMej9QlUyF7Ev.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:75816'),
  ('886772750402704515', 'Wilderness', 2023, 'Drama', 'Marnie Dickens', 'Marnie Dickens', 'Jenna Coleman, Oliver Jackson-Cohen', 'TV-MA', 'A dream holiday becomes a nightmare for a young British couple who seemingly have it all, as heartbreak turns into fury and revenge.', 'A dream holiday becomes a nightmare for a young British couple who seemingly have it all, as heartbreak turns into fury and revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqUjxzXQOeHxIQQXs9p547VzGYe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:204276'),
  ('746716053465001843', 'Wildfire', 1986, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids, Family', 'Kelly Ward, Jeff Segal', null, 'René Auberjonois, Billy Barty, Jessica Walter, David Ackroyd, John Vernon, Robert Jayne, Susan Blu, Georgi Irene', null, 'Wildfire is an American animated series produced by Hanna-Barbera in 1986. The series follows the adventures of Sara, a 13-year-old girl growing up in the American West, as she discovers her true identity as a princess-in-hiding from another realm who is destined to fight an evil witch. The show was first broadcast on CBS for a single 13-episode season from September 13 to December 6, 1986.', 'Wildfire is an American animated series produced by Hanna-Barbera in 1986. The series follows the adventures of Sara, a 13-year-old girl growing up in the American West, as she discovers her true identity as a princess-in-hiding from another realm who is destined to fight an evil witch. The show was first broadcast on CBS for a single 13-episode season from September 13 to December 6, 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4u5HB5IUw41f3tuts3ri0jdd1t3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9838'),
  ('32092469582192783', 'Wildfire', 2005, 'Drama, Family', 'Michael Piller', null, 'Genevieve Padalecki, Micah Alberti, Ryan Sypek, Nicole Tubiola, Nana Visitor, Greg Serano, James Read', 'TV-14', 'After serving time at a juvenile detention center, eighteen-year-old Kris Furillo is given the opportunity to start a new life. Her talent with horses is recognized by a volunteer and local trainer, who arranges a job for her at the Ritter''s family run ranch.', 'After serving time at a juvenile detention center, eighteen-year-old Kris Furillo is given the opportunity to start a new life. Her talent with horses is recognized by a volunteer and local trainer, who arranges a job for her at the Ritter''s family run ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbS3CRtYz1HfmOWiMueaSnudOtB.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:2464'),
  ('1015904934065432171', 'Wilfred', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Jason Gann, Adam Zwar', null, 'Jason Gann, Adam Zwar, Cindy Waddingham', null, 'Wilfred is an Australian comedy television series directed by Tony Rogers, produced by Jenny Livingston and starring Jason Gann, Adam Zwar and Cindy Waddingham. Created by Zwar, Gann and Rogers, it was based on their award-winning 2002 short film and later adapted to a series. The story follows the lives of the eponymous dog Wilfred, his owner Sarah, and her boyfriend Adam, who sees Wilfred as a man in a dog suit. Two seasons were broadcast on SBS One – the first in 2007 and the second in 2010. The series won three AFI Awards and was nominated for a Logie. Independent Film Channel acquired the international broadcast rights to the original two seasons of Wilfred in 2010. A U.S. version premiered on the cable channel FX on 23 June 2011.', 'Wilfred is an Australian comedy television series directed by Tony Rogers, produced by Jenny Livingston and starring Jason Gann, Adam Zwar and Cindy Waddingham. Created by Zwar, Gann and Rogers, it was based on their award-winning 2002 short film and later adapted to a series. The story follows the lives of the eponymous dog Wilfred, his owner Sarah, and her boyfriend Adam, who sees Wilfred as a man in a dog suit. Two seasons were broadcast on SBS One – the first in 2007 and the second in 2010. The series won three AFI Awards and was nominated for a Logie. Independent Film Channel acquired the international broadcast rights to the original two seasons of Wilfred in 2010. A U.S. version premiered on the cable channel FX on 23 June 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mcHiMDfy3HjykGeUgNlWaIDliW.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:3297'),
  ('385739804218458883', 'Wilfred', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Adam Zwar, Jason Gann', null, 'Elijah Wood, Jason Gann, Fiona Gubelmann, Dorian Brown Pham', 'TV-MA', 'Everyone else sees Wilfred as just a dog, but Ryan sees a crude and somewhat surly, yet irrepressibly brave and honest Australian bloke in a cheap dog suit. While leading him through a series of comedic and existential adventures, Wilfred the dog shows Ryan the man how to overcome his fears and joyfully embrace the unpredictability and insanity of the world around him.', 'Everyone else sees Wilfred as just a dog, but Ryan sees a crude and somewhat surly, yet irrepressibly brave and honest Australian bloke in a cheap dog suit. While leading him through a series of comedic and existential adventures, Wilfred the dog shows Ryan the man how to overcome his fears and joyfully embrace the unpredictability and insanity of the world around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cUYCkmHEWsxaNiVTQnFqxyq5Ij.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:39525'),
  ('313506058246001561', 'Wilfred (US)', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'David Zuckerman, Sivert Glarum, Patricia Breen, Steve Tompkins, Michael Glouberman', 'David Zuckerman, Sivert Glarum, Patricia Breen, Steve Tompkins, Michael Glouberman, Eric Weinberg', 'Elijah Wood, Jason Gann, Fiona Gubelmann, Dorian Brown Pham, Chris Klein', 'TV-MA', 'The story of Ryan Newman (Elijah Wood), a depressed man who believes he is getting nowhere in his life and plans to kill himself. In the middle of his attempted suicide, he is asked to watch his neighbor''s dog, Wilfred (Jason Gann), but Ryan can only see Wilfred as a real person instead of an animal that everyone else sees. As they begin to bond more and become friends, Wilfred teaches Ryan a life lesson about people, love, and living.', 'The story of Ryan Newman (Elijah Wood), a depressed man who believes he is getting nowhere in his life and plans to kill himself. In the middle of his attempted suicide, he is asked to watch his neighbor''s dog, Wilfred (Jason Gann), but Ryan can only see Wilfred as a real person instead of an animal that everyone else sees. As they begin to bond more and become friends, Wilfred teaches Ryan a life lesson about people, love, and living.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F2cUYCkmHEWsxaNiVTQnFqxyq5Ij.jpg', 4, 'plex:tv:wilfred-us'),
  ('163696024411331928', 'Will', 2017, 'Drama', 'Craig Pearce', null, 'Laurie Davidson, Olivia DeJonge, Ewen Bremner, Mattias Inwood, Jamie Campbell Bower, William Houston, Colm Meaney, Geoffrey Freshwater', 'TV-MA', 'The wild story of young William Shakespeare''s arrival onto the punk-rock theater scene in 16th century London -- the seductive, violent world where his raw talent faced rioting audiences, religious fanatics and raucous side-shows. It''s a contemporary version of Shakespeare''s life, played to a modern soundtrack that exposes all his recklessness, lustful temptations and brilliance.', 'The wild story of young William Shakespeare''s arrival onto the punk-rock theater scene in 16th century London -- the seductive, violent world where his raw talent faced rioting audiences, religious fanatics and raucous side-shows. It''s a contemporary version of Shakespeare''s life, played to a modern soundtrack that exposes all his recklessness, lustful temptations and brilliance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXv74kFe1HbEVUTRMt8wpN8lYM6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71367'),
  ('770888860806370436', 'Will & Grace', 1998, 'Comedy', 'David Kohan, Max Mutchnick', null, 'Eric McCormack, Debra Messing, Sean Hayes, Megan Mullally', 'TV-PG', 'Will Truman and Grace Adler are best friends living in New York, and when Grace''s engagement falls apart, she moves in with Will. Together, along with their friends, they go through the trials of dating, sex, relationships and their careers, butting heads at times but ultimately supporting one another while exchanging plenty of witty banter along the way.', 'Will Truman and Grace Adler are best friends living in New York, and when Grace''s engagement falls apart, she moves in with Will. Together, along with their friends, they go through the trials of dating, sex, relationships and their careers, butting heads at times but ultimately supporting one another while exchanging plenty of witty banter along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEaYdyHcpHN3fIXHhXHtXOs8Rtk.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:4454'),
  ('915927284118648469', 'Will & Grace', 2017, 'Comedy', 'David Kohan, Max Mutchnick', null, 'Eric McCormack, Debra Messing, Sean Hayes, Megan Mullally', 'TV-14', 'That''s right, honey! A decade after their unforgettable eight-season run, comedy''s most fabulous foursome is back.', 'That''s right, honey! A decade after their unforgettable eight-season run, comedy''s most fabulous foursome is back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRsgY1TRNTccltEGk9V9wNqqKOx.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:74321'),
  ('1066397529421448497', 'Will Love In Spring', 2024, 'Drama, Family', 'She Musi', 'Even Jian', 'Li Xian, Zhou Yutong, Wan Peng, Wu Junting, Liu Lin, Zhang Chi, Ai Xiaoqi, Yang Teng', null, 'Chen Maidong, once a rebellious youth, chooses to become a mortician after experiencing a life-changing event. Zhuang Jie, who becomes disabled due to a car accident, strives for a better life and becomes a successful professional in a big city. This drama portrays the journey of them who, despite their contrasting personalities and circumstances, learn to understand and accept one another. Their love heals their hearts, allowing them to embrace and appreciate their "imperfect" selves.', 'Chen Maidong, once a rebellious youth, chooses to become a mortician after experiencing a life-changing event. Zhuang Jie, who becomes disabled due to a car accident, strives for a better life and becomes a successful professional in a big city. This drama portrays the journey of them who, despite their contrasting personalities and circumstances, learn to understand and accept one another. Their love heals their hearts, allowing them to embrace and appreciate their "imperfect" selves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsTdoElwFSiF9MAAFqvbjLugpE3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:244621'),
  ('991970609938098002', 'Will Power', 2013, 'Drama', null, null, 'Wayne Lai Yiu-Cheung, Moses Chan Ho, Jason Chan Chi-San, Vincent Wong Ho-Shun, Chung King-Fai, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Sire Ma, Fala Chen', null, 'The two well known laywers YU YING WAI and LEE MING YEUNG are against each other in court. Because YING WAI wanted to win a case, it almost cost him his life and after that incident, he had a new view on life. Experienced lawyer LO SAM BO viewed the changed WAI differently, and recruited him to join his law firm as a probate lawyer. Due to his debt, YEUNG was forced to go back and work at his mentor SUM YIK WOR law firm and collaborates with his daughter and lawyer SUM YUT KAN. KAN had been in a relationship with the wealthy SUNG KA YIU for many years, but YIU loves merit too much and had no interest in ambitions, which gave YEUNG an opportunity win KAN''s heart. When the hearing for a case involving a will began, the judge happened to be WAI''s ex-wife and YEUNG''s ex-girlfriend LUK SZE YING, the two heroes meet again, but together they discovered there was another side to the case. The person involved just happened to be WAI''s apprentice CHING KA MING, whom had a huge connection to the case. The actions of the lawyer lifted a crisis of life and death.', 'The two well known laywers YU YING WAI and LEE MING YEUNG are against each other in court. Because YING WAI wanted to win a case, it almost cost him his life and after that incident, he had a new view on life. Experienced lawyer LO SAM BO viewed the changed WAI differently, and recruited him to join his law firm as a probate lawyer. Due to his debt, YEUNG was forced to go back and work at his mentor SUM YIK WOR law firm and collaborates with his daughter and lawyer SUM YUT KAN. KAN had been in a relationship with the wealthy SUNG KA YIU for many years, but YIU loves merit too much and had no interest in ambitions, which gave YEUNG an opportunity win KAN''s heart. When the hearing for a case involving a will began, the judge happened to be WAI''s ex-wife and YEUNG''s ex-girlfriend LUK SZE YING, the two heroes meet again, but together they discovered there was another side to the case. The person involved just happened to be WAI''s apprentice CHING KA MING, whom had a huge connection to the case. The actions of the lawyer lifted a crisis of life and death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gt9QRI9eLO4HUag9EKhyWFqXTv1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96623'),
  ('429654861108940542', 'Will Trent', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Daniel T. Thomsen, Liz Heldens', null, 'Ramón Rodríguez, Erika Christensen, Iantha Richardson, Jake McLaughlin, Sonja Sohn, Kevin Daniels', 'TV-14', 'Special Agent Will Trent was abandoned at birth and endured a harsh coming-of-age in Atlanta''s overwhelmed foster care system. Determined to make sure no one feels as he did, he now has the highest clearance rate.', 'Special Agent Will Trent was abandoned at birth and endured a harsh coming-of-age in Atlanta''s overwhelmed foster care system. Determined to make sure no one feels as he did, he now has the highest clearance rate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qG5O46gUxxYGImld03tl2zLhvrg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:208569'),
  ('386892167701773113', 'William Shatner''s Weird or What?', 2010, 'Documentary, Drama, Talk', null, 'Peter St. Laurent, Elizabeth Trojian, Tom Adams', 'William Shatner', 'TV-14', 'Weird or What? is a series on the Discovery Channel and History hosted by William Shatner. Each episode contains three separate stories of the bizarre and unexplained. As the show unfolds, it weighs various supernatural and scientific theories that attempt to explain the story, and sometimes features tests conducted as proof of a theory''s plausibility. The show features strange occurrences such as ghosts, aliens, monsters, medical oddities and natural disasters.', 'Weird or What? is a series on the Discovery Channel and History hosted by William Shatner. Each episode contains three separate stories of the bizarre and unexplained. As the show unfolds, it weighs various supernatural and scientific theories that attempt to explain the story, and sometimes features tests conducted as proof of a theory''s plausibility. The show features strange occurrences such as ghosts, aliens, monsters, medical oddities and natural disasters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ak07iPfiT2kEIUEBpYAmn0PbwP8.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:36160'),
  ('92877235497300575', 'Willkommen bei Carmen Nebel', 2004, 'News', null, null, 'Carmen Nebel', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 16, 'tmdb:tv:90549'),
  ('786275281392344623', 'Willow', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Jon Kasdan', null, 'Warwick Davis, Ellie Bamber, Ruby Cruz, Erin Kellyman, Tony Revolori, Amar Chadha-Patel, Dempsey Bryk', 'TV-14', 'Many years after the events of the original film, legendary sorcerer Willow leads a group of misfit heroes on a dangerous rescue mission through a world beyond their wildest imaginations.', 'Many years after the events of the original film, legendary sorcerer Willow leads a group of misfit heroes on a dangerous rescue mission through a world beyond their wildest imaginations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lw4n5CBlLR62nogy46FyJaIFziH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:111837'),
  ('199189863665029762', 'Wilsberg', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jürgen Kehrer', null, 'Leonard Lansink, Rita Russek, Roland Jankowsky, Oliver Korittke', null, 'Georg Wilsberg is an antiquarian in Münster. He used to be a lawyer but lost his license. Since then he has been working as a private detective. The always clammy Wilsberg urgently needs this income. In addition, he depends on the support of his friends, especially because of the car.', 'Georg Wilsberg is an antiquarian in Münster. He used to be a lawyer but lost his license. Since then he has been working as a private detective. The always clammy Wilsberg urgently needs this income. In addition, he depends on the support of his friends, especially because of the car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jJrTBO049FLoPhDNB0YZTetkX87.jpg', 9, 'tmdb:tv:39249'),
  ('693559808382879253', 'Win Ben Stein''s Money', 1997, 'Comedy', null, 'Phil Andres, Bob Stone, Teresa Strasser', 'Nancy M. Pimental, Ben Stein, Jimmy Kimmel', null, 'Win Ben Stein''s Money is an American television game show created by Al Burton and Donnie Brainard that aired first-run episodes from July 28, 1997 to January 31, 2003 on the Comedy Central cable network, with repeat episodes airing until May 8, 2003. The show featured three contestants who competed to answer general knowledge questions in order to win the grand prize of $5,000 from the show''s host, Ben Stein. In the second half of each episode, Stein participated as a "common contestant" in order to defend his money from being taken by his competitors. The show won five Daytime Emmy awards, with Stein and Jimmy Kimmel, the show''s original co-host, sharing the Outstanding Game Show Host award in 1999. As noted in a disclaimer during the closing credits, prize money won by contestants was paid from a prize budget furnished by the producers of the show. Any money left over in that budget at the end of a season was given to Stein. If the total amount paid out during a season exceeded that budget, the production company paid the excess, so Stein was never at risk of losing money from his own pocket. Stein''s co-host was Jimmy Kimmel for the first three years. Kimmel left in 2000 and was replaced by Nancy Pimental, who co-hosted the program through 2001. Kimmel''s cousin, Sal Iacono, who took over the role in 2002, was the show''s last co-host. Although Jimmy Kimmel left the program in 2000, he occasionally made guest appearances afterward, and hosted College Week episodes in 2001.', 'Win Ben Stein''s Money is an American television game show created by Al Burton and Donnie Brainard that aired first-run episodes from July 28, 1997 to January 31, 2003 on the Comedy Central cable network, with repeat episodes airing until May 8, 2003. The show featured three contestants who competed to answer general knowledge questions in order to win the grand prize of $5,000 from the show''s host, Ben Stein. In the second half of each episode, Stein participated as a "common contestant" in order to defend his money from being taken by his competitors. The show won five Daytime Emmy awards, with Stein and Jimmy Kimmel, the show''s original co-host, sharing the Outstanding Game Show Host award in 1999. As noted in a disclaimer during the closing credits, prize money won by contestants was paid from a prize budget furnished by the producers of the show. Any money left over in that budget at the end of a season was given to Stein. If the total amount paid out during a season exceeded that budget, the production company paid the excess, so Stein was never at risk of losing money from his own pocket. Stein''s co-host was Jimmy Kimmel for the first three years. Kimmel left in 2000 and was replaced by Nancy Pimental, who co-hosted the program through 2001. Kimmel''s cousin, Sal Iacono, who took over the role in 2002, was the show''s last co-host. Although Jimmy Kimmel left the program in 2000, he occasionally made guest appearances afterward, and hosted College Week episodes in 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nch1cxYkTwwjHuZ1UwFMa6CssLe.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:10319'),
  ('283644543596368330', 'Win or Lose', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama, Family', null, null, 'Will Forte, Rosanna Jean Foss, Josh Thomson, Milan Ray, Rosa Salazar, Dorien Maxwell, Izaac Wang, Lil Rel Howery', 'TV-PG', 'As a championship game looms, eight characters are thrown a curveball in their off-the-field lives.', 'As a championship game looms, eight characters are thrown a curveball in their off-the-field lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnVVkTU8noAZshs1sHdkxdGcVIP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:114500'),
  ('260989643314457091', 'WIND BREAKER', 2024, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuma Uchida, Shoya Chiba, Koki Uchiyama, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Ryota Suzuki, Yuichi Nakamura, Chiaki Kobayashi, Yohei Matsuoka', 'TV-14', 'Furin High School''s delinquents get bad grades, but they excel at protecting their town. Then a victory-obsessed newcomer threatens the balance of power.', 'Furin High School''s delinquents get bad grades, but they excel at protecting their town. Then a victory-obsessed newcomer threatens the balance of power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kTFL3PAeTyS8gGZAh0iYG6NNjt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223500'),
  ('260574484289928151', 'Wind-Bell', 2019, 'Drama, Family', null, null, 'Jung Jin-young, Kwon Min-a, Lee Seung-wook, Park Hyun-suk, Yoon Jin-wook', null, 'Set in backdrops of Seoul’s most popular tourist spots including Han River and Bukchon, it is a story about a writer, named Daniel, who was adopted to the US when he was 10 years old, coming back to Korea after becoming a world-class novelist. He decided to come back to Korea to meet his family including his mother who had no option but to put her son up for adoption. While he traces back in memory, he meets Yeo Jin, the editor helping Daniel with the publication of his book in Korea and the two soon realize some undeniable chemistry between them.', 'Set in backdrops of Seoul’s most popular tourist spots including Han River and Bukchon, it is a story about a writer, named Daniel, who was adopted to the US when he was 10 years old, coming back to Korea after becoming a world-class novelist. He decided to come back to Korea to meet his family including his mother who had no option but to put her son up for adoption. While he traces back in memory, he meets Yeo Jin, the editor helping Daniel with the publication of his book in Korea and the two soon realize some undeniable chemistry between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3YQqgoR0CorcaKsnj22cfSQFnz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:85987'),
  ('1072458071088898172', 'Windfall', 2006, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gwendolyn M. Parker', 'David Niles', 'Sarah Wynter, Jason Gedrick, Jon Foster, Alice Greczyn, Jaclyn DeSantis, Lana Parrilla, Luke Perry, D.J. Cotrona', null, 'Windfall is a serial drama television series about a group of people in an unnamed small city who win almost $400,000,000 in a lottery.', 'Windfall is a serial drama television series about a group of people in an unnamed small city who win almost $400,000,000 in a lottery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DGRb9NAu9Awy5MA2mxGTxbaupr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:4577'),
  ('841941137660549058', 'Winds of Love', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ömer Baykul, Bülent Doğan', null, 'Gökberk Yıldırım, Cemre Arda, Selma Kutluğ, Zeynep Serpil Bozkurt, Sude Oduncu, Serdar Yusuf, Dilek Aba, Adem Bal', null, 'Zeynep is the smart, well-behaved, exemplary daughter of the wealthiest family in the town where she lives, while Halil is a young man who lost his mother and father at an early age and lives with his aunt with a grudge to avenge his family. These two young people who live despite their families will find themselves in an unthinkable blind knot.', 'Zeynep is the smart, well-behaved, exemplary daughter of the wealthiest family in the town where she lives, while Halil is a young man who lost his mother and father at an early age and lives with his aunt with a grudge to avenge his family. These two young people who live despite their families will find themselves in an unthinkable blind knot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Akeb8Ekng09kxPJlIQ1rGVFRYOp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:242551'),
  ('417091486144023133', 'Windy Tales', 2004, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaori Nazuka, Satomi Hanamura, Miyu Irino, Masanori Takeda, Risa Mizuno, Ai Iwamura, Ooki Sugiyama', 'TV-G', 'While hanging out on the roof of her school, Nao Ueshima discovers a flock of flying cats. In her haste to snap a picture, Nao tumbles over the side of the building. But instead of plummeting to her doom, Nao is guided by an unseen force that allows her to land safely on her feet. Determined to unlock the secrets of the flying cats and the identity of her rescuer, Nao soon learns that not only is one of her teachers able to control the wind, but he can also teach others to control it, too!', 'While hanging out on the roof of her school, Nao Ueshima discovers a flock of flying cats. In her haste to snap a picture, Nao tumbles over the side of the building. But instead of plummeting to her doom, Nao is guided by an unseen force that allows her to land safely on her feet. Determined to unlock the secrets of the flying cats and the identity of her rescuer, Nao soon learns that not only is one of her teachers able to control the wind, but he can also teach others to control it, too!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTnEA0XRZ2l9JnFFlShsY4SEYR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:35184'),
  ('305445503318512060', 'Wingman', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Lauri Nurkse', 'Kari Ketonen, Lauri Nurkse, Antti Luusuaniemi', 'Antti Luusuaniemi, Kari Ketonen, Maria Ylipää', null, 'The series follows the lives of Juha "Juhis" Koski and Tommi Mäkinen-Renwall as neighbours. The men drift too far in their everyday challenges that lead to excessive outcomes. Unwillingly, Tommi and Juhis often find themselves in awkward and embarrassing situations where they are forced to choose one of two bad options. Tommi''s wife and Juhis'' good friend Harriet does her best to understand the men''s antics.', 'The series follows the lives of Juha "Juhis" Koski and Tommi Mäkinen-Renwall as neighbours. The men drift too far in their everyday challenges that lead to excessive outcomes. Unwillingly, Tommi and Juhis often find themselves in awkward and embarrassing situations where they are forced to choose one of two bad options. Tommi''s wife and Juhis'' good friend Harriet does her best to understand the men''s antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2pVYaekPUuKHoakgAlub6buEG0.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:68773'),
  ('526179018169484773', 'Wings', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Casey, David Angell, David Clark Lee', null, 'Tim Daly, Steven Weber, Crystal Bernard, David Schramm, Rebecca Schull, Tony Shalhoub, Amy Yasbeck', 'TV-PG', 'Brothers Brian and Joe Hackett attempt to run an airline on the New England island of Nantucket while surrounded by their various wacky friends and employees.', 'Brothers Brian and Joe Hackett attempt to run an airline on the New England island of Nantucket while surrounded by their various wacky friends and employees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eqf5p8fU7liYAMznUBMWMeSYfCQ.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:2506'),
  ('73313657981485571', 'Winning Time: The Rise of the Lakers Dynasty', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jim Hecht, Max Borenstein', null, 'John C. Reilly, Quincy Isaiah, Jason Clarke, Adrien Brody, Gaby Hoffmann, Jason Segel', 'TV-MA', 'A fast-break series chronicling the professional and personal lives of the 1980s Los Angeles Lakers, one of sports’ most revered and dominant dynasties — a team that defined an era, both on and off the court.', 'A fast-break series chronicling the professional and personal lives of the 1980s Los Angeles Lakers, one of sports’ most revered and dominant dynasties — a team that defined an era, both on and off the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6B9hTge98t52bQofyvs1M370k7n.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:124067'),
