  ('1001224438226101870', 'Women at War', 2022, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Cécile Lorne', 'Cécile Lorne, José Caltagirone, Iris Bucher', 'Audrey Fleurot, Julie de Bona, Camille Lou, Sofia Essaïdi, Sandrine Bonnaire, Tchéky Karyo, Tom Leeb, Laurent Gerra', 'TV-MA', 'France, 1914. The destinies of four women intersect : Marguerite, a mysterious Parisian prostitute, Caroline, propelled to the head of the family factory, Agnes, Mother Superior of a requisitioned convent and Suzanne, a feminist nurse.', 'France, 1914. The destinies of four women intersect : Marguerite, a mysterious Parisian prostitute, Caroline, propelled to the head of the family factory, Agnes, Mother Superior of a requisitioned convent and Suzanne, a feminist nurse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avHGyKkWln2KiDDh6zyWJgq8xmu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:155491'),
  ('1068819922110720089', 'Women in Blue', 2024, 'Crime, Drama', 'Pablo Aramendi, Fernando Rovzar', null, 'Bárbara Mori, Ximena Sariñana, Natalia Téllez, Amorita Rasgado, Miguel Rodarte, Leonardo Sbaraglia, Christian Tappán, Horacio García Rojas', 'TV-MA', 'In 1971, four women defy ultraconservative norms and join Mexico''s first female police force—only to discover that it''s a publicity stunt to distract the media from a serial killer. As the body count grows, they make a pact to bring the killer to justice.', 'In 1971, four women defy ultraconservative norms and join Mexico''s first female police force—only to discover that it''s a publicity stunt to distract the media from a serial killer. As the body count grows, they make a pact to bring the killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JMYd2jYZGQ0KKcSQ8MH6k49XnF.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:253983'),
  ('377979158131695871', 'Women in Love', 2011, 'Drama', null, 'William Ivory', 'Rory Kinnear, Joseph Mawle, Patrick Lyster, James Alexander, Grant Swanby, Ben Daniels, Rosamund Pike, Rachael Stirling', 'TV-MA', 'Powerful adaptation of DH Lawrence''s novels The Rainbow and Women in Love, focusing on the lives of two sisters as they struggle with love, passion and commitment in the build-up to WWI.', 'Powerful adaptation of DH Lawrence''s novels The Rainbow and Women in Love, focusing on the lives of two sisters as they struggle with love, passion and commitment in the build-up to WWI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iA03K9PJGCZoXKIWd2NOrEzCRi7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:43864'),
