  ('744703053482753070', 'World Break: Aria of Curse for a Holy Swordsman', 2015, 'Animation', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Ayana Taketatsu, Kaito Ishikawa, Maaya Uchida, Yui Ogura, Akira Ishida, Ayane Sakura, Chiaki Omigawa', 'TV-MA', 'The scenery takes place in a private high school involving the concept of "saviors." They are known as people who possess awakened memories of their past lives. The story tells of a young boy named Moroha Haimura who comes to this private school. At the school, there are two types of people: Saviors, who fight enemies with weapons and techniques gleaned from the Puraana powers from their own bodies, and Kuroma, who wipe out enemies with magic to manipulate the Maana powers that surpass physics. Moroha Haimura is the first person with past lives of both Shirogane and Kuroma.', 'The scenery takes place in a private high school involving the concept of "saviors." They are known as people who possess awakened memories of their past lives. The story tells of a young boy named Moroha Haimura who comes to this private school. At the school, there are two types of people: Saviors, who fight enemies with weapons and techniques gleaned from the Puraana powers from their own bodies, and Kuroma, who wipe out enemies with magic to manipulate the Maana powers that surpass physics. Moroha Haimura is the first person with past lives of both Shirogane and Kuroma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e083Kkp9cC3no0Zc17gQVKBFqLu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66919'),
  ('749395904520007081', 'World Conquest Zvezda Plot', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Misaki Kuno, Mariya Ise, Kana Hanazawa, Erii Yamazaki, Kohsuke Toriumi', 'TV-14', 'Tells the story of how a little girl was able to achieve world conquest with the use of her magical powers and faithful followers.', 'Tells the story of how a little girl was able to achieve world conquest with the use of her magical powers and faithful followers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HDPhATzKdLklNAe4gy1CvUWPTh.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70545'),
  ('484225640807813748', 'World Inside Out', 2010, 'Action & Adventure, Documentary', 'Dmytro Komarov', null, 'Dmytro Komarov', null, 'An informative TV program about traveling to the most exotic countries in the world. The author''s project by journalist and traveler Dmitry Komarov focuses primarily on the underside of a country or region that tourists usually do not see. If the report is made from a popular place, it is revealed to the viewer from an unusual angle, showing the "inside".', 'An informative TV program about traveling to the most exotic countries in the world. The author''s project by journalist and traveler Dmitry Komarov focuses primarily on the underside of a country or region that tourists usually do not see. If the report is made from a popular place, it is revealed to the viewer from an unusual angle, showing the "inside".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eiqVYXCdSb3i48mjvQewe3VXR9v.jpg', 17, 'tmdb:tv:69360'),
  ('768450867415417509', 'World News Tonight with David Muir', 1948, 'News', 'Roone Arledge', null, null, 'NR', 'ABC World News is the flagship daily evening television news program of ABC News, the news division of the American Broadcasting Company television network in the United States. Currently the weekday editions (going by title ABC World News Tonight with David Muir) are anchored by David Muir. ABC World News has been anchored at various times by a number of other people since its debut in 1953. It also has used various titles, including ABC Evening News from 1970 to 1978 and World News Tonight from 1978 to 2006.', 'ABC World News is the flagship daily evening television news program of ABC News, the news division of the American Broadcasting Company television network in the United States. Currently the weekday editions (going by title ABC World News Tonight with David Muir) are anchored by David Muir. ABC World News has been anchored at various times by a number of other people since its debut in 1953. It also has used various titles, including ABC Evening News from 1970 to 1978 and World News Tonight from 1978 to 2006.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhdypGMoLPV1NgnRd1M8YA5X9UB.jpg', 31, 'tmdb:tv:1770'),
  ('134264976239435240', 'World of Dance', 2017, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jennifer Lopez, Ne-Yo, Derek Hough, Jenna Dewan', 'TV-PG', 'Dancers battle in heats of artistry, precision and athleticism in this reality-competition show.', 'Dancers battle in heats of artistry, precision and athleticism in this reality-competition show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syR1jnNWkCBKVjPXA2FmCcdXxJI.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:71957'),
  ('796620854546730924', 'World of Immortals', 2024, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chen Dong', null, 'Liang Dawei, Yajing Tang, Huang Ying, Kaiyin Sun, Danni Pan, Zhuoting Li, 伍凯立, Yu Kailong', null, 'Xiao Chen, pursued by the imperial celestial maiden Zhao Lin''er, accidentally stumbles into the Desolate Dragon Island within the Realm of Eternal Life. Trapped in a hostile world filled with enemies and beasts, he battles for survival, driven by his longing for family and home. As he fights his way through, he uncovers an ancient, forgotten mythological world while following the path of those seeking immortality.', 'Xiao Chen, pursued by the imperial celestial maiden Zhao Lin''er, accidentally stumbles into the Desolate Dragon Island within the Realm of Eternal Life. Trapped in a hostile world filled with enemies and beasts, he battles for survival, driven by his longing for family and home. As he fights his way through, he uncovers an ancient, forgotten mythological world while following the path of those seeking immortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8mzxyEAnB0dBuEgzB4YaUtFRr6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273600'),
  ('214546108766231863', 'World of Two', 1970, 'Family, Drama', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Taichi Yamada', 'Taichi Yamada', 'Muga Takewaki, Komaki Kurihara, Teruhiko Aoi, Akira Yamanouchi, Masao Mishima, Kantarō Suga, Masaaki Yajima', null, 'One night, Jiro and Reiko fell in love at first sight, and on the seventh day he proposed to her, and three months later they were married. However, the difference in upbringing between Jiro, who was born and raised in a farmhouse in Shinshu, and Reiko, who is a city girl by nature, sometimes causes small ripples in their sweet newlywed life.', 'One night, Jiro and Reiko fell in love at first sight, and on the seventh day he proposed to her, and three months later they were married. However, the difference in upbringing between Jiro, who was born and raised in a farmhouse in Shinshu, and Reiko, who is a city girl by nature, sometimes causes small ripples in their sweet newlywed life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbg5peagXzwh2hoYdusKQGdmv3p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:226097'),
  ('1028932237726218327', 'World of Winx', 2016, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Iginio Straffi', null, 'Letizia Ciampa, Perla Liberatori, Ilaria Latini, Domitilla D''Amico, Laura Lenghi, Debora Magnaghi, Nanni Baldini, Francesca Guadagno', null, 'The Winx travel all over the world searching for talent for WOW. and preventing the mysterious talent thief from kidnapping them.', 'The Winx travel all over the world searching for talent for WOW. and preventing the mysterious talent thief from kidnapping them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOC38RuSnknVx2jwASBDFN3dbVe.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:69919'),
  ('283907231586457156', 'World on a Wire', 1973, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Mystery', 'Rainer Werner Fassbinder', null, 'Klaus Löwitsch, Mascha Rabben, Karl-Heinz Vosgerau, Adrian Hoven, Ivan Desny, Ingrid Caven, Barbara Valentin, Günter Lamprecht', null, 'World on a Wire is a two-part 1973 West German science fiction television serial broadcast on ARD. Shot on 16 mm film, the two-part miniseries is directed by Rainer Werner Fassbinder, who co-writes the screenplay with Fritz Müller-Scherz, based on Daniel F. Galouye''s 1964 novel Simulacron-3. In the future, Simulacron, a computer simulated reality, encounters strange occurrences after its leader''s death. Dr Fred Stiller questions the sudden disappearance of a friend and wonders if Simulacron holds the answers.', 'World on a Wire is a two-part 1973 West German science fiction television serial broadcast on ARD. Shot on 16 mm film, the two-part miniseries is directed by Rainer Werner Fassbinder, who co-writes the screenplay with Fritz Müller-Scherz, based on Daniel F. Galouye''s 1964 novel Simulacron-3. In the future, Simulacron, a computer simulated reality, encounters strange occurrences after its leader''s death. Dr Fred Stiller questions the sudden disappearance of a friend and wonders if Simulacron holds the answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRzRKMjxWx1ogpGy77mTCjU4bRt.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86449'),
  ('832656544799711589', 'World on Fire', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics', 'Peter Bowker', null, 'Jonah Hauer-King, Julia Brown, Helen Hunt, Zofia Wichłacz, Lesley Manville, Brian J. Smith, Parker Sawyers, Tomasz Kot', 'TV-MA', 'The story of World War II told through the intertwining fates of ordinary people from all sides of this global conflict as they grapple with the effect of the war on their everyday lives.', 'The story of World War II told through the intertwining fates of ordinary people from all sides of this global conflict as they grapple with the effect of the war on their everyday lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecOAfSr6sWhX0rOLzNbb3lcMMhb.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:83015'),
  ('1007373006409069862', 'World Theme Tour', 2008, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'The World Theme Journey is a program designed to deliver living experiences that only free backpackers can feel, away from simple travel information programs. From Spain to Chile, South Africa to Alaska, the world-themed trips are made by running on their own feet, vividly showing the splendid cultural sites and natural heritage, as well as the hidden aspects of people around the world', 'The World Theme Journey is a program designed to deliver living experiences that only free backpackers can feel, away from simple travel information programs. From Spain to Chile, South Africa to Alaska, the world-themed trips are made by running on their own feet, vividly showing the splendid cultural sites and natural heritage, as well as the hidden aspects of people around the world', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHC70ke34d0pEOdhcx8lnWhRtqk.jpg', 19, 'tmdb:tv:120554'),
  ('348876630689685332', 'World Trigger', 2014, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Nao Tamura, Yuichi Nakamura, Tomo Muranaka, Yuki Kaji, Hideyuki Tanaka, Megumi Urawa, Eri Nakao, Nobuhiko Okamoto', 'TV-14', 'A gate to another world opens in Mikado City, and monsters called Neighbors emerge. It''s up to Border Defense agent Osamu Mikumo to fight them.', 'A gate to another world opens in Mikado City, and monsters called Neighbors emerge. It''s up to Border Defense agent Osamu Mikumo to fight them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lchqxvVvOeSfkpuvVAIxaDm8Mth.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:61628'),
  ('443922067218964161', 'World War Blue', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', null, null, 'Nobuhiko Okamoto, Suzuko Mimori, Atsushi Ono, Takehito Koyasu, Yukiko Monden, Hiro Shimono, Izumi Kitta, Koki Uchiyama', 'TV-MA', 'A parody of the console wars, the series tells the story of two nations, the Segua Kingdom and Ninteldo Empire, locked in a struggle for dominance over the land of Consume.', 'A parody of the console wars, the series tells the story of two nations, the Segua Kingdom and Ninteldo Empire, locked in a struggle for dominance over the land of Consume.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knCtPd5fwgq2wAXm3YWqxW8xqLZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46227'),
  ('441517761527570539', 'World War II in Colour', 2009, 'Documentary, War & Politics', 'Jonathan Martin', 'Jonathan Martin', 'Robert Powell, Adolf Hitler, Winston Churchill, Franklin D. Roosevelt, Joseph Stalin, Dwight D. Eisenhower, Erwin Rommel, Chester W. Nimitz', 'TV-PG', 'World War II In Colour is a 13-episode television documentary miniseries recounting the events of World War II narrated by Robert Powell. The show covers the Western Front, Eastern Front, and the Pacific War. It is on syndication in America on the Military Channel. This series is in full color, combining both original and colorized footage.', 'World War II In Colour is a 13-episode television documentary miniseries recounting the events of World War II narrated by Robert Powell. The show covers the Western Front, Eastern Front, and the Pacific War. It is on syndication in America on the Military Channel. This series is in full color, combining both original and colorized footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1in5DbN4t8a7Osw9hCqWEmNoEZF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:42154'),
  ('1006781285043046639', 'World War II: From the Frontlines', 2023, 'Documentary, War & Politics', null, null, 'John Boyega', 'TV-MA', 'Through vividly enhanced archival footage and voices from all sides of the conflict, this docuseries brings WWII to life like never before.', 'Through vividly enhanced archival footage and voices from all sides of the conflict, this docuseries brings WWII to life like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15wIhM1X6oRiId0tPPTVoXLT6mx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:233237'),
  ('429584690930165139', 'World War II: When Lions Roared', 1994, 'War & Politics, Drama, Reality', null, 'David W. Rintels', 'Ed Begley Jr., Jan Tříska, Michael Caine, Bob Hoskins, John Lithgow, Corey Burton', null, 'A 1994 war television miniseries which portrays Roosevelt, Churchill, and Stalin as they maneuver their countries through several of the major events of World War II - such events include the Blitz, Operation Barbarossa, the bombing of Pearl Harbor, the North African Campaign, the Allied invasion of Italy, and concluding with the Tehran Conference.', 'A 1994 war television miniseries which portrays Roosevelt, Churchill, and Stalin as they maneuver their countries through several of the major events of World War II - such events include the Blitz, Operation Barbarossa, the bombing of Pearl Harbor, the North African Campaign, the Allied invasion of Italy, and concluding with the Tehran Conference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ggcdYAfqNoIdZDHISOyIJ9YXrC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:48164'),
  ('423310621024310872', 'World War III', 1982, 'War & Politics', null, 'Robert L. Joseph', 'David Soul, Rock Hudson, Jeroen Krabbé, Cathy Lee Crosby, Robert Prosky, James Hampton, Lee Wallace, Harry Basch', null, 'When starving mobs begin rioting in the streets of Moscow, Soviet leaders believe they have no recourse but to seize the Alaskan pipeline to force the United States to end the grain embargo that has brought turmoil to the U.S.S.R.', 'When starving mobs begin rioting in the streets of Moscow, Soviet leaders believe they have no recourse but to seize the Alaskan pipeline to force the United States to end the grain embargo that has brought turmoil to the U.S.S.R.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk4OBBAF2CFnAZFEwV9jPyf9ELu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:9126'),
  ('988625375305318851', 'World Without End', 2012, 'Drama', 'Michael Caton-Jones', 'John Pielmeier', 'Oliver Maltman, David Bradley, Ben Chaplin, Charlotte Riley, Cynthia Nixon, Carlo Rota, Rupert Evans, Nora Waldstätten', 'TV-MA', 'Two hundred years after the construction of the great cathedral, the medieval town of Kingsbridge is taken under siege by Queen Isabella. Caris, a visionary young woman, inspires her people to stand up for their rights and revolt against to the most powerful forces of her time, the Church and the Crown.', 'Two hundred years after the construction of the great cathedral, the medieval town of Kingsbridge is taken under siege by Queen Isabella. Caris, a visionary young woman, inspires her people to stand up for their rights and revolt against to the most powerful forces of her time, the Church and the Crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjXkAzctVlVJ2ZXR8Rc2LFv0GNu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:40204'),
  ('778308150848909192', 'World''s Most Dangerous Roads', 2011, 'Reality, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Celebrities drive on some of the most dangerous roads around the world, tackling impossible conditions to reach their goals.', 'Celebrities drive on some of the most dangerous roads around the world, tackling impossible conditions to reach their goals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by2wr76gkQfbPuz8vb8cIBdxtOL.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:63272'),
