  ('65345672650017395', 'World''s Most Wanted', 2020, 'Documentary, Crime', null, null, 'Jennifer Julian, David Lorino, Pierre Richard Prosper, Thomas Fuentes, Jonathan Winer', null, 'Heinous criminals have avoided capture despite massive rewards and global investigations. This docuseries profiles some of the world’s most wanted.', 'Heinous criminals have avoided capture despite massive rewards and global investigations. This docuseries profiles some of the world’s most wanted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDaIGQvHHP4xixwqwhgwn8WMZx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:106513'),
  ('635205992091697576', 'World’s Toughest Race: Eco-Challenge Fiji', 2020, 'Reality', 'Mark Burnett', null, 'Bear Grylls', null, 'From the creator of Survivor, 66 teams descend upon Fiji to compete in the most epic global adventure race ever attempted. Bear Grylls hosts this 11-day expedition that pushes competitors to their physical and emotional limits. For the veteran teams the goal is to win – but for most, the dream is to finish and prove to themselves and the world, that they can prevail in the World’s Toughest Race.', 'From the creator of Survivor, 66 teams descend upon Fiji to compete in the most epic global adventure race ever attempted. Bear Grylls hosts this 11-day expedition that pushes competitors to their physical and emotional limits. For the veteran teams the goal is to win – but for most, the dream is to finish and prove to themselves and the world, that they can prevail in the World’s Toughest Race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wp1bmJl6ydUGnCVUItqP0oQ3ANc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107333'),
  ('957041375631500199', 'WorldEnd: What are you doing at the end of the world? Are you busy? Will you save us?', 2017, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Ryohei Arai, Azusa Tadokoro, Akari Uehara, Satomi Sato, Machico', 'TV-14', 'The fleeting and sad story about little girls known as fairy weapons and an associate hero that survived. This is a world after it was attacked by unidentified monsters known as beasts and many of the species in the world, including humans, had been destroyed. The species that had managed to survived left the ground and were living on a floating island called Regal Ele. Willem Kmetsch wakes up above the clouds 500 years later and couldn’t protect the ones who he wanted to protect. Actually, he was living in despair because he was the only survivor.', 'The fleeting and sad story about little girls known as fairy weapons and an associate hero that survived. This is a world after it was attacked by unidentified monsters known as beasts and many of the species in the world, including humans, had been destroyed. The species that had managed to survived left the ground and were living on a floating island called Regal Ele. Willem Kmetsch wakes up above the clouds 500 years later and couldn’t protect the ones who he wanted to protect. Actually, he was living in despair because he was the only survivor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ovabijZNSSXBAloBFzUVqmmLXC.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:70639'),
  ('260379062822220122', 'Wormwood', 2017, 'Documentary, Crime, Drama', 'Errol Morris', null, 'Eric Olson, Peter Sarsgaard, Molly Parker, Christian Camargo, Tim Blake Nelson, Scott Shepherd', 'TV-14', 'In this genre-bending tale, Errol Morris explores the mysterious death of a U.S. scientist entangled in a secret Cold War program known as MK-Ultra.', 'In this genre-bending tale, Errol Morris explores the mysterious death of a U.S. scientist entangled in a secret Cold War program known as MK-Ultra.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQZzK1ux4J0bBTJii6rzNzeXbe0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73581'),
  ('1151276406260977441', 'Worn Stories', 2021, 'Documentary, Animation', null, null, null, null, 'In this funny, heartfelt and moving docuseries, real people unpack the fascinating and quirky stories around their most meaningful pieces of clothing.', 'In this funny, heartfelt and moving docuseries, real people unpack the fascinating and quirky stories around their most meaningful pieces of clothing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDwYQ4MJ92hWtk8lTurUnJHSAJs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:120008'),
  ('573984325367669970', 'Worst Cooks in America', 2010, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Anne Burrell', 'TV-G', '12 to 16 contestants with poor cooking skills are taken through an eight-week culinary boot camp, to earn a cash prize of $25,000. The recruits are trained on the various basic cooking techniques including: baking, knife skills, temperature, seasoning and preparation. The final challenge is to cook a restaurant quality three-course meal for three food critics.', '12 to 16 contestants with poor cooking skills are taken through an eight-week culinary boot camp, to earn a cash prize of $25,000. The recruits are trained on the various basic cooking techniques including: baking, knife skills, temperature, seasoning and preparation. The final challenge is to cook a restaurant quality three-course meal for three food critics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vE3uKy2AGHQAyDLJ3nR08zpkRJ0.jpg', 30, 'tmdb:tv:31783'),
  ('179057394824880478', 'Worst Ex Ever', 2024, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'From chilling betrayals to murder plots, this true-crime docuseries dissects the dark side of love through eyewitness testimonies.', 'From chilling betrayals to murder plots, this true-crime docuseries dissects the dark side of love through eyewitness testimonies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7D1qWOGSFyicpToIfXL0HRMCT7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259259'),
  ('231608436051440285', 'Worst Roommate Ever', 2022, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-MA', 'Roommates with malevolent and sometimes violent intentions turn the lives of their unsuspecting victims into real-life nightmares. These terrifying true stories unveil some of the worst cohabitation experiences one could ever imagine.', 'Roommates with malevolent and sometimes violent intentions turn the lives of their unsuspecting victims into real-life nightmares. These terrifying true stories unveil some of the worst cohabitation experiences one could ever imagine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKj4eLZnFycD38tGaa81rKkjJxA.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:156595'),
  ('82939110966642870', 'Worst Week', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Matt Tarses', null, 'Kyle Bornheimer, Erinn Hayes, Nancy Lenehan, Kurtwood Smith', 'TV-14', 'Sam Briggs is an entertainment magazine editor who will do anything to please his girlfriend''s parents...but instead becomes a one-man wrecking crew whenever he''s around them. Sam and his girlfriend, Melanie Clayton, have only one hurdle left to clear as they start their life together: breaking the news to Mel''s conservative parents that they have a wedding in the works and a baby on the way.', 'Sam Briggs is an entertainment magazine editor who will do anything to please his girlfriend''s parents...but instead becomes a one-man wrecking crew whenever he''s around them. Sam and his girlfriend, Melanie Clayton, have only one hurdle left to clear as they start their life together: breaking the news to Mel''s conservative parents that they have a wedding in the works and a baby on the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A92sj8iKxx3FHZ2o1UP7pA3E9Eo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12890'),
