  ('897768868155077516', 'Xena: Warrior Princess', 1995, 'Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'John Schulian, Robert Tapert', null, 'Lucy Lawless, Renée O''Connor', 'TV-PG', 'Xena is an infamous warrior on a quest to seek redemption for her past sins against the innocent. Accompanied by her comrade-in-arms Gabrielle, the campy couple use their formidable fighting skills to help those who are unable to defend themselves.', 'Xena is an infamous warrior on a quest to seek redemption for her past sins against the innocent. Accompanied by her comrade-in-arms Gabrielle, the campy couple use their formidable fighting skills to help those who are unable to defend themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qjUn6GVZVDifLHB7bvVrgZsOfzE.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4616'),
  ('860812370398848095', 'Xenosaga: The Animation', 2005, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mariko Suzuki, Ai Maeda, Rumi Shishido, Eriko Kawasaki, Koichi Yamadera, Hikaru Midorikawa, Masakazu Morita, Taiten Kusunoki', 'TV-14', 'The year is T.C. 4767. Four thousand years have passed since humanity abandoned its birthplace, the planet Earth. Beset by the hostile alien Gnosis, mankind is now scrambling to find ways to defeat this threat to their existence. The development of KOS-MOS (a specialized android with amazing capabilities) by Vector engineer Shion Uzuki was one response to the threat. But when their ship is destroyed by the Gnosis, Shion and her companions find themselves thrust into the middle of a battle with no clear sides...', 'The year is T.C. 4767. Four thousand years have passed since humanity abandoned its birthplace, the planet Earth. Beset by the hostile alien Gnosis, mankind is now scrambling to find ways to defeat this threat to their existence. The development of KOS-MOS (a specialized android with amazing capabilities) by Vector engineer Shion Uzuki was one response to the threat. But when their ship is destroyed by the Gnosis, Shion and her companions find themselves thrust into the middle of a battle with no clear sides...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NgnvfxGm84Eg5hqkpMk2pw7DC8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34066'),
  ('238157345349187807', 'XHDRBZ', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Gustavo Rodríguez, Eugenio Derbez', null, 'Eugenio Derbez, Consuelo Duval, Sammy Pérez, Miguel luis', null, 'XHDЯBZ. The show was a Mexican sitcom produced by Televisa and broadcast by the Canal de las Estrellas network. XHDRBZ emulates a television channel that broadcasts sketches. When a sketch finished, credits were shown, like in a real television program. XHDЯBZ was created by Eugenio Derbez in 2002, whose series marked his debut as producer. The show ran for two seasons since 2002, until 2006. Derbez ended production, choosing to expand one of the show''s most popular segments, la Familia P.Luche, into its own hour-long show. Both shows are broadcast in the United States on the Galavisión network. Today the show is transmitted in Latin America and Europe.', 'XHDЯBZ. The show was a Mexican sitcom produced by Televisa and broadcast by the Canal de las Estrellas network. XHDRBZ emulates a television channel that broadcasts sketches. When a sketch finished, credits were shown, like in a real television program. XHDЯBZ was created by Eugenio Derbez in 2002, whose series marked his debut as producer. The show ran for two seasons since 2002, until 2006. Derbez ended production, choosing to expand one of the show''s most popular segments, la Familia P.Luche, into its own hour-long show. Both shows are broadcast in the United States on the Galavisión network. Today the show is transmitted in Latin America and Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/febmF0cmh5dX3RX0xdogRVS6Khy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:16032'),
  ('349740794335977817', 'Xiaolin Chronicles', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation', 'Christy Hui', null, 'Tara Strong, Eric Bauza, Jennifer Hale, David A. Kaye, Michael Donovan, Cree Summer', null, 'The team of "Xiaolin Showdown" return in this sequel series to hunt down Shen Gon Wu. By their side, a new ally joins them in the fight of good vs. evil.', 'The team of "Xiaolin Showdown" return in this sequel series to hunt down Shen Gon Wu. By their side, a new ally joins them in the fight of good vs. evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xunu7Vhk9FZuzw9tecNoDw6UyGo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:60306'),
  ('787043648472978606', 'Xiaolin Showdown', 2003, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Kids', 'Christy Hui', null, 'Tara Strong, Grey DeLisle, Tom Kenny, Jeff Bennett, Wayne Knight, Danny Cooksey, Susan Silo, Jason Marsden', 'TV-Y', 'Xiaolin Showdown is an American animated television series that aired on Kids WB and was created by Christy Hui. Set in a world where martial arts battles and Eastern magic are commonplace, the series follows four young warriors in training that battle the forces of evil. They do this by protecting Shen Gong Wu from villains that would use them to conquer the world. Originally airing on the Kids'' WB block of programming on WB Network in 2003, the series ran for 3 seasons and 52 episodes. Typical episodes revolve around a specific Shen Gong Wu being revealed which results in both sides racing to find it. Episodes usually reach a head when one good and one evil character must challenge each other to a magical duel called a Xiaolin Showdown for possession of the artifact. A sequel series titled Xiaolin Chronicles was previewed on August 26, 2013 on Disney XD. It began its long-term run on September 14 the same year.', 'Xiaolin Showdown is an American animated television series that aired on Kids WB and was created by Christy Hui. Set in a world where martial arts battles and Eastern magic are commonplace, the series follows four young warriors in training that battle the forces of evil. They do this by protecting Shen Gong Wu from villains that would use them to conquer the world. Originally airing on the Kids'' WB block of programming on WB Network in 2003, the series ran for 3 seasons and 52 episodes. Typical episodes revolve around a specific Shen Gong Wu being revealed which results in both sides racing to find it. Episodes usually reach a head when one good and one evil character must challenge each other to a magical duel called a Xiaolin Showdown for possession of the artifact. A sequel series titled Xiaolin Chronicles was previewed on August 26, 2013 on Disney XD. It began its long-term run on September 14 the same year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxxwz1kYyb5DBttl2VvmHgdDoRe.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:679'),
  ('723417014104871857', 'Xica da Silva', 1996, 'Soap, Drama', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Walcyr Carrasco', 'Taís Araújo, Victor Wagner, Drica Moraes, Carla Cabral, Murilo Rosa, Adriane Galisteu, Carlos Alberto, Eduardo Dussek', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWxMIZeg1Mqz0KFOZ1etFdUIuXa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46143'),
  ('451242310349117287', 'XIII', 2008, 'Action & Adventure, Crime', 'Philippe Lyon, David Wolkove', 'William Vance, Jean Van Hamme', 'Stephen McHattie, Jessalyn Gilsig, Val Kilmer, Stephen Dorff, Caterina Murino, Jacqueline Pillon, John Bourgeois, Hrant Alianak', null, 'The first female US President Sally Sheridan is shot dead by a sniper during her Veterans Day speech. Her assassin narrowly escapes the scene with his life, national security hot on his heels - or so it seems. Three months later, an elderly couple discover the body of a wounded man in a tree, wearing a parachute. The young man cannot remember the slightest thing about his own identity.', 'The first female US President Sally Sheridan is shot dead by a sniper during her Veterans Day speech. Her assassin narrowly escapes the scene with his life, national security hot on his heels - or so it seems. Three months later, an elderly couple discover the body of a wounded man in a tree, wearing a parachute. The young man cannot remember the slightest thing about his own identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUabEbeborjMYya8YB0xqV8phUc.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:6971'),
  ('469264058853844913', 'XIII: The Series', 2011, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Mystery, War & Politics', 'Jean Van Hamme, William Vance', null, 'Stuart Townsend, Roxane Mesquida', null, 'After a plot to kill the president of the USA an agent with lost memories tries to recover his life and memories. Others use him to cover up some dirty business involving high ranking officials from the CIA and the White House.', 'After a plot to kill the president of the USA an agent with lost memories tries to recover his life and memories. Others use him to cover up some dirty business involving high ranking officials from the CIA and the White House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGr9iZFXCl8XOnHOAj17AYz85fr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:34639'),
  ('1009470044442252222', 'XO, Kitty', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jenny Han', null, 'Anna Cathcart, Choi Min-yeong, Gia Kim, Sang Heon Lee, Anthony Keyvan, Regan Aliyah, Peter Thurnwald, Philippe Lee', 'TV-14', 'Teen matchmaker Kitty Song Covey thinks she knows everything there is to know about love. But when she moves halfway across the world to reunite with her long-distance boyfriend, she''ll soon realize that relationships are a lot more complicated when it''s your own heart on the line.', 'Teen matchmaker Kitty Song Covey thinks she knows everything there is to know about love. But when she moves halfway across the world to reunite with her long-distance boyfriend, she''ll soon realize that relationships are a lot more complicated when it''s your own heart on the line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxvTdKAwv27PUfpXOQp6AwWr6V.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:195670'),
  ('157838224338650829', 'Xss The Test', 2026, null, null, null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:319352'),
  ('995949446383312406', 'Xuan-Yuan Sword: Han Cloud', 2017, 'Drama', null, '이문강, Xu Ting', 'Leon Zhang, Yu Menglong, Guan Xiaotong, Karlina Zhang, Gao Weiguang, Li Chung-lin, Wang Ruizi, Dai Si', null, 'Two sword spirits born from a shattered divine blade—brothers Zhaoyun and Muyun—are raised on opposing sides of a brutal war and reunite as enemies on the battlefield. When the truth of their bond is revealed, they join forces with a tribal princess to find the Emperor Sword, defeat a ruthless warlord, and restore peace to a world torn by conflict.', 'Two sword spirits born from a shattered divine blade—brothers Zhaoyun and Muyun—are raised on opposing sides of a brutal war and reunite as enemies on the battlefield. When the truth of their bond is revealed, they join forces with a tribal princess to find the Emperor Sword, defeat a ruthless warlord, and restore peace to a world torn by conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PjJ6DTZHFClETVOpUUI2f19FF4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72092'),
  ('84984559279523131', 'XX', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Lee Seul', 'Hani, Hwang Seung-eon, Bae In-hyuk, Lee Jong-won, Shin Jae-whi, Kim Ji-eun, Kim Jun-gyeong, Na Eun-saem', null, 'Yoon Na Na is a well-regarded bartender at XX bar. She takes pride in her work and position as the head bartender. She involves herself in other parts of XX like selecting menu items or setup of the interior. Her dream is to own XX bar. One day, the new owner of XX appears. She is Lee Roo Mi. The two women were best friends 5 years ago, but something happened between them. Yoon Na Na became upset at Lee Roo Mi. Now, Lee Roo Mi tries to make up with Yoon Na Na, but it''s not easy.', 'Yoon Na Na is a well-regarded bartender at XX bar. She takes pride in her work and position as the head bartender. She involves herself in other parts of XX like selecting menu items or setup of the interior. Her dream is to own XX bar. One day, the new owner of XX appears. She is Lee Roo Mi. The two women were best friends 5 years ago, but something happened between them. Yoon Na Na became upset at Lee Roo Mi. Now, Lee Roo Mi tries to make up with Yoon Na Na, but it''s not easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVx71y4HO32Owv5BiXw2BO0on8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:97956'),
  ('139529501596543842', 'xxxHOLiC', 2006, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Jun Fukuyama, Sayaka Ohara, Kazuya Nakai, Shizuka Itoh, Mika Kikuchi, Hisayo Mochizuki, Kazuko Kojima', 'TV-PG', 'Kimihiro Watanuki is a high school student plagued by ayakashi spirits, both of which are invisible to everyone else but him. The series begins when Watanuki stumbles, seemingly by chance, into a shop that grants wishes. The shop is owned by Yūko Ichihara, a mysterious witch of many names and esoteric renown. For a price, she offers to grant Watanuki''s wish to be rid of the spirits. The price, according to Yūko, must be of equal value; so, as payment, he must become Yūko''s temporary, part-time cook and housekeeper.', 'Kimihiro Watanuki is a high school student plagued by ayakashi spirits, both of which are invisible to everyone else but him. The series begins when Watanuki stumbles, seemingly by chance, into a shop that grants wishes. The shop is owned by Yūko Ichihara, a mysterious witch of many names and esoteric renown. For a price, she offers to grant Watanuki''s wish to be rid of the spirits. The price, according to Yūko, must be of equal value; so, as payment, he must become Yūko''s temporary, part-time cook and housekeeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yY74hwLcG5rQSe6cEUW3HjO3J9.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:36250'),
