  ('872527583239183956', 'Y llegaron de noche', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Bob Fisher, Rob Greenberg', 'Bob Fisher, Rob Greenberg', 'Eugenio Derbez, Sofía Niño de Rivera, AJ Vaage, Yare Santana, Federico Espejo, Laura Ferreti, Diana Bovio, Manuel ''Flaco'' Ibáñez', 'TV-14', 'A workplace comedy about the underdogs who accidentally made the best Dracula movie you''ve never seen—the Spanish version of the 1931 classic.', 'A workplace comedy about the underdogs who accidentally made the best Dracula movie you''ve never seen—the Spanish version of the 1931 classic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gH3BkTA4BoP6TXZ09ZHs0EpwMWu.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272570'),
  ('872421646813718193', 'Y mañana será otro día… mejor', 2018, 'Drama, Soap', 'José Ignacio Valenzuela', 'Cristina García, Martha Carrillo', 'Angélica Vale, Diego Olivera, Alejandra Barros, Emmanuel Palomares, Mauricio Abularach, Fernanda Borches, Miranda Kay, Ana Layevska', 'NR', 'Mónica, a career-minded woman, falls in love with Camilo, her married boss. Meanwhile, his secretly terminally ill wife plans to set up Mónica and her own husband to ensure her children have a family after her death.', 'Mónica, a career-minded woman, falls in love with Camilo, her married boss. Meanwhile, his secretly terminally ill wife plans to set up Mónica and her own husband to ensure her children have a family after her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbxA4OEwAYhjQ7k7ztwLbwEqRcM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:107056'),
  ('116423515618192856', 'Y: The Last Man', 2021, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Eliza Clark', null, 'Diane Lane, Ashley Romans, Ben Schnetzer, Olivia Thirlby, Marin Ireland, Amber Tamblyn', 'TV-MA', 'Traverse a post-apocalyptic world in which a cataclysmic event decimates every mammal with a Y chromosome but for one cisgender man and his pet monkey. Follow the survivors in this new world as they struggle with their efforts to restore what was lost and the opportunity to build something better.', 'Traverse a post-apocalyptic world in which a cataclysmic event decimates every mammal with a Y chromosome but for one cisgender man and his pet monkey. Follow the survivors in this new world as they struggle with their efforts to restore what was lost and the opportunity to build something better.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJvTO2fLOQWwJlQ4MAt7rP8Yno0.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:86550'),
  ('980504032831950490', 'Ya Boy Kongming!', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kaede Hondo, Ryotaro Okiayu, Jun Fukushima, Shoya Chiba, Hibiku Yamamura', 'TV-14', 'General of the Three Kingdoms, Kongming had struggled his whole life, facing countless battles that made him into the accomplished strategist he was. So on his deathbed, he wished only to be reborn into a peaceful world... and was sent straight to modern-day party-central, Tokyo! Can even a brilliant strategist like Kongming adapt to the wild beats and even wilder party people?!', 'General of the Three Kingdoms, Kongming had struggled his whole life, facing countless battles that made him into the accomplished strategist he was. So on his deathbed, he wished only to be reborn into a peaceful world... and was sent straight to modern-day party-central, Tokyo! Can even a brilliant strategist like Kongming adapt to the wild beats and even wilder party people?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WHz6tzLfoaJFoApAOHt2q9qR1m.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138441'),
  ('553308242121848348', 'Ya Shim Man Man', 2003, 'Talk', null, null, 'Yoon Jong-shin, Kim Je-dong, Nichkhun Horvejkul, Jun Jin, Kang Ho-dong, MC Mong, Seo In-young', null, 'Yashimmanman is a South Korean talk show. Citizens were surveyed about various questions, and celebrity guests had to guess the public''s top answers to the questions, sparking much discussion.', 'Yashimmanman is a South Korean talk show. Citizens were surveyed about various questions, and celebrity guests had to guess the public''s top answers to the questions, sparking much discussion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2jKv5sKnyMAuGet6anwJnScq36.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66619'),
  ('384805757844772218', 'Yabba-Dabba Dinosaurs', 2020, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Family', null, null, 'Jessica DiCicco, Ely Henry, Eric Bauza, Jeff Bergman, Kevin Michael Richardson, Tress MacNeille, Grey DeLisle', 'TV-Y7', 'Pebbles Flintstone and Bam-Bam Rubble are two best friends who do everything together - go to school, hang out at the weekends, and ride giant dinosaurs! Join The Flintstones'' adventures in stone age Bedrock, and revisit the familiar faces like Fred and Wilma Flintstone, Barney and Betty Rubble, Dino and all your favourite prehistoric pals!', 'Pebbles Flintstone and Bam-Bam Rubble are two best friends who do everything together - go to school, hang out at the weekends, and ride giant dinosaurs! Join The Flintstones'' adventures in stone age Bedrock, and revisit the familiar faces like Fred and Wilma Flintstone, Barney and Betty Rubble, Dino and all your favourite prehistoric pals!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywpDEYIo4KhhtGLfpCQLVmKrwwg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:109086'),
  ('1015086838419087697', 'Yae''s Sakura', 2013, 'Drama', null, 'Tomoko Yoshizawa, Junko Oyama', 'Haruka Ayase, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Jun Fubuki, Yutaka Matsushige, Joe Odagiri, Eiji Okuda, Izumi Inamori, Toshiyuki Nishida', null, 'Yae no Sakura is a 2013 Japanese television series. It is the 52nd NHK taiga drama. The story focuses on Niijima Yae, who is portrayed by Haruka Ayase.', 'Yae no Sakura is a 2013 Japanese television series. It is the 52nd NHK taiga drama. The story focuses on Niijima Yae, who is portrayed by Haruka Ayase.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDbztAeR3GRaPVh5JAHb0RIOKRZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46077'),
  ('1088526408516364400', 'Yago', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Drama, Soap', 'Larissa Andrade', null, 'Iván Sánchez, Gabriela de la Garza, Flavio Medina, Pablo Valentín, Manuel Ojeda, Patricio Castillo, Rosa María Bianchi, Karina Gidi', null, 'Omar, a young man from Mexico City, is betrayed by his fiancé, Sara, and two close friends, in a failed robbery plot where he was famed as the perpetrator. After being unjustly imprisoned for 11 years and later released, he undergoes plastic surgery to alter his appearance and plots revenge under his new identity, "Yago".', 'Omar, a young man from Mexico City, is betrayed by his fiancé, Sara, and two close friends, in a failed robbery plot where he was famed as the perpetrator. After being unjustly imprisoned for 11 years and later released, he undergoes plastic surgery to alter his appearance and plots revenge under his new identity, "Yago".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCkqI49iexou6yNBnQeSPmnDxCT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66517'),
  ('227078699553846652', 'YAIBA: Samurai Legend', 2025, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Minami Takayama, Manaka Iwami', 'TV-14', 'Yaiba''s journey to becoming a true samurai takes him from his home in the forest to a bustling city full of rivals, friends and ancient powers.', 'Yaiba''s journey to becoming a true samurai takes him from his home in the forest to a bustling city full of rivals, friends and ancient powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxD3FQP4hDU5hSABwdQCvGrrnz6.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:254017'),
  ('774909112012720862', 'Yakamoz S-245', 2022, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'Jason George', 'Jason George', 'Kıvanç Tatlıtuğ, Özge Özpirinçci, Ertan Saban, Meriç Aral, Jerry Hoffmann, Ece Çeşmioğlu, Ecem Uzun, Ersin Arıcı', null, 'After disaster strikes the Earth, a marine biologist on a research mission in a submarine must fight to advance the process into a conspiracy.', 'After disaster strikes the Earth, a marine biologist on a research mission in a submarine must fight to advance the process into a conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaPSsdJrRZFtMRNrS4OqTpSkGFo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:195930'),
  ('1014312072207121838', 'Yakari', 2005, 'Animation, Family, Kids', 'Claude de Ribaupierre', null, 'Maxime Nivet, Yoann Sover, Pierre Casanova, Julia Fölster', 'TV-Y', 'The adventures of a young Sioux Native American who has the unique ability to talk with animals.', 'The adventures of a young Sioux Native American who has the unique ability to talk with animals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6f0BgHD2MCbXYutUcoAjJXc7IAQ.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61071'),
  ('540775471218584090', 'Yakarta', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Diego San José', null, 'Javier Cámara, Carla Quílez, Pilar Gómez, David Lorente, Marina Guerola, Anna Alarcón, Pablo Vázquez, Nuria Mencía', null, 'José Ramón Garrido is a former Olympic badminton player who makes a living teaching physical education at a public high school in Vallecas. Divorced and without prospects, Joserra has been drifting for years, but he keeps himself afloat with a daily purpose. Joserra believes he has discovered the diamond that will turn his life around at a school tournament: Mar, a teenage player who could be his ticket to fulfilling his dream of competing in Jakarta, the city where former players like him are respected as stars. Joserra and Mar will have to learn to put up with each other on a journey full of dingy guesthouses, run-down sports centers, and gas stations that takes them through Totana, Ponferrada, Torrelavega, and Tardajos before they reach the Indonesian capital. That is, if they ever get there.', 'José Ramón Garrido is a former Olympic badminton player who makes a living teaching physical education at a public high school in Vallecas. Divorced and without prospects, Joserra has been drifting for years, but he keeps himself afloat with a daily purpose. Joserra believes he has discovered the diamond that will turn his life around at a school tournament: Mar, a teenage player who could be his ticket to fulfilling his dream of competing in Jakarta, the city where former players like him are respected as stars. Joserra and Mar will have to learn to put up with each other on a journey full of dingy guesthouses, run-down sports centers, and gas stations that takes them through Totana, Ponferrada, Torrelavega, and Tardajos before they reach the Indonesian capital. That is, if they ever get there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hMAgLpmDhcyHwXyG2ZowKoLedD.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:287358'),
  ('939535370031807352', 'Yakitate!! Japan', 2004, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Yasunao Aoki', null, 'Marina Inoue, Yumiko Kobayashi, Yu Shimaka, Takehito Koyasu, Chigusa Ikeda, Tomokazu Seki, Chihiro Ohtsuka, Takayuki Sakazume', null, 'Azuma Kazuma isn''t terribly clever, but he''s got a good heart and great skill - at baking. Since childhood, he''s been on a quest to create the perfect bread to represent Japan internationally. Now, he seeks to enter the famous bakery Pantasia, in hopes of reaching his goal. But plots abound...', 'Azuma Kazuma isn''t terribly clever, but he''s got a good heart and great skill - at baking. Since childhood, he''s been on a quest to create the perfect bread to represent Japan internationally. Now, he seeks to enter the famous bakery Pantasia, in hopes of reaching his goal. But plots abound...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FwUqjpiYxfnTxMwjYaVd5Wd8Wp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:46350'),
  ('1014335976826183291', 'Yakitori: Soldiers of Misfortune', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Taito Ban, Asami Seto, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Kengo Kawanishi, Akari Kito, Kenjiro Tsuda, Wataru Takagi, Tetsu Inada', 'TV-MA', 'With Earth colonized by a superior alien civilization, Akira''s only chance at a better future is to enlist as an expendable Yakitori foot soldier.', 'With Earth colonized by a superior alien civilization, Akira''s only chance at a better future is to enlist as an expendable Yakitori foot soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZCvtTOZEHuXs8ChoxUbp60L9gE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:223119'),
  ('457896739773542338', 'Yakuza Fiancé: Raise wa Tanin ga Ii', 2024, 'Animation, Crime, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Hitomi Ueda, Akira Ishida, Koji Yusa, Yoji Ueda, Kazuya Nakai, Ryota Takeuchi, Hiroshi Shimozaki, Katsuyuki Konishi', null, 'Yoshino’s engagement is far from a dream come true. Her grandfather, head of the largest yakuza group in Kansai, has arranged her marriage to Kirishima, grandson of the Miyama Clan leader, as part of a truce. To Yoshino’s surprise, Kirishima seems kind and charming for a yakuza member. But his warm facade only serves to mask a dark and dangerous truth.', 'Yoshino’s engagement is far from a dream come true. Her grandfather, head of the largest yakuza group in Kansai, has arranged her marriage to Kirishima, grandson of the Miyama Clan leader, as part of a truce. To Yoshino’s surprise, Kirishima seems kind and charming for a yakuza member. But his warm facade only serves to mask a dark and dangerous truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAlMjm8CIPCiKGP2iCiKbXqEokI.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:259787'),
  ('816835563737277774', 'Yakuza Lover', 2022, 'Drama', null, null, 'Fumika Baba, Yuta Furukawa, Mario Kuroba, Keita Kimura, Shizuka Nakamura, Manami Hashimoto, Kenya Osumi, Kou Nanase', null, 'When feisty college student Yuri is attacked at a party, she''s saved by Oya Toshiomi, the underboss of a yakuza syndicate. Despite her obvious attraction to him, she convinces herself that she''s not in the market for a bad boy type. But when they meet again, she finds herself irresistibly drawn to him—kicking off a steamy and dangerous love affair that threatens to consume her, body and soul. Adapted from a manga by the same title.', 'When feisty college student Yuri is attacked at a party, she''s saved by Oya Toshiomi, the underboss of a yakuza syndicate. Despite her obvious attraction to him, she convinces herself that she''s not in the market for a bad boy type. But when they meet again, she finds herself irresistibly drawn to him—kicking off a steamy and dangerous love affair that threatens to consume her, body and soul. Adapted from a manga by the same title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSAOKfovsrefayA25usDyoObhYQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:208751'),
  ('921334826294354272', 'Yalan Dünya', 2012, 'Family, Comedy', 'Gülse Birsel, Jale Atabey Özberk', 'Gülse Birsel', 'Altan Erkekli, Füsun Demirel, Olgun Şimşek, Beyaz, Gülse Birsel, Hasibe Eren, Sarp Apak, Öner Erkan', null, 'Yalan Dünya produced by Gülse Birsel and directed by Jale Atabey at 2012.', 'Yalan Dünya produced by Gülse Birsel and directed by Jale Atabey at 2012.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48bzd0jjraZJN6F2tL7xr75pCo9.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:43393'),
  ('97598774368473644', 'Yamada-kun and the Seven Witches', 2013, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mariya Nishiuchi, Yusuke Yamamoto, Reina Triendl, Airi Matsui, Karen Miyama, Ito Ohno, Yuuki Nagae, Shotaro Mamiya', null, 'Urara Shiraishi is a model student with excellent grades. Ryu Yamada is a trouble student. One day, Urara tumbles down the stairs with Ryu. After the accident, their bodies become switched. When they tumbled down the stairs, they happened to kiss. They guess that they may have changed bodies because of the kiss. They kiss again and they get their own bodies back. Through kissing they can change bodies freely. They also learn that there are 7 witches with special abilities and that the 7 witches can use their special abilities by kissing, so Urara and Ryu set out to find the 7 witches.', 'Urara Shiraishi is a model student with excellent grades. Ryu Yamada is a trouble student. One day, Urara tumbles down the stairs with Ryu. After the accident, their bodies become switched. When they tumbled down the stairs, they happened to kiss. They guess that they may have changed bodies because of the kiss. They kiss again and they get their own bodies back. Through kissing they can change bodies freely. They also learn that there are 7 witches with special abilities and that the 7 witches can use their special abilities by kissing, so Urara and Ryu set out to find the 7 witches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz0kVPyCiYGUqopghReDaSTA9yn.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57565'),
  ('108796457427136118', 'Yamada-kun and the Seven Witches', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Mystery', null, null, 'Ryota Osaka, Saori Hayami, Toshiki Masuda, Maaya Uchida, Toshiharu Sasaki, Eri Kitamura, Daisuke Ono, Jun Fukuyama', 'TV-14', 'One day, high-school boy Yamada bumps into the beautiful girl Shiraishi on the stairs (literally), and their lips touch as they fall. When they regain their wits, they realize that they have swapped bodies. As time progresses, the two realize that this is not the only mysterious happening in the school.', 'One day, high-school boy Yamada bumps into the beautiful girl Shiraishi on the stairs (literally), and their lips touch as they fall. When they regain their wits, they realize that they have swapped bodies. As time progresses, the two realize that this is not the only mysterious happening in the school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7j7cptjQvaMX2l12EkatqC54Q9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62568'),
  ('588385384934525821', 'Yamada''s First Time: B Gata H Kei', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yukari Tamura, Atsushi Abe, Yui Horie, Kana Hanazawa, Yu Kobayashi, Rumi Shishido, Asami Shimoda, Mamiko Noto', 'TV-MA', 'Yamada is the cutest girl in the entire school, and she wants to have her way with 100 different boys before the final bell rings. There’s just one problem: she’s never even been kissed! Lucky for her, class geek Kosuda is ready to serve as her own personal Sex Ed dummy! Can these wannabe lovebirds master the art of seduction before the sun sets on high school forever?', 'Yamada is the cutest girl in the entire school, and she wants to have her way with 100 different boys before the final bell rings. There’s just one problem: she’s never even been kissed! Lucky for her, class geek Kosuda is ready to serve as her own personal Sex Ed dummy! Can these wannabe lovebirds master the art of seduction before the sun sets on high school forever?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLipDrHs43crcs9KIlCIC7gW0RQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45967'),
  ('664657479116266185', 'Yamato Takeru', 1994, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yoshiko Kamei, Ayumi Kida, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Chafurin, Megumi Ogata, Kazuhiro Nakata, Akira Ishida, Atsuko Tanaka', null, 'In the 25th century, a spaceship carrying 300 people leaves the earth in search of a new world in the solar system, but an unexpected accident occurs. They crash into a black hole which is connected to another universe. The people on the ship are cast adrift in an emergency capsule to a planet called Ismo. The story begins 12 years after they have reached Ismo. Ismo is a star of the Onam System, which corresponds to the Solar System in our universe. It is the only planet left in the Onam System. The Death Star called Yomi is a comet which regularly approaches the Onam System.', 'In the 25th century, a spaceship carrying 300 people leaves the earth in search of a new world in the solar system, but an unexpected accident occurs. They crash into a black hole which is connected to another universe. The people on the ship are cast adrift in an emergency capsule to a planet called Ismo. The story begins 12 years after they have reached Ismo. Ismo is a star of the Onam System, which corresponds to the Solar System in our universe. It is the only planet left in the Onam System. The Death Star called Yomi is a comet which regularly approaches the Onam System.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhfjW0HgQVq42OvzXg5hbZCieSB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:22519'),
  ('574764317807027118', 'Yamibo - Darkness, the Hat, and the Travelers of the Books', 2003, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Drama', 'オービット「ヤミと帽子と本の旅人」', 'Tomomi Mochizuki', 'Mamiko Noto, Sanae Kobayashi, Reiko Takagi, Kikuko Inoue, Romi Park, Shin-ichiro Miki, Takashi Nagasako, Rie Kanda', null, 'Hatsuki is a highschool student living with her sister, Hatsumi, who she has a huge crush on. On Hatsumi''s 16th birthday, she is suddenly surrounded by a green light and disappears in front of Hatsuki! She manages to follow Hatsumi with the help of a being resembling a fat baby chick (literally), ending up in a place called "The Great Library", which is full of different worlds stored in books. Hatsumi wasn''t there, though, so the search for Hatsuki''s great love begins and involves traveling from book to book.', 'Hatsuki is a highschool student living with her sister, Hatsumi, who she has a huge crush on. On Hatsumi''s 16th birthday, she is suddenly surrounded by a green light and disappears in front of Hatsuki! She manages to follow Hatsumi with the help of a being resembling a fat baby chick (literally), ending up in a place called "The Great Library", which is full of different worlds stored in books. Hatsumi wasn''t there, though, so the search for Hatsuki''s great love begins and involves traveling from book to book.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msFl5bIuCZs1G2IY3oPE9BMCVog.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:26843'),
  ('681135421424349433', 'Yancy Derringer', 1958, 'Western, Action & Adventure', 'Richard Sale, Mary Loos', null, 'X Brands, Jock Mahoney, Kevin Hagen', 'TV-PG', 'Yancy Derringer is an American Western series', 'Yancy Derringer is an American Western series', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kUjeNoI23qwKDJnGldIvy16HEb.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11388'),
  ('611736415673769998', 'Yandere Dark Elf: She Chased Me All the Way from Another World!', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Rie Kawamura, Minami Takahashi, Kyouka Maruyama, Hinako Takahashi, Ayumi Mano', 'TV-MA', 'Hinata did it. He got reincarnated into another world, took up the mantle of Hero, and slew the dreaded Demon Lord alongside his party of fellow adventurers. As his reward, he’s returned to Earth to resume a normal life. Or it would be if it wasn’t for the fact that his dark elf companion Mariabelle decided to travel to Earth to come and live with him! Now she uses her arcane talents to ward off any potential romantic rivals and capture Hinata’s affection.', 'Hinata did it. He got reincarnated into another world, took up the mantle of Hero, and slew the dreaded Demon Lord alongside his party of fellow adventurers. As his reward, he’s returned to Earth to resume a normal life. Or it would be if it wasn’t for the fact that his dark elf companion Mariabelle decided to travel to Earth to come and live with him! Now she uses her arcane talents to ward off any potential romantic rivals and capture Hinata’s affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCWtp80MCEBPMuRmAjm2zNMgOSW.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:271003'),
  ('486119803195570814', 'Yankee', 2019, 'Crime, Drama', 'Diego Enrique Osorno, Veronica Velasco, Epigmenio Ibarra', null, 'Pablo Lyle, Pamela Almanza, Sebastián Ferrat, Ana Layevska, Julio Casado, Gabriela Zamora, Miguel Garza', 'TV-MA', 'On the run from the police, an Arizona man crosses into Mexico and gets deeply involved in drug trafficking, with the help of modern technology.', 'On the run from the police, an Arizona man crosses into Mexico and gets deeply involved in drug trafficking, with the help of modern technology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjAnDlC1xWAAF7MKEhE2TG0pfI4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88775'),
  ('486124338285395942', 'Yano-kun''s Ordinary Days', 2025, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Kohei Amasaki, Yuka Nukui', null, 'Kiyoko Yoshida is an overanxious class representative who can’t help but worry about Tsuyoshi Yano, who sits beside her. Tsuyoshi comes to school covered in bruises, and as Kiyoko tends to him day after day, the two draw closer. Where will Kiyoko’s feelings take her? Will Tsuyoshi’s life ever be normal?', 'Kiyoko Yoshida is an overanxious class representative who can’t help but worry about Tsuyoshi Yano, who sits beside her. Tsuyoshi comes to school covered in bruises, and as Kiyoko tends to him day after day, the two draw closer. Where will Kiyoko’s feelings take her? Will Tsuyoshi’s life ever be normal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kExjEL79wXEn8v4nk8iQp9s9T53.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:276349'),
  ('915635051632197435', 'Yanxi Palace: Princess Adventures', 2019, 'Drama', null, 'Zhou Mo', 'Wang Herun, Xu Xiaonuo, Wang Yizhe, Wang Yuwei, Wu Jinyan, Nie Yuan', null, 'A determined Qing dynasty princess contends with palace intrigue and a vendetta against her family while navigating the treacherous terrain of romance.', 'A determined Qing dynasty princess contends with palace intrigue and a vendetta against her family while navigating the treacherous terrain of romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vgEaoqXS6lSounwZadfCT3O27JR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:96997'),
  ('114772932113007338', 'Yao-Chinese Folktales', 2023, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Chen Liaoyu', null, null, 'TV-14', 'Yao-Chinese Folktales has eight independent story rooted in traditional Chinese culture', 'Yao-Chinese Folktales has eight independent story rooted in traditional Chinese culture', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyDRtY01krTcs1JP74XL2XxqUb4.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:139162'),
  ('987732944684969666', 'Yarichin Bitch Club', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Yusuke Kobayashi, Takuya Sato, Ayumu Murase, Masahiro Yamanaka, Daiki Hamano, Tsubasa Yonaga, Masatomo Nakazawa', null, 'First-year Toono transfers from Tokyo to the all-boys boarding school deep in the mountains, "Mori Moori Private School." The friendly Yaguchi who calls out to him becomes his only friend, but his dislike of sports makes him join the most laid-back looking photography club instead of Yaguchi''s soccer club. However, the photography club is in name only and is actually nicknamed the "Yarichin Bitch Club," filled with colorful seniors. In contrast to the troubled Toono, Kajima, who joined the club at the same time, is completely unphased and even slips a confession to Toono into the confusion. Toono himself thinks Yaguchi is cute, but Yaguchi finds himself blushing around Kajima and stuff happens. Furthermore, complications arise between the seniors…', 'First-year Toono transfers from Tokyo to the all-boys boarding school deep in the mountains, "Mori Moori Private School." The friendly Yaguchi who calls out to him becomes his only friend, but his dislike of sports makes him join the most laid-back looking photography club instead of Yaguchi''s soccer club. However, the photography club is in name only and is actually nicknamed the "Yarichin Bitch Club," filled with colorful seniors. In contrast to the troubled Toono, Kajima, who joined the club at the same time, is completely unphased and even slips a confession to Toono into the confusion. Toono himself thinks Yaguchi is cute, but Yaguchi finds himself blushing around Kajima and stuff happens. Furthermore, complications arise between the seniors…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lz9FZVmb4zoy6L9of47atKz8uAE.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:99466'),
  ('328978336205385817', 'Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon', 2020, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Sara Matsumoto, Mikako Komatsu, Azusa Tadokoro, Ryohei Kimura, Takehiro Urao, Fairouz Ai, Jun Fukuyama, Yoshimasa Hosoya', 'TV-14', 'In feudal Japan, half-demon twins Towa and Setsuna are separated from each other during a forest fire. While desperately searching for her younger sister, Towa wanders into a mysterious tunnel that sends her into present-day Japan, where she is found and raised by Kagome Higurashi’s brother, Sota, and his family. Ten years later, the tunnel that connects the two eras has reopened, allowing Towa to be reunited with Setsuna, who is now a demon slayer working for Kohaku. But to Towa’s shock, Setsuna appears to have lost all memories of her older sister', 'In feudal Japan, half-demon twins Towa and Setsuna are separated from each other during a forest fire. While desperately searching for her younger sister, Towa wanders into a mysterious tunnel that sends her into present-day Japan, where she is found and raised by Kagome Higurashi’s brother, Sota, and his family. Ten years later, the tunnel that connects the two eras has reopened, allowing Towa to be reunited with Setsuna, who is now a demon slayer working for Kohaku. But to Towa’s shock, Setsuna appears to have lost all memories of her older sister', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/78l5gFTXyLp9KE4uSWJgSRb9RGj.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:103254'),
  ('544949916913956196', 'Yasuke', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'LeSean Thomas', null, 'LaKeith Stanfield, Maya Tanida, Takehiro Hira, Julie Marcus, Ming-Na Wen, Noshir Dalal, Dia Frampton, Paul Nakauchi', 'TV-MA', 'A peaceful boatman once known as the Black Samurai is pulled back into conflict when he takes a little girl with mysterious powers under his wing.', 'A peaceful boatman once known as the Black Samurai is pulled back into conflict when he takes a little girl with mysterious powers under his wing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgYqEkZQS2fgC6E9fe8Le1Kxbmw.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:112166'),
  ('1127512274088911057', 'Yasuragi no Toki: Michi', 2019, 'Drama', null, null, 'Koji Ishizaka, Ruriko Asaoka, Mariko Kaga, Tatsuya Fuji, Mickey Curtis, Tsunehiko Kamijô, Gorō Ibuki, Yasuaki Kurata', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieb6ZCQY18tsAcoJDnKoWgkDsJG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201876'),
  ('1050192858509621698', 'YATAGARASU: The Raven Does Not Choose Its Master', 2024, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Mutsumi Tamura, Miyu Irino, Rina Honnizumi, Hiroki Nanami, Ayaka Fukuhara, Rie Kugimiya, Eiji Takeuchi, Satoshi Hino', 'TV-14', 'Welcome to Yamauchi, a world inhabited by the Yatagarasu, a race of three-legged ravens who shapeshift into humans. The land is divided into four regions—North, South, East, and West—each ruled by a noble family. Yukiya, the son of a leader in the North, is shocked by a call to attend to the Imperial Prince. Murder, mysteries, and an invasion from an unexpected enemy await in this epic fantasy.', 'Welcome to Yamauchi, a world inhabited by the Yatagarasu, a race of three-legged ravens who shapeshift into humans. The land is divided into four regions—North, South, East, and West—each ruled by a noble family. Yukiya, the son of a leader in the North, is shocked by a call to attend to the Imperial Prince. Murder, mysteries, and an invasion from an unexpected enemy await in this epic fantasy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bCUChAf6BvXtZ7LGfFRBob3Zk5B.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:243141'),
  ('174543346738239015', 'Yatterman Night', 2015, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Eri Kitamura, Shizuka Itoh, Hiroaki Hirata, Kenta Miyake, Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'TV-14', 'A girl is looking at a remote island on the ocean named The Yatter Kingdom, a country that is said to be ruled by the hero Yatterman. The girl wants to ask the Yattermans for some help to cure her sick mother and decides to venture to the kingdom. She gets kicked out from the kingdom though and her mother dies without receiving any help. Under Dokurobei, the boss of the Dorombo thieves that existed, lies a beauty named Doronjo. The two men, Boyacky and Tonzura, worked under Doronjo but got kicked out from the Yatter Kingdom along with the Doronbo thieves as they lost a fight against the Yatterman. This is the new generation of Dorombo—Doronjo, Boyacky, Tonzura, and new Yatterman—a story of the birth of Gan-chan and Ai-chan.', 'A girl is looking at a remote island on the ocean named The Yatter Kingdom, a country that is said to be ruled by the hero Yatterman. The girl wants to ask the Yattermans for some help to cure her sick mother and decides to venture to the kingdom. She gets kicked out from the kingdom though and her mother dies without receiving any help. Under Dokurobei, the boss of the Dorombo thieves that existed, lies a beauty named Doronjo. The two men, Boyacky and Tonzura, worked under Doronjo but got kicked out from the Yatter Kingdom along with the Doronbo thieves as they lost a fight against the Yatterman. This is the new generation of Dorombo—Doronjo, Boyacky, Tonzura, and new Yatterman—a story of the birth of Gan-chan and Ai-chan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WlcVJeidNe2d3EL6fQHetM3BQK.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61919'),
  ('532337505283978569', 'Yawara!', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Naoki Urasawa', 'Naoki Urasawa', 'Yuko Minaguchi, Ichiro Nagai, Toshihiko Seki, Yoshino Takamori, Akira Kamiya, Masashi Sugawara, Chiyoko Kawashima', null, 'Inokuma Yawara is just another young high school girl. Well, not quite - for Yawara is being raised by her grandfather, 7th dan Judo master Inokuma Jigorou, to be Japan''s great hope for the women''s Judo competition at the 1992 Olympics in Barcelona. All the same, Yawara just wants to live a normal life...', 'Inokuma Yawara is just another young high school girl. Well, not quite - for Yawara is being raised by her grandfather, 7th dan Judo master Inokuma Jigorou, to be Japan''s great hope for the women''s Judo competition at the 1992 Olympics in Barcelona. All the same, Yawara just wants to live a normal life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRYqKPqAJp5PdrULbH75cLtVi6o.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:30395'),
  ('929526046078027056', 'Year Hare Affair', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Kids', '逆光飞行', null, 'Xiao Liansha, Xie Yunshan, Shan Xin, Shan Xin, Tan Xiao, Da Hai', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yEUZ05I5I0mfJOXUdmRQ97634V.jpg', 8, 'tmdb:tv:97819'),
  ('322479232796641377', 'Year Million', 2017, 'Drama, Documentary, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Laurence Fishburne', 'TV-14', 'Explore what it will be like to be human one million years into the future. Today’s brightest futurists, scientists, scholars and notable science fiction writers guide viewers through the very latest advances in technology, ideas and innovations that likely will power the evolution of our species.', 'Explore what it will be like to be human one million years into the future. Today’s brightest futurists, scientists, scholars and notable science fiction writers guide viewers through the very latest advances in technology, ideas and innovations that likely will power the evolution of our species.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2NeEZindaZ7tC1kRgAhNen7IJs.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71732'),
  ('888625515709644787', 'Year of Culture', 2018, 'Comedy', null, 'Ilya Motovilov', 'Fyodor Bondarchuk, Mariya Akhmetzyanova, Rinal Mukhametov, Aleksandr Lykov, Aleksandr Yatsenko, Olga Medynich, Aleksandr Oblasov, Valeriya Shkirando', null, 'Negligent official Viktor Mikhailovich Sychev is sent into exile to the Department of Literature at a regional university. There he will have to exchange a cozy leather armchair and a spacious office for a rickety stool and a dusty auditorium. What could be better for an employee of the Ministry of Education than a complete immersion in this very education? The series will show how negligent attitude to one''s own duties can turn out for a high-ranking official.', 'Negligent official Viktor Mikhailovich Sychev is sent into exile to the Department of Literature at a regional university. There he will have to exchange a cozy leather armchair and a spacious office for a rickety stool and a dusty auditorium. What could be better for an employee of the Ministry of Education than a complete immersion in this very education? The series will show how negligent attitude to one''s own duties can turn out for a high-ranking official.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h2ldK4PUupJ9T0EQHydPxmaStAp.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:84245'),
  ('573246322516249347', 'Year of the Rabbit', 2019, 'Comedy, Crime, Action & Adventure, Mystery', null, null, 'Matt Berry, Freddie Fox, Susan Wokoma, Alun Armstrong, Paul Kaye, Ann Mitchell, Keeley Hawes', 'TV-14', 'Set in the dark heart of Victorian London, Detective Inspector Rabbit is a hardened booze-hound who''s seen it all. Rabbit''s been chasing bad guys for as long as he can remember, but these days his heart keeps stopping at inopportune moments.', 'Set in the dark heart of Victorian London, Detective Inspector Rabbit is a hardened booze-hound who''s seen it all. Rabbit''s been chasing bad guys for as long as he can remember, but these days his heart keeps stopping at inopportune moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3o7vYuhRn6LSlE1YjaiTtbhU8Ja.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:90184'),
  ('171725875273038853', 'Years and Years', 2019, 'Drama, War & Politics, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Russell T Davies', 'Emma Thompson, Anne Reid, Rory Kinnear, Jessica Hynes, Russell Tovey, Ruth Madeley, T''Nia Miller, Lydia West', 'TV-MA', 'As Britain is rocked by unstable political, economic and technological advances, members of the Lyons family converge on one crucial night in 2019. Over the next 15 years, the twists and turns of their everyday lives are explored as we find out if this ordinary family could change the world.', 'As Britain is rocked by unstable political, economic and technological advances, members of the Lyons family converge on one crucial night in 2019. Over the next 15 years, the twists and turns of their everyday lives are explored as we find out if this ordinary family could change the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1FBsyMH9Tx7K5yzMnJsYRvNEKQ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87104'),
  ('382145409133907283', 'Years of Living Dangerously', 2014, 'Documentary', null, null, null, 'TV-14', 'Featuring some of Hollywood’s most influential stars, Years of Living Dangerously reveals emotional and hard-hitting accounts of the effects of climate change from across the planet.', 'Featuring some of Hollywood’s most influential stars, Years of Living Dangerously reveals emotional and hard-hitting accounts of the effects of climate change from across the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A60XIMm3pFBNjHMV9LooW2Rh2pr.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:52684'),
  ('1148455703843522888', 'Yedi Numara', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Oya Yüce', 'Ayça Mutlugil, Oya Yüce', 'Şebnem Sönmez, Engin Alkan, Tuba Erdem, Ayça Mutlugil, Nuray Uslu, Gülden Güney, Volkan Girgin, Okan Selvi', null, 'A couple with no kids, four city girls and three country boys, all under the same roof: arguing, fighting and sometimes understanding they are not that much different.', 'A couple with no kids, four city girls and three country boys, all under the same roof: arguing, fighting and sometimes understanding they are not that much different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xv2FEyLsR3VQhzEgoWU0X3R9L6I.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:48273'),
  ('538274140953418543', 'Yeditepe Istanbul', 2001, 'Family, Drama', 'Ali Ulvi Hünkar', 'Ali Ulvi Hünkar', 'Zuhal Olcay, Uğur Polat, Emre Kınay, Oktay Kaynarca, Ruhi Sarı, Itır Esen, Meral Okay, Günay Karacaoğlu', null, 'When Olcay''s husband commits suicide and leaves a huge debt behind, Olcay and her teenage daughter, Duru, are forced to move to a slum in Istanbul. They find themselves financially dependent on Olcay''s only remaining friend, so Olcay starts to look for a job. Without any degree or experience, she tries to survive doing all sorts of odd jobs. Meanwhile, her neighbors, who are completely different from the people in Olcay''s old world, begin to get to like the mother and daughter. Some even fall in love.', 'When Olcay''s husband commits suicide and leaves a huge debt behind, Olcay and her teenage daughter, Duru, are forced to move to a slum in Istanbul. They find themselves financially dependent on Olcay''s only remaining friend, so Olcay starts to look for a job. Without any degree or experience, she tries to survive doing all sorts of odd jobs. Meanwhile, her neighbors, who are completely different from the people in Olcay''s old world, begin to get to like the mother and daughter. Some even fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yRumooVtDmMeRQoNoO7TbE5J6aK.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:48342'),
  ('999866124678416661', 'Yeh Kaali Kaali Ankhein', 2022, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Siddharth Sengupta', 'Umesh Padalkar, Siddharth Sengupta', 'Tahir Raj Bhasin, Shweta Tripathi Sharma, Anchal Singh, Saurabh Shukla, Brijendra Kala, Anant Joshi, Arunoday Singh, Gurmeet Choudhary', 'TV-MA', 'Relentlessly pursued by a powerful politician’s daughter who will do anything to make him hers, a man slips down a dark, risky path to reclaim his life.', 'Relentlessly pursued by a powerful politician’s daughter who will do anything to make him hers, a man slips down a dark, risky path to reclaim his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyHFgiRHBW3DP43x0vw2gpBpBUx.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:153950'),
  ('444581716345087068', 'Yeh Meri Family', 2018, 'Family, Drama', 'Sameer Saxena', 'Nikhil Sachan, Saurabh Khanna', 'Rajesh Kumar, Juhi Parmar, Hetal Gada, Anngad Raaj, Veena Mehta', null, 'Set in the summer of 1998 it is a story about conflicting emotions towards family members from the eyes of a twelve year old.', 'Set in the summer of 1998 it is a story about conflicting emotions towards family members from the eyes of a twelve year old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F33yqUYIzmFQwDibEjPoJxxTXg.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:81166'),
  ('643222236127840555', 'Yeh Rishta Kya Kehlata Hai', 2009, 'Drama, Family, Soap', null, null, 'Harshad Chopda, Pranali Rathod, Priyamvada Kant, Sushant Marya', 'TV-14', 'Naitik and Akshara Singhania live in a Marwari joint family in Udaipur. As a young married couple, they journey through adjustment issues, later as parents of young children, and they learn to love each other and their respective extended families while becoming mature members of their household.', 'Naitik and Akshara Singhania live in a Marwari joint family in Udaipur. As a young married couple, they journey through adjustment issues, later as parents of young children, and they learn to love each other and their respective extended families while becoming mature members of their household.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y9U6187kzOigTJiAezzYA875WGV.jpg', 68, 'tmdb:tv:16413'),
  ('520386506112977181', 'Yehh Jadu Hai Jinn Ka!', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Gul Khan', null, 'Aditi Sharma, vaibhavi kapoor, Shehzada Dhami, Vikram Singh Chauhan, Jaswinder Gardner, Shruti Sharma, Gouri Agarwal, Garima Vikrant Singh', null, 'He lives under the shadow of a djinn while she is blessed with angelic qualities. What turn will Aman and Roshni''s life take when the two fall in love?', 'He lives under the shadow of a djinn while she is blessed with angelic qualities. What turn will Aman and Roshni''s life take when the two fall in love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aJNgwhsFNzqffNRQSQwUBe2MUsN.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:94783'),
  ('354775281543760694', 'Yellowjackets', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Ashley Lyle, Bart Nickerson', null, 'Melanie Lynskey, Tawny Cypress, Sophie Nélisse, Jasmin Savoy Brown, Sophie Thatcher, Sammi Hanratty, Warren Kole, Courtney Eaton', 'TV-MA', 'This equal parts survival epic, psychological horror story and coming-of-age drama tells the saga of a team of wildly talented high school girls soccer players who become the (un)lucky survivors of a plane crash deep in the remote northern wilderness. The series chronicles their descent from a complicated but thriving team to savage clans, while also tracking the lives they’ve attempted to piece back together nearly 25 years later.', 'This equal parts survival epic, psychological horror story and coming-of-age drama tells the saga of a team of wildly talented high school girls soccer players who become the (un)lucky survivors of a plane crash deep in the remote northern wilderness. The series chronicles their descent from a complicated but thriving team to savage clans, while also tracking the lives they’ve attempted to piece back together nearly 25 years later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRnGrn7Z7SC0KIBodocoU1QgDZF.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:117488'),
  ('730063413216837828', 'Yellowstone', 2009, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Peter Firth', 'TV-G', 'A natural history portrait of a year in Yellowstone, following the fortunes of America''s wildlife icons as they face the challenges of one of the most extraordinary wildernesses on Earth.', 'A natural history portrait of a year in Yellowstone, following the fortunes of America''s wildlife icons as they face the challenges of one of the most extraordinary wildernesses on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4oNV3A0Sqx9myNYff0OPtnXVN3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:19355'),
  ('879507604872922398', 'Yellowstone', 2018, 'Western, Drama', 'Taylor Sheridan, John Linson', null, 'Luke Grimes, Kelly Reilly, Wes Bentley, Cole Hauser, Kelsey Asbille, Brecken Merrill, Ryan Bingham, Finn Little', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the violent world of the Dutton family, who controls the largest contiguous ranch in the United States. Led by their patriarch John Dutton, the family defends their property against constant attack by land developers, an Indian reservation, and America’s first National Park.', 'Follow the violent world of the Dutton family, who controls the largest contiguous ranch in the United States. Led by their patriarch John Dutton, the family defends their property against constant attack by land developers, an Indian reservation, and America’s first National Park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOYfRZ0NpUK5hG2CB2dJFnYJlGe.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:73586'),
  ('889011057556010401', 'Yellowstone (2018)', 2018, 'Drama, Western', null, null, 'Luke Grimes, Kelly Reilly, Wes Bentley', 'TV-MA', 'Follow the violent world of the Dutton family, who controls the largest contiguous ranch in the United States. Led by their patriarch John Dutton, the family defends their property against constant attack by land developers, an Indian reservation, and America’s first National Park.', 'Follow the violent world of the Dutton family, who controls the largest contiguous ranch in the United States. Led by their patriarch John Dutton, the family defends their property against constant attack by land developers, an Indian reservation, and America’s first National Park.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvOYfRZ0NpUK5hG2CB2dJFnYJlGe.jpg', 5, 'plex:tv:yellowstone-2018'),
  ('644868113273793157', 'Yellowstone: One-Fifty', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Kevin Costner', 'TV-14', 'On the 150th anniversary of its founding, Kevin Costner explores Yellowstone National Park to find out if it''s still as wild and untouched as it was on the day of its birth, and looks back at the events that led to its preservation.', 'On the 150th anniversary of its founding, Kevin Costner explores Yellowstone National Park to find out if it''s still as wild and untouched as it was on the day of its birth, and looks back at the events that led to its preservation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7POgNg96ss5BRVgbxCk8QxqrX36.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:214951'),
  ('195963060498313214', 'Yeni Hayat', 2020, 'Drama', null, 'Deniz Büyükkırlı, Serdar Soydan, Elif Usman', 'Serkan Çayoğlu, Melisa Aslı Pamuk, Tayanç Ayaydın, Nilperi Şahinkaya, Nisa Sofiya Aksongur, Aziz Caner İnan, Furkan Kalabalık, İpek Filiz Yazıcı', null, 'Everything starts with a job opportunity presented to Captain Adem, who left the Special Forces. The doors of a new life have opened for the happy nuclear family that Adem created with his wife Nevin and their little daughter Ece. All Adem has to do is to protect Yasemin, the young wife of Timur, a rich and powerful businessman. For Adem, a former maroon beret, this job is almost child''s play after all the dangerous operations he has participated in. Nevin is happy that they will finally be at peace. When Adem accepts the job offer, he and his family step into a completely different world to which they are unfamiliar.', 'Everything starts with a job opportunity presented to Captain Adem, who left the Special Forces. The doors of a new life have opened for the happy nuclear family that Adem created with his wife Nevin and their little daughter Ece. All Adem has to do is to protect Yasemin, the young wife of Timur, a rich and powerful businessman. For Adem, a former maroon beret, this job is almost child''s play after all the dangerous operations he has participated in. Nevin is happy that they will finally be at peace. When Adem accepts the job offer, he and his family step into a completely different world to which they are unfamiliar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6b9vjHEXGWQkYIqR6PALpKmya9n.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:50532'),
  ('150984947397670140', 'Yeralash', 1974, 'Kids, Comedy', 'Boris Grachevskiy', null, null, null, 'The children''s humorous film magazine "Yeralash" is a one-of-a-kind work of cinematography that ironically approaches the solution of everyday problems, focusing on the views and needs of modern society, allowing different generations to achieve mutual understanding.', 'The children''s humorous film magazine "Yeralash" is a one-of-a-kind work of cinematography that ironically approaches the solution of everyday problems, focusing on the views and needs of modern society, allowing different generations to achieve mutual understanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDmlDQuIw0OfSUMbfJjiIOadCjT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62967'),
  ('901306765227827471', 'Yes Minister', 1980, 'Comedy, War & Politics', 'Jonathan Lynn, Antony Jay', null, 'Paul Eddington, Nigel Hawthorne, Derek Fowlds', 'TV-PG', 'Satirical sitcom set in the office of a UK Cabinet minister, Jim Hacker MP, who struggles with Civil Service bureaucracy and political machinations as he tries to get on with government business.', 'Satirical sitcom set in the office of a UK Cabinet minister, Jim Hacker MP, who struggles with Civil Service bureaucracy and political machinations as he tries to get on with government business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tFCZsypLY6UuRVEZVUeKqJsJAZ.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:4549'),
  ('380852373094172236', 'Yes, Dear', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Greg Garcia, Alan Kirschenbaum', null, 'Anthony Clark, Jean Louisa Kelly, Mike O''Malley, Liza Snyder', 'TV-PG', 'A comedy about two young couples and their outrageously contrasting views on parenting. Greg and Kim Warner struggle on a daily basis to become perfect at the job. Kim is a neurotic, stay-at-home mother, and although her husband, Greg, is a success in his career, his more difficult job is keeping his wife calm as they raise their two young children. While Kim is determined to be the perfect mother and perfect wife and to raise the perfect children, her sister, Christine Hughes, a very down-to-earth mother of two, continually reminds her that life will never be perfect. Christine''s husband, Jimmy, often feels compelled to share with his brother-in-law his philosophy about being a husband and a parent while still remaining a man.', 'A comedy about two young couples and their outrageously contrasting views on parenting. Greg and Kim Warner struggle on a daily basis to become perfect at the job. Kim is a neurotic, stay-at-home mother, and although her husband, Greg, is a success in his career, his more difficult job is keeping his wife calm as they raise their two young children. While Kim is determined to be the perfect mother and perfect wife and to raise the perfect children, her sister, Christine Hughes, a very down-to-earth mother of two, continually reminds her that life will never be perfect. Christine''s husband, Jimmy, often feels compelled to share with his brother-in-law his philosophy about being a husband and a parent while still remaining a man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEcwkwonvM9OSnfYFtOmhRFHuoZ.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:4599'),
  ('430368895122315381', 'Yes, I Do', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Shaogang Zhang, Crystal Huang Yi, Selina Jen Chia-hsüan, Liu Xiening, Liu Yu, Song Meina', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDJcQL4KpY50OZrqQjP5L7tHKo6.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:124265'),
  ('968482777287087140', 'Yes, Prime Minister', 1986, 'Comedy, War & Politics', 'Antony Jay, Jonathan Lynn', null, 'Paul Eddington, Nigel Hawthorne, Derek Fowlds', null, 'James Hacker MP the Government''s bumbling minister for Administrative Affairs is propelled along the corridors of power to the very pinnacle of politics - No. 10. Could this have possibly have been managed by his trusted Permanent Private Secretary, the formidably political Sir Humphrey Appleby who must move to the “Top Job” in Downing Street to support him, together with his much put upon PPS Bernard Wolley. What could possibly go wrong?', 'James Hacker MP the Government''s bumbling minister for Administrative Affairs is propelled along the corridors of power to the very pinnacle of politics - No. 10. Could this have possibly have been managed by his trusted Permanent Private Secretary, the formidably political Sir Humphrey Appleby who must move to the “Top Job” in Downing Street to support him, together with his much put upon PPS Bernard Wolley. What could possibly go wrong?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n0QRcx4P9ZJFGnTBbNt359MvUh0.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:12597'),
