  ('978367642122313780', 'Young Lady and Gentleman', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', null, 'Kim Sa-gyeong', 'Ji Hyun-woo, Lee Se-hee, Park Ha-na, Kang Eun-tak, Lee Jong-won, Oh Hyun-kyung, An Woo-yeon, Yoon Jin-yi', null, 'Lee Young Kook is a widower with three children. He still hasn’t gotten over the death of his wife. He decides to hire Park Dan Dan as a live-in tutor for his kids and he becomes attracted to her. Meanwhile, Park Dan Dan has bright and positive personality despite her harsh situation.', 'Lee Young Kook is a widower with three children. He still hasn’t gotten over the death of his wife. He decides to hire Park Dan Dan as a live-in tutor for his kids and he becomes attracted to her. Meanwhile, Park Dan Dan has bright and positive personality despite her harsh situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyahc0o4Xfbw0pZdz5QiqXxDRNH.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:129473'),
  ('665743628615195985', 'Young Love', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Matthew A. Cherry', 'Kelsey Barry', 'Kid Cudi, Issa Rae, Loretta Devine, Harry Lennix, Tamar Braxton, Brooke Monroe Conaway', 'TV-PG', 'The Young family – millennial parents Stephen and Angela, their daughter Zuri and her pet cat Rocky – juggle careers, marriage, parenthood, social issues and multi-generational dynamics while striving to make a better life for themselves.', 'The Young family – millennial parents Stephen and Angela, their daughter Zuri and her pet cat Rocky – juggle careers, marriage, parenthood, social issues and multi-generational dynamics while striving to make a better life for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gC3oBr8es4hFr6zwvXIMMBFi5c2.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:217272'),
  ('476751958191287291', 'Young Millionaires', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Igor Gotesman, Olivia Barlier, Tania Gotesman', null, 'Abraham Wapler, Malou Khebizi, Calixte Broisin-Doutaz, Sara Gançarski, Jeanne Boudier, Florian Lesieur, Victor Bonnel, Margot Heckmann', 'TV-MA', 'After four Marseille teens win €17 million, dreams of yachts, freedom and fast cash take off — but money brings chaos they never bargained for.', 'After four Marseille teens win €17 million, dreams of yachts, freedom and fast cash take off — but money brings chaos they never bargained for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGTmK9RSbubzZmQnRFGfvtLXDGM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:272467'),
  ('497017495853280482', 'Young Rock', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Nahnatchka Khan, Jeff Chiang', null, 'Dwayne Johnson, Joseph Lee Anderson, Stacey Leilua, Ana Tuisila, Adrian Groulx, Bradley Constant, Uli Latukefu, Fasitua Amosa', 'TV-14', 'As Dwayne Johnson runs for president in 2032, he takes a comedic look back at his extraordinary life through the outrageous stories of his family and youth that shaped him into the man he is today. He explores his childhood years living amid influential wrestling icons while his dad rose to fame in the business, his rebellious teenage years attending high school in Pennsylvania, and his football years teamed up with powerhouse players at the University of Miami. In his telling, Johnson explains that while his experiences have been larger than life, he remains a down-to-earth guy who still relates to the American people.', 'As Dwayne Johnson runs for president in 2032, he takes a comedic look back at his extraordinary life through the outrageous stories of his family and youth that shaped him into the man he is today. He explores his childhood years living amid influential wrestling icons while his dad rose to fame in the business, his rebellious teenage years attending high school in Pennsylvania, and his football years teamed up with powerhouse players at the University of Miami. In his telling, Johnson explains that while his experiences have been larger than life, he remains a down-to-earth guy who still relates to the American people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y7ta5bQKCPR0c4mKfFoGxFOejp.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:97754'),
  ('410344232435076323', 'Young Royals', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lisa Ambjörn, Lars Beckung, Camilla Holter', null, 'Edvin Ryding, Omar Rudberg, Malte Gårdinger, Frida Argento, Nikita Uggla', 'TV-MA', 'Prince Wilhelm adjusts to life at his prestigious new boarding school, Hillerska, but following his heart proves more challenging than anticipated.', 'Prince Wilhelm adjusts to life at his prestigious new boarding school, Hillerska, but following his heart proves more challenging than anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuA5iFDdNTBrEqmnW2cWTHUr8sI.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:125910'),
  ('411821724600632441', 'Young Samson & Goliath', 1967, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Family', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Tim Matheson, Mel Blanc, John Stephenson', null, 'Samson & Goliath is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions for NBC, where it debuted on September 9, 1967. Primarily sponsored by General Mills, who controlled the distribution rights through its agency Dancer Fitzgerald Sample, Samson & Goliath was retitled Young Samson in April 1968 to avoid confusion with the stop-motion Christian television series Davey and Goliath. Twenty-six 12-minute episodes of the series were produced; Samson & Goliath cartoons were paired with other General Mills-sponsored shows such as Tennessee Tuxedo and Go Go Gophers to form a full half-hour for their original network broadcasts.Young Samson was later shown in syndication with The Space Kidettes as The Space Kidettes and Young Samson, distributed by The Program Exchange.', 'Samson & Goliath is an animated television series produced by Hanna-Barbera Productions for NBC, where it debuted on September 9, 1967. Primarily sponsored by General Mills, who controlled the distribution rights through its agency Dancer Fitzgerald Sample, Samson & Goliath was retitled Young Samson in April 1968 to avoid confusion with the stop-motion Christian television series Davey and Goliath. Twenty-six 12-minute episodes of the series were produced; Samson & Goliath cartoons were paired with other General Mills-sponsored shows such as Tennessee Tuxedo and Go Go Gophers to form a full half-hour for their original network broadcasts.Young Samson was later shown in syndication with The Space Kidettes as The Space Kidettes and Young Samson, distributed by The Program Exchange.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slmFlBOUEC4enGOqCqyss39WBa4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11083'),
  ('292826892783608336', 'Young Sheldon', 2017, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Steven Molaro, Chuck Lorre', null, 'Iain Armitage, Zoe Perry, Lance Barber, Montana Jordan, Raegan Revord, Annie Potts, Emily Osment, Jim Parsons', 'TV-PG', 'The early life of child genius Sheldon Cooper, later seen in The Big Bang Theory.', 'The early life of child genius Sheldon Cooper, later seen in The Big Bang Theory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kidkbZRBGbsEIrX7pODRSKi9ipl.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:71728'),
  ('31369993142495173', 'Young Sherlock', 2026, 'Action & Adventure, Mystery', 'Matthew Parkhill', 'KT Roberts, Francesca Lin', 'Hero Fiennes Tiffin, Dónal Finn, Zine Tseng, Natascha McElhone, Max Irons', null, 'Sherlock Holmes is a disgraced young man, raw and unfiltered, when he finds himself wrapped up in a murder case that threatens his liberty. His first ever case unravels a globe-trotting conspiracy that changes his life forever.', 'Sherlock Holmes is a disgraced young man, raw and unfiltered, when he finds himself wrapped up in a murder case that threatens his liberty. His first ever case unravels a globe-trotting conspiracy that changes his life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3s0Cd2JppeWA4UjTuSRauL52P7.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:255661'),
  ('1022237282584017623', 'Young Wallander', 2020, 'Drama, Mystery, Crime', 'Benjamin Harris', null, 'Adam Pålsson', 'TV-MA', 'An incendiary hate crime stirs civil unrest, fast-tracking rookie cop Kurt Wallander to detective in this origin story for the popular character.', 'An incendiary hate crime stirs civil unrest, fast-tracking rookie cop Kurt Wallander to detective in this origin story for the popular character.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UhkwuaDFDarOO1GffY6XX6ZilP.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:91545'),
  ('816784337233046553', 'Young Wong Fei Hung', 1981, 'Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Tony Wong, Candy Man, Newton Lai Hon-Chi, Bonnie Ngai Chau-Wah, Olivia Cheng Man-Nga, Mak Tin-Yan, Lau Kong, Cheng Lui', null, 'In order to eradicate the revolutionary chaotic party, Yuan Shikai sent people to design the murder of Huang Qiying and his wife, and his son Huang Feihong was falsely accused and imprisoned. Brother Bu Qingyun betrayed Shikai and was assassinated, and Fei Hong vowed to fight wits and strength with Shikai and others in order to help Qingyun avenge and fulfill his last wish.', 'In order to eradicate the revolutionary chaotic party, Yuan Shikai sent people to design the murder of Huang Qiying and his wife, and his son Huang Feihong was falsely accused and imprisoned. Brother Bu Qingyun betrayed Shikai and was assassinated, and Fei Hong vowed to fight wits and strength with Shikai and others in order to help Qingyun avenge and fulfill his last wish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQODCtKV9C55qpHlEVMXrkdDLGP.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:108020'),
  ('272583393277699645', 'Young, Famous & African', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Nadia Nakai, Diamond Platnumz, Andile Ncube, Swanky Jerry, Khanyi Mbau, Annie Macaulay-Idibia', 'TV-MA', 'This reality series follows a crew of famed, affluent stars as they work and play, flirt and feud in Johannesburg, South Africa.', 'This reality series follows a crew of famed, affluent stars as they work and play, flirt and feud in Johannesburg, South Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10ByS22axqyK9NatfBgTsDA7JAv.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:157717'),
