  ('499965153561320128', 'Younger', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Darren Star', null, 'Sutton Foster, Hilary Duff, Debi Mazar, Nico Tortorella, Molly Bernard, Peter Hermann', 'TV-14', 'Liza Miller, a suddenly single stay-at-home mother, tries to get back into the working world, only to find it’s nearly impossible to start at the bottom at 40-year old. When a chance encounter convinces her she looks younger than she is, Liza tries to pass herself off as 26 and lands a job as an assistant at Empirical Press. Now she just has to make sure no one finds out the secret only she and her best friend Maggie share.', 'Liza Miller, a suddenly single stay-at-home mother, tries to get back into the working world, only to find it’s nearly impossible to start at the bottom at 40-year old. When a chance encounter convinces her she looks younger than she is, Liza tries to pass herself off as 26 and lands a job as an assistant at Empirical Press. Now she just has to make sure no one finds out the secret only she and her best friend Maggie share.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feWw6i09zaX2apzRqd7QbKEAsx9.jpg', 7, 'tmdb:tv:62117'),
  ('615295448213236667', 'Your Face Sounds Familiar', 2015, 'Reality', null, null, 'Vhong Navarro, Sharon Cuneta, Gary Valenciano, Jhong Hilario, Ogie Alcasid, Klarisse de Guzman, Nyoy Volante, Akira Morishita', null, 'a Philippine television reality competition show broadcast by ABS-CBN and Kapamilya Channel. Based on the Spanish television series Your Face Sounds Familiar.', 'a Philippine television reality competition show broadcast by ABS-CBN and Kapamilya Channel. Based on the Spanish television series Your Face Sounds Familiar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sB9FL9dElZJUMoOF8RXjWhppv04.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:301949'),
  ('149653747007994129', 'Your Face Sounds Familiar Croatia', 2014, null, null, null, null, null, 'A show in which a person from public life will show his singing, dancing and impersonation skills and which will introduce us to a musical time machine where we will touch the brightest musical moments.', 'A show in which a person from public life will show his singing, dancing and impersonation skills and which will introduce us to a musical time machine where we will touch the brightest musical moments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbqTEKaxAvvDNY8CMScix0qIhBi.jpg', 10, 'tmdb:tv:285160'),
  ('822924582079356246', 'Your Family or Mine', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Jamie Tarses', 'Greg Malins', 'Kyle Howard, Kat Foster, Richard Dreyfuss, JoBeth Williams, Ed Begley Jr., Collette Wolfe, Cynthia Stevenson, Danny Comden', 'TV-MA', 'Oliver and Kelli are living proof of the old saying, "When you marry someone, you don''t just marry them, you marry their whole family."', 'Oliver and Kelli are living proof of the old saying, "When you marry someone, you don''t just marry them, you marry their whole family."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnwz5MnXHXcHcNLS5QDRlgN4p7Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:62214'),
  ('438869541211314021', 'Your Forma', 2025, 'Animation, Mystery, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kana Hanazawa, Kensho Ono, Nao Toyama, Aya Endo, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Ayaka Nanase, Chiwa Saito, Yuu Hayashi', null, 'In 1992, a viral encephalitis pandemic led to the creation of "Your Forma," an invasive brain-implanted device that records all sensory data. Special detectives called "Cyber Investigators" dive into this data to solve crimes. Prodigy Echika Hieda, isolated by her talent, is paired with Harold, a humanoid "Amicus." Together, they uncover the world''s deepest secrets.', 'In 1992, a viral encephalitis pandemic led to the creation of "Your Forma," an invasive brain-implanted device that records all sensory data. Special detectives called "Cyber Investigators" dive into this data to solve crimes. Prodigy Echika Hieda, isolated by her talent, is paired with Harold, a humanoid "Amicus." Together, they uncover the world''s deepest secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0NFMpqPuon5iJRaNtalYBcyMJo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:279731'),
  ('598430117690998299', 'Your Friendly Neighborhood Spider-Man', 2025, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, 'Raven Kone', 'Hudson Thames, Colman Domingo, Eugene Byrd, Grace Song, Zeno Robinson, Kari Wahlgren', 'TV-PG', 'Peter Parker is on his way to becoming a hero, but his path to get there is anything but ordinary.', 'Peter Parker is on his way to becoming a hero, but his path to get there is anything but ordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjcsNeqF52YUQ2rUBGLMHwLkxvR.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:138503'),
  ('938238204474648624', 'Your Friends & Neighbors', 2025, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jonathan Tropper', 'Cara Pomanti', 'Jon Hamm, Amanda Peet, Olivia Munn, Hoon Lee, Mark Tallman, Lena Hall, Aimee Carrero, Eunice Bae', 'TV-MA', 'When a financial titan suddenly finds himself divorced and jobless, he starts robbing his wealthy neighbors to stay afloat. Stealing from his own social circle strangely exhilarates him—but he gradually gets tangled in a deadly web.', 'When a financial titan suddenly finds himself divorced and jobless, he starts robbing his wealthy neighbors to stay afloat. Stealing from his own social circle strangely exhilarates him—but he gradually gets tangled in a deadly web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lcp63INKEsVHUly9eayx7gEEOcG.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:241609'),
  ('468659117936021601', 'Your Home Is My Business', 2016, 'Drama', null, 'Shizuka Oishi', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Shota Matsuda, Asuka Kudo, Toru Nakamura, Ayako Imoto, Yudai Chiba, Zen Kajihara, Asami Usuda', null, 'She''s single, beautiful and wears clothes that are a bit flashy, but she never smiles in front of her clients. Machi is a real-estate saleswoman who is known for closing the deal no matter who the client is--100% of the time. "There isn''t a house I can''t sell." She sticks her nose in the private issues of her clients and uses a vast range of tactics to help solve their problems... and sells the house while she''s at it! "The kind of home you live in becomes a true reflection of your life." Because the home itself can sometimes even change your life, Machi will pour her heart and soul into finding the right home for you. "Being a real estate agent means having your clients surrender their life to you."', 'She''s single, beautiful and wears clothes that are a bit flashy, but she never smiles in front of her clients. Machi is a real-estate saleswoman who is known for closing the deal no matter who the client is--100% of the time. "There isn''t a house I can''t sell." She sticks her nose in the private issues of her clients and uses a vast range of tactics to help solve their problems... and sells the house while she''s at it! "The kind of home you live in becomes a true reflection of your life." Because the home itself can sometimes even change your life, Machi will pour her heart and soul into finding the right home for you. "Being a real estate agent means having your clients surrender their life to you."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTB0SjDdK2Sd4wzibr2IXweJplj.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:71955'),
  ('50259651155116007', 'Your Honor', 2018, 'Drama', 'Chun Sung-il, Lee Ok-gyu', 'Chun Sung-il', 'Yoon Shi-yoon, Lee You-young, Park Byung-eun, Kwon Na-ra, Kim Hye-ok, Kwak Sun-young, Sung Dong-il, Heo Sung-tae', null, 'Han Soo-Ho and Han Kang-Ho were born as identical twins, but they live totally different lives. Han Soo-Ho works as a judge and he is guided by principles. Han Kang-Ho''s extensive criminal record contains 5 different arrests. One day, Han Soo-Ho suddenly disappears. Han Kang-Ho secretly takes his brother''s place as a judge. Han Kang-Ho, who was once considered trash, becomes "Dear Judge" and highly respected.', 'Han Soo-Ho and Han Kang-Ho were born as identical twins, but they live totally different lives. Han Soo-Ho works as a judge and he is guided by principles. Han Kang-Ho''s extensive criminal record contains 5 different arrests. One day, Han Soo-Ho suddenly disappears. Han Kang-Ho secretly takes his brother''s place as a judge. Han Kang-Ho, who was once considered trash, becomes "Dear Judge" and highly respected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYcz1334alOCTzIB9zJAFLCoSeT.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80959'),
  ('1006396001159559544', 'Your Honor', 2020, 'Drama, Crime', 'Peter Moffat', null, 'Bryan Cranston, Hope Davis, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Michael Stuhlbarg, Lilli Kay, Jimi Stanton, Benjamin Flores Jr., Keith Machekanyanga', 'TV-MA', 'New Orleans judge Michael Desiato is forced to confront his own deepest convictions when his son is involved in a hit and run that embroils an organized crime family.', 'New Orleans judge Michael Desiato is forced to confront his own deepest convictions when his son is involved in a hit and run that embroils an organized crime family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rWWgTEDFdV330aLgCoaq7I56lk.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:86430'),
  ('724197295318356098', 'Your Honor', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'Ekaterina Mavromatis', 'Oleg Menshikov, Aleksey Serebryakov, Vladislav Miller, Olga Tumaykina, Darya Ursulyak, Daniil Vorobyov, Rostislav Bershauer', null, 'Mikhail Romanov is a judge in the Primorsky city District court. Romanov is famous for his integrity and integrity: law and justice are above all for him. One day he finds out that his son Anton is in trouble. He took a car without asking and hit a motorcyclist on it, after which he fled the scene of the crime.', 'Mikhail Romanov is a judge in the Primorsky city District court. Romanov is famous for his integrity and integrity: law and justice are above all for him. One day he finds out that his son Anton is in trouble. He took a car without asking and hit a motorcyclist on it, after which he fled the scene of the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rN05Db7yRQRF8njxNcAP3pmlhCp.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:152299'),
  ('676374864977233622', 'Your Honor', 2022, 'Drama, Crime', null, 'David Nawrath, David Möhring', 'Sebastian Koch, Taddeo Kufus, Paula Beer, Tobias Moretti, Ursula Strauss, Sascha Alexander Geršak, Lena Kalisch, Rainer Bock', null, 'An incorruptible judge has spent his career fighting organized crime. However, the tables are turned when his son is guilty of a hit-and-run case.', 'An incorruptible judge has spent his career fighting organized crime. However, the tables are turned when his son is guilty of a hit-and-run case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6lGC0n0HVD69vy4AC4Erqp4l3Z.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158366'),
  ('612446078013075757', 'Your House Helper', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Ha Seok-jin, Bona, Go Won-hee, Seo Eun-ah, Lee Ji-hoon, Jeon Soo-jin, Lee Do-gyeom, Yun Ju-sang', null, 'Kim Ji-Woon was born to a lawmaker father and doctor mother. He then went on to work at a big company, but he quit his job and stopped talking to his parents. Kim Ji-Woon meets a woman and begins to work as a housekeeper at her home. While doing his job, he listens to his customer''s worries and gives advice to help them solve their problems.', 'Kim Ji-Woon was born to a lawmaker father and doctor mother. He then went on to work at a big company, but he quit his job and stopped talking to his parents. Kim Ji-Woon meets a woman and begins to work as a housekeeper at her home. While doing his job, he listens to his customer''s worries and gives advice to help them solve their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ApG8vyN24Z36wIPx3RSTlLOzCZ8.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80389'),
  ('552312306529116515', 'Your Lie in April', 2014, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Natsuki Hanae, Risa Taneda, Ayane Sakura, Ryota Osaka', 'TV-PG', 'Kousei Arima was a genius pianist until his mother''s sudden death took away his ability to play. Each day was dull for Kousei. But, then he meets a violinist named Kaori Miyazono who has an eccentric playing style. Can the heartfelt sounds of the girl''s violin lead the boy to play the piano again?', 'Kousei Arima was a genius pianist until his mother''s sudden death took away his ability to play. Each day was dull for Kousei. But, then he meets a violinist named Kaori Miyazono who has an eccentric playing style. Can the heartfelt sounds of the girl''s violin lead the boy to play the piano again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rRjfH3ckTYz8z8aSkJshFL4VyK9.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61663'),
  ('646420545492165006', 'Your Love Is My Fortune', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Juan Carlos Alcalá', null, 'Daniela Martínez Caballero, Denia Agalianou, Susana González, David Zepeda, Sergio Sendel, Chantal Andere, Michelle Vieth, Carlos de la Mota', 'TV-PG', 'My fortune is loving you tells the story of Natalia and Chente, who both suffer different situations that change their lives instantly. Natalia comes from a high social position; however, she loses everything when Adrián, her husband, leaves her for what was "her best friend" after 20 years of marriage, in addition, he leaves her on the street and penniless. Vicente, from a different socioeconomic class than Natalia, falls into the hands of a financial fraud that also leaves him in a very difficult economic situation, adding the recent loss of Lucía, his wife, at the hands of a bank robbery in which she was. For Natalia and Chente, they have no choice but to live under the same roof, with which, upon meeting the relationship, they will go through a lot of ups and downs of emotions when they try to resolve their personal situations.', 'My fortune is loving you tells the story of Natalia and Chente, who both suffer different situations that change their lives instantly. Natalia comes from a high social position; however, she loses everything when Adrián, her husband, leaves her for what was "her best friend" after 20 years of marriage, in addition, he leaves her on the street and penniless. Vicente, from a different socioeconomic class than Natalia, falls into the hands of a financial fraud that also leaves him in a very difficult economic situation, adding the recent loss of Lucía, his wife, at the hands of a bank robbery in which she was. For Natalia and Chente, they have no choice but to live under the same roof, with which, upon meeting the relationship, they will go through a lot of ups and downs of emotions when they try to resolve their personal situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGmfvNIsP8bWJ6CO3xruuXwcJc1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:137671'),
  ('1011884949980024205', 'Your Pretty Face Is Going to Hell', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Casper Kelly, Dave Willis', null, 'Craig Rowin, Eddie Pepitone, Henry Zebrowski, Dana Snyder, Matt Servitto', 'TV-MA', 'A live-action workplace comedy about Gary, an associate demon, as he attempts to capture souls on earth in order to climb the corporate ladder of the underworld. Gary hopes to advance in Hell, but he may be too stupid, lazy and kind-hearted to realize his dreams of promotion. Meanwhile, Gary''s intern Claude is more talented, more devious and will do whatever it takes to impress Satan.', 'A live-action workplace comedy about Gary, an associate demon, as he attempts to capture souls on earth in order to climb the corporate ladder of the underworld. Gary hopes to advance in Hell, but he may be too stupid, lazy and kind-hearted to realize his dreams of promotion. Meanwhile, Gary''s intern Claude is more talented, more devious and will do whatever it takes to impress Satan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NHMwsnDCRf9ML9WJnAcg9oJPOP.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:48000'),
  ('638926556465969696', 'Your Sky', 2024, 'Drama', '25.15.66', null, 'Kongpob Jirojmontri, Teetut Chungmanirat, Suppakarn Jirachotikul, Thanaphum Sestasittikul, Worapong Walor, Jirachart Buspavanich, Inthira Sae-sieo, Morakot Liu', null, 'Due to an unforeseen situation, a naive freshman and the campus’s popular senior agree to pretend to be a couple — but their fake deal begins to affect their real feelings.', 'Due to an unforeseen situation, a naive freshman and the campus’s popular senior agree to pretend to be a couple — but their fake deal begins to affect their real feelings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g581Ja76fFNjj3GcB94fCLw3NHY.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:254483'),
  ('290559069788998362', 'Your Song', 2026, 'Reality', null, null, 'Alison Hammond, Paloma Faith, Sam Ryder', null, 'Everyday people, who, driven by their love and connection to a particular song, will step up to the stage and share their story with the world. Whether their track helped them through heartbreak, became their anthem of triumph, or reminds them who they are, Your Song is exactly that…. Your’s.', 'Everyday people, who, driven by their love and connection to a particular song, will step up to the stage and share their story with the world. Whether their track helped them through heartbreak, became their anthem of triumph, or reminds them who they are, Your Song is exactly that…. Your’s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpNRtR0JclDMTKTWXr3vK4atnia.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318334'),
  ('842772552122991748', 'Your Turn to Kill', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', null, 'Mitsunori Fukuhara, Yasushi Akimoto, Minato Takano', 'Tomoyo Harada, Kei Tanaka, Nanase Nishino, Tae Kimura, Katsuhisa Namase, Naoto Takenaka, Maho Yamada, Nao', null, 'Nana and Shota are a newlywed couple and Nana is 15 years older than Shota. Nana works as a designer and Shota works as a gym trainer. They both enjoy mystery. The newlywed couple then move to an apartment and they attend a resident’s meeting there. Nana and Shota become involved in murder cases that take place at the apartment. Residents get murdered one by one. Some residents have a motive, but those suspects have an alibi. Because of this, an arrest has yet to be made.', 'Nana and Shota are a newlywed couple and Nana is 15 years older than Shota. Nana works as a designer and Shota works as a gym trainer. They both enjoy mystery. The newlywed couple then move to an apartment and they attend a resident’s meeting there. Nana and Shota become involved in murder cases that take place at the apartment. Residents get murdered one by one. Some residents have a motive, but those suspects have an alibi. Because of this, an arrest has yet to be made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hRa6cUpsn30EJqL7qp8DvW6Fke.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:88570'),
  ('239293695342975105', 'Your Worst Nightmare', 2014, 'Crime, Documentary', null, null, 'D.C. Goode', 'TV-14', 'Spine-tingling crimes that take viewers on a ride of twists and turns, complete with jump-out-of-their-seats moments and chilling conclusions. This show uses classic suspense film techniques to follow some of the creepiest, most harrowing crimes ever committed, as these victims'' darkest dreams become unfathomable realities.', 'Spine-tingling crimes that take viewers on a ride of twists and turns, complete with jump-out-of-their-seats moments and chilling conclusions. This show uses classic suspense film techniques to follow some of the creepiest, most harrowing crimes ever committed, as these victims'' darkest dreams become unfathomable realities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xnEorrKQJBZffLtfo6fM4uH2Yr3.jpg', 6, 'tmdb:tv:65067'),
  ('660114519422125468', 'Yous & Yay in the Wild', 2024, null, 'Sef, Pepijn Lanen', null, 'Sef, Pepijn Lanen', null, 'Yous and Yay receive guests they admire and explore their inspiration and motivations in personal conversations. Yous and Yay delve deeper into the fascinations of their conversation partners via rabbit holes. These take the viewer to the history of the Wuppies, the French cult film ‘La Haine’, street poetry in Rotterdam, the video clips of Missy Elliott and the cultural heritage of the song ‘You’ll never walk alone’. Each and every one of them is a side path that surprises, amazes, provides context or inspires. Yous and Yay, the two homo universales of the Dutch cultural scene, have been pioneering creators for years within and outside their own range of disciplines (music, literature, film, graphic design). Yous & Yay in the wild abandons the idea of ​​what a cultural programme should be and navigates right through all genres, disciplines and other cultural pigeonholes.', 'Yous and Yay receive guests they admire and explore their inspiration and motivations in personal conversations. Yous and Yay delve deeper into the fascinations of their conversation partners via rabbit holes. These take the viewer to the history of the Wuppies, the French cult film ‘La Haine’, street poetry in Rotterdam, the video clips of Missy Elliott and the cultural heritage of the song ‘You’ll never walk alone’. Each and every one of them is a side path that surprises, amazes, provides context or inspires. Yous and Yay, the two homo universales of the Dutch cultural scene, have been pioneering creators for years within and outside their own range of disciplines (music, literature, film, graphic design). Yous & Yay in the wild abandons the idea of ​​what a cultural programme should be and navigates right through all genres, disciplines and other cultural pigeonholes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IUSBxlvyG5Sgj7vRIFgiP9Ppoi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:278771'),
  ('587655571782126183', 'Youth in the Flames of War', 2023, 'Drama, War & Politics', null, 'Zhang Chanjuan', 'Dylan Wang, Zhou Ye, Ye Zuxin, Hu Lianxin, He Peng, Wang Renjun, Xia Meng, Wang Yuzheng', null, 'A group of brave youth who are not afraid of bullets, guns, and hardships. The students stay firm in their beliefs to save their country.', 'A group of brave youth who are not afraid of bullets, guns, and hardships. The students stay firm in their beliefs to save their country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGjZHI6zNWMxgXb0B1oCeoRqWQY.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:225102'),
  ('468345742940667155', 'Youth of May', 2021, 'Drama', 'Lee Kang, Song Min-yeop', null, 'Lee Do-hyun, Go Min-si, Lee Sang-yi, Keum Sae-rok, Oh Man-seok, Kim Won-hae, Uhm Hyo-seop, Hwang Young-hee', null, 'A budding love story between a medical student and a nurse takes place in May 1980, during a time of civil unrest and military oppression in Gwangju.', 'A budding love story between a medical student and a nurse takes place in May 1980, during a time of civil unrest and military oppression in Gwangju.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xf1JGvmWM1H5XoK8DvxXRAKjRkr.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:119466'),
  ('48460417073981824', 'Youth Periplous', 2019, 'Reality, Comedy', null, null, 'Yang Di, The8, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Henry Lau, Lars Huang', null, '"Youth Periplous" is a cultural tourism exploration variety introduced by Zhejiang Satellite TV. The program is based on the theme of travel and travel with guests, focusing on the theme of “the city is proud of people”, and tells the history and humanities of different cities, highlighting the long history and profoundness of Chinese culture.', '"Youth Periplous" is a cultural tourism exploration variety introduced by Zhejiang Satellite TV. The program is based on the theme of travel and travel with guests, focusing on the theme of “the city is proud of people”, and tells the history and humanities of different cities, highlighting the long history and profoundness of Chinese culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aryrFzgfYb6x6Y1IN8hNSnow0WH.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:106938'),
  ('283733059650111483', 'YOUTH WITH YOU', 2019, 'Reality', null, null, 'Chris Lee Yuchun, Li Ronghao, LISA, Wilber Pan, Tommy Li, Kuma, Xuan Hao, Chen Jianyu', null, 'Youth With You is a 2019 Chinese male group survival show that premiered on January 21, 2019 on iQIYI. It is presented by Lay Zhang, with Li Ronghao, Jolin Tsai, MC Jin, The8 (Xu Minghao), and After Journey serving as the coaches. The show brought together 100 trainees from different entertainment agencies, and only nine of all trainees were selected to debut through viewers'' votes. On April 6, 2019, the final nine contestants debuted as UNINE.', 'Youth With You is a 2019 Chinese male group survival show that premiered on January 21, 2019 on iQIYI. It is presented by Lay Zhang, with Li Ronghao, Jolin Tsai, MC Jin, The8 (Xu Minghao), and After Journey serving as the coaches. The show brought together 100 trainees from different entertainment agencies, and only nine of all trainees were selected to debut through viewers'' votes. On April 6, 2019, the final nine contestants debuted as UNINE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5Mco7vVtY2u4gi2YaH6VviVcwH.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:119848'),
  ('253646046320700980', 'Youthful Glory', 2025, 'Drama', 'Bu Zhi Shi Ke Cai', null, 'Song Weilong, Bao Shangen, Dai Luwa, Quan Yilun, Ke Ying, Qin Xiaoxuan, Bai Shu, Wang Ke', null, 'When General Jiang Xu returns to the capital after eight years to investigate military corruption, he enters a strategic marriage with a strong-willed noblewoman, Ming Tan. As they navigate political intrigue and work to protect their families, an unexpected romance gradually blossoms between them.', 'When General Jiang Xu returns to the capital after eight years to investigate military corruption, he enters a strategic marriage with a strong-willed noblewoman, Ming Tan. As they navigate political intrigue and work to protect their families, an unexpected romance gradually blossoms between them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnvUc7dlsvRj807HbmkReWYJ77t.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:262741'),
  ('941425744768392019', 'Yowamushi Pedal', 2013, 'Comedy, Animation, Drama', null, null, 'Daiki Yamashita, Kohsuke Toriumi, Hiroki Yasumoto, Kentaro Ito, Daisuke Kishio', 'TV-G', 'A timid, anime-loving teen gets drawn into a school cycling club, where his new friends help him face tough challenges to develop his racing talent.', 'A timid, anime-loving teen gets drawn into a school cycling club, where his new friends help him face tough challenges to develop his racing talent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/688PJsb1sVWgosrQCbwT32vJKfI.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61441'),
  ('393789782566164737', 'Yowayowa Sensei', 2026, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Marika Kouno, Kakeru Hatano', 'TV-MA', 'Hiyori Hiwamura is known as the "Scary Teacher," and if you offend her, she''ll put a curse on you! Or at least that''s what everyone believes. She''s secretly a total softy who''s deeply misunderstood, and once you see her sweet side, she''ll put a different kind of spell on you.', 'Hiyori Hiwamura is known as the "Scary Teacher," and if you offend her, she''ll put a curse on you! Or at least that''s what everyone believes. She''s secretly a total softy who''s deeply misunderstood, and once you see her sweet side, she''ll put a different kind of spell on you.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WDp9RjN7odYw490WLNw79iceLa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:284447'),
  ('816179322512090316', 'Yozakura Quartet', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Misato Fukuen, Daisuke Ono, Miyuki Sawashiro, Rie Tanaka, Yuki Kaji, Saki Fujita, Tomokazu Seki, Haruka Tomatsu', 'TV-14', 'In Sakurashin, humans and demons live side by side in peace. But when a series of strange events threatens the delicate balance of their town, it will be up to four superpowered teens to restore order and save the day!', 'In Sakurashin, humans and demons live side by side in peace. But when a series of strange events threatens the delicate balance of their town, it will be up to four superpowered teens to restore order and save the day!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42U33MsbJGhiaxh1pF3sgMG10UG.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:34696'),
  ('244207729411292807', 'Yozakura Quartet: Hana no Uta', 2013, 'Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Saki Fujita, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yuki Kaji, Daisuke Ono, Haruka Tomatsu, Misato Fukuen', 'TV-14', 'Hundreds of years ago, the borders between the worlds of humans and youkai temporarily overlapped, resulting in many residents of both crossing over to the other side. In the years since this event, the city of Sakurashin has become a central hub for all inter-dimensional affairs—a result of both the sacred Seven Pillars around the city serving as a beacon for the youkai, and the efforts of the Hiizumi Life Counseling Office in keeping the townsfolk happy. This office is composed of Hime Yarizakura, the young mayor of the city; satori Ao Nanami, who can read people''s minds; half-youkai Kotoha Isone, who can summon anything by speaking a word; oni siblings, Kyousuke and Touka Kishi; and the office director Akina Hiizumi, who inherited his family''s ability to force youkai back to their world.', 'Hundreds of years ago, the borders between the worlds of humans and youkai temporarily overlapped, resulting in many residents of both crossing over to the other side. In the years since this event, the city of Sakurashin has become a central hub for all inter-dimensional affairs—a result of both the sacred Seven Pillars around the city serving as a beacon for the youkai, and the efforts of the Hiizumi Life Counseling Office in keeping the townsfolk happy. This office is composed of Hime Yarizakura, the young mayor of the city; satori Ao Nanami, who can read people''s minds; half-youkai Kotoha Isone, who can summon anything by speaking a word; oni siblings, Kyousuke and Touka Kishi; and the office director Akina Hiizumi, who inherited his family''s ability to force youkai back to their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/enpxtKnaKOqHGTOcA1rO4lpPaCZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80500'),
  ('290502014174725409', 'Yu Hee, the Witch', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', null, null, 'Han Ga-in, Jae Hee, Kim Jeong-hoon, Dennis Oh, Jeon Hye-bin, Ahn Suk-hwan, Sung Dong-il, Byun Hee-bong', null, 'As the director of her father''s advertising company, Ma Yoo Hee is known as a witch for her ruthless, no nonsense character. After a string of failed attempts to hire a housekeeper, she (literally) runs into Chae Moo Ryong, ex-medical student turned aspiring chef. As a way to work off his debt for crashing into her car, he agrees to become her housekeeper and personal love affairs coach for one month. Gladly, he gives her a makeover that attracts both her old friend Johnny Kruger and her first love Joon Ha. Despite having a girlfriend, Sung Mi, Moo Ryong eventually finds himself falling for Yoo Hee.', 'As the director of her father''s advertising company, Ma Yoo Hee is known as a witch for her ruthless, no nonsense character. After a string of failed attempts to hire a housekeeper, she (literally) runs into Chae Moo Ryong, ex-medical student turned aspiring chef. As a way to work off his debt for crashing into her car, he agrees to become her housekeeper and personal love affairs coach for one month. Gladly, he gives her a makeover that attracts both her old friend Johnny Kruger and her first love Joon Ha. Despite having a girlfriend, Sung Mi, Moo Ryong eventually finds himself falling for Yoo Hee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUIM4mxL7EUe3m3Zo57OuOOVLEB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:14731'),
  ('570456812331275070', 'Yu Yu Hakusho', 1992, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, 'Yoshihiro Togashi', 'Nozomu Sasaki, Shigeru Chiba, Megumi Ogata, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Yuri Amano, Hisako Kyoda, Mayumi Tanaka, Ai Orikasa', 'TV-14', 'After dying to save a boy, delinquent tough guy Yusuke Urameshi is granted another chance at life by redeeming himself as a "Spirit Detective."', 'After dying to save a boy, delinquent tough guy Yusuke Urameshi is granted another chance at life by redeeming himself as a "Spirit Detective."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5OnjguJwkujo3R23w95EEX8eAEN.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:30669'),
  ('296883024170268199', 'Yu Yu Hakusho', 2023, 'Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Takumi Kitamura, Shuhei Uesugi, Jun Shison, Kanata Hongo, Keita Machida, Kotone Furukawa, Sei Shiraishi', 'TV-MA', 'After a selfless act costs him his life, teen delinquent Yusuke Urameshi is chosen as a Spirit Detective to investigate cases involving rogue yokai.', 'After a selfless act costs him his life, teen delinquent Yusuke Urameshi is chosen as a Spirit Detective to investigate cases involving rogue yokai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9WiCEnojzksL3crxiCt7HIda8p.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:121659'),
  ('1100923664753724437', 'Yu Zui', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', null, null, 'Wu You, Zhang Yishan, Pu Tao, Zhang Yujian, Emotion Cheung Kam-Ching, Ge Zheng, Sun Jiayu, Xu Dongdong', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIbbporWgJ3Zi9ZEnk5HWYF3Og7.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:66832'),
  ('797946793430291035', 'Yu-Gi-Oh!', 1998, 'Animation, Family, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure, Kids, Comedy', null, null, 'Megumi Ogata, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Yumi Kakazu, Ryotaro Okiayu, Yukana, Hikaru Midorikawa, Tsutomu Kashiwakura, Kaneto Shiozawa', 'TV-Y7', 'Yugi Muto, a shy boy who loves all kinds of games, one day solves an ancient puzzle known as the Millennium Puzzle, causing his body to host the spirit of an ancient pharaoh.', 'Yugi Muto, a shy boy who loves all kinds of games, one day solves an ancient puzzle known as the Millennium Puzzle, causing his body to host the spirit of an ancient pharaoh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2PBnjCSbWr9XtJttWYmCkhJ7zM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36406'),
  ('848857232312786794', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! 5D''s', 2008, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Yuya Miyashita, Takanori Hoshino, Shintaro Asanuma, Ayumi Kinoshita, Ai Horanai, Yuka Terasaki, Aiko Aihashi, Hitomi Yoshida', null, 'Welcome to New Domino City! Once the playground to legendary duelist Yugi Muto, this sprawling metropolis has since been transformed into a futuristic society where dueling has kicked into overdrive. With recent technological advancements made by KaibaCorp, dueling has undergone a metamorphosis that has revolutionized the makeup and pace of the game! It’s now a heart-pounding, adrenaline-filled and fuel injected competition where duelists ride supercharged hyper cycles called Duel Runners and battle it out in hi-octane contests called “Turbo Duels.”', 'Welcome to New Domino City! Once the playground to legendary duelist Yugi Muto, this sprawling metropolis has since been transformed into a futuristic society where dueling has kicked into overdrive. With recent technological advancements made by KaibaCorp, dueling has undergone a metamorphosis that has revolutionized the makeup and pace of the game! It’s now a heart-pounding, adrenaline-filled and fuel injected competition where duelists ride supercharged hyper cycles called Duel Runners and battle it out in hi-octane contests called “Turbo Duels.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fareX2gQVmpcxoPFHLAHu3ljld.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:20695'),
  ('1022957005671728281', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Arc-V', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Kensho Ono, Yuuna Inamura, Shinpei Takagi, Rin Aizawa, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Mai Fuchigami, Yohei Ohbayashi, Shogo Yano', 'TV-Y7', 'Yuya Sakaki''s dream is to follow in his father''s footsteps and become the greatest "duel-tainer" in history - and he just might pull it off when he suddenly discovers Pendulum Summoning, a never-before-seen technique that lets him summon many monsters at once!', 'Yuya Sakaki''s dream is to follow in his father''s footsteps and become the greatest "duel-tainer" in history - and he just might pull it off when he suddenly discovers Pendulum Summoning, a never-before-seen technique that lets him summon many monsters at once!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVST01k1PpOZGbGEmCZhevRWhEL.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:67460'),
  ('901914216106471959', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Capsule Monsters', 2006, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', 'Kazuki Takahashi', 'Atsushi Maekawa, Toshimitsu Takeuchi, Fumiyo Sakai', 'Dan Green, Gregory Abbey, Wayne Grayson, Maddie Blaustein, Amy Birnbaum', 'TV-Y7', 'Yugi, Joey, Téa, Tristan, and Yugi''s grandfather Solomon are pulled into a world where Duel Monsters are real. They find monster capsules that they can use to summon monsters. However, in this strange new world, they battle monsters and when their own monsters are attacked, they feel the pain.', 'Yugi, Joey, Téa, Tristan, and Yugi''s grandfather Solomon are pulled into a world where Duel Monsters are real. They find monster capsules that they can use to summon monsters. However, in this strange new world, they battle monsters and when their own monsters are attacked, they feel the pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9pbIbxJPUTf0JqEbq8cPFFISm9X.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:11767'),
  ('506005767065402844', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Duel Monsters', 2000, 'Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Hiroki Takahashi, Shunsuke Kazama, Maki Saito, Takayuki Kondo, Rica Matsumoto, Junko Takeuchi, Tetsuya Iwanaga', 'TV-Y', 'Bullies often target someone frail and weak—someone exactly like Yûgi Muto. He treasures his Millennium Puzzle, an ancient Egyptian artifact that was brought into his grandfather''s game shop. Believing that solving the puzzle will grant him his wish, he completes the puzzle, unleashing a new personality within him, the soul of the "King of Games." The new personality named Yami Yûgi is the exact opposite of Yûgi. Upon any injustice toward him, Yami Yûgi takes over Yûgi''s body and forces the opponent into a "Shadow Game".', 'Bullies often target someone frail and weak—someone exactly like Yûgi Muto. He treasures his Millennium Puzzle, an ancient Egyptian artifact that was brought into his grandfather''s game shop. Believing that solving the puzzle will grant him his wish, he completes the puzzle, unleashing a new personality within him, the soul of the "King of Games." The new personality named Yami Yûgi is the exact opposite of Yûgi. Upon any injustice toward him, Yami Yûgi takes over Yûgi''s body and forces the opponent into a "Shadow Game".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM6c5ISlyKWtie2hGiZWo6hmlhU.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:902'),
  ('615261045980285011', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! GO RUSH!!', 2022, 'Animation, Kids, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Koko Fukushima, Arthur Lounsbery, Toshiki Kumagai, Takuya Eguchi, Natsuki Hanae', null, 'Twins Yuhi and Yuamu Ohdo believe there''s alien life beyond the stars, even though their attempts to prove it have only ended in failure; their hard work and dedication are about to pay off when an extraterrestrial finally arrives on Earth!', 'Twins Yuhi and Yuamu Ohdo believe there''s alien life beyond the stars, even though their attempts to prove it have only ended in failure; their hard work and dedication are about to pay off when an extraterrestrial finally arrives on Earth!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNIcSCbWTP3dYPclZw4iiMf2064.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:196257'),
  ('869339072664023073', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! GX', 2004, 'Animation, Kids, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'KENN, Masami Suzuki, Kappei Yamaguchi, Sanae Kobayashi, Taiki Matsuno, Takeshi Maeda, Irie Kanako, Koji Yusa', 'TV-Y', 'Ten years after the Ceremonial Battle, a teenage boy named Judai Yuuki (Jaden Yuki) heads off in order to join the Duel Academia (Duel Academy) located on a remote island off the coast of Japan. There he meets his fellow students and gains a few friends, along with a few enemies. Judai is put into the lowest rank of Osiris Red (Slifer Red), but he continues to test his skills against the students and faculty to prove his worth as a Duelist and earn the respect of everyone around him.', 'Ten years after the Ceremonial Battle, a teenage boy named Judai Yuuki (Jaden Yuki) heads off in order to join the Duel Academia (Duel Academy) located on a remote island off the coast of Japan. There he meets his fellow students and gains a few friends, along with a few enemies. Judai is put into the lowest rank of Osiris Red (Slifer Red), but he continues to test his skills against the students and faculty to prove his worth as a Duelist and earn the respect of everyone around him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhY30rXaM5axSpAdr1M1HRQrQGa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:12536'),
  ('769105986016102094', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! SEVENS', 2020, 'Kids, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiiro Ishibashi, Taku Yashiro, Natsuki Hanae, Tomori Kusunoki, Yusuke Kobayashi', 'TV-Y7', 'Yuga can''t wait to share Rush Dueling with every Duelist out there, but Goha Enterprises - the megacorp that controls the whole city - is having none of it! They''re the ones who dictate how Duels are supposed to be played, so they''re going to use everything in their arsenal to crush this kid! But if they think that''s going to stop Yuga from building his road to freedom - they don''t know Yuga!', 'Yuga can''t wait to share Rush Dueling with every Duelist out there, but Goha Enterprises - the megacorp that controls the whole city - is having none of it! They''re the ones who dictate how Duels are supposed to be played, so they''re going to use everything in their arsenal to crush this kid! But if they think that''s going to stop Yuga from building his road to freedom - they don''t know Yuga!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfEcbgVnUsnLbpbiEsyAP7vkVWV.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:100368'),
  ('583436035385902716', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS', 2017, 'Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Animation, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Shoya Ishige, Shunsuke Takeuchi, Takahiro Sakurai, Yuki Kaji, Taku Yashiro, Yuki Nakashima', null, 'Den City is a city with advanced network systems in which a VR space called LINK VRAINS was created by SOL Technologies. The Knights of Hanoi, a group that hacks through dueling, as well as SOL Technologies are seeking a mysterious AI program. Yusaku Fujiki, also known as Playmaker, is a first year high school student who manages to capture this AI program while trying to find out the truth about an incident in the past.', 'Den City is a city with advanced network systems in which a VR space called LINK VRAINS was created by SOL Technologies. The Knights of Hanoi, a group that hacks through dueling, as well as SOL Technologies are seeking a mysterious AI program. Yusaku Fujiki, also known as Playmaker, is a first year high school student who manages to capture this AI program while trying to find out the truth about an incident in the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zfJ8qyy8FODCvLhFXPxhbHVpPz4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:71360'),
  ('236416771602776644', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Zexal', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Kids', null, null, 'Tasuku Hatanaka, Miyu Irino, Mikako Komatsu, Toshiki Masuda, Koki Uchiyama, Tomoaki Maeno, Shinji Ogawa, Nami Miyahara', null, 'When aspiring duelist Yuma meets Astral, a mysterious visitor from another universe, it seems like destiny. Yuma needs Astral to teach him how to duel, and Astral needs Yuma to help him regain his memories!', 'When aspiring duelist Yuma meets Astral, a mysterious visitor from another universe, it seems like destiny. Yuma needs Astral to teach him how to duel, and Astral needs Yuma to help him regain his memories!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHOkQJs8oPvU5idZIcjzor7T4m3.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:45854'),
  ('557385217661925868', 'YU-NO: A Girl Who Chants Love at the Bound of This World', 2019, 'Animation, Drama, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuu Hayashi', 'TV-14', 'Arima Takuya is a young student whose father, a historian who has conducted various researches, disappeared recently. During a summer vacation Takuya receives a peculiar package from his missing father, along with a letter containing information about the existence of various parallel worlds. At first Takuya doesn''t take it seriously, but soon he realizes that he possesses a device that allows him to travel to alternate dimensions. Is his father alive, after all? If so, where is he?', 'Arima Takuya is a young student whose father, a historian who has conducted various researches, disappeared recently. During a summer vacation Takuya receives a peculiar package from his missing father, along with a letter containing information about the existence of various parallel worlds. At first Takuya doesn''t take it seriously, but soon he realizes that he possesses a device that allows him to travel to alternate dimensions. Is his father alive, after all? If so, where is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFcp3iSVzruLAAvjw0qrpCAq5eq.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:87142'),
  ('759643984368970147', 'Yukikaze', 2002, 'Animation', null, null, 'Masato Sakai, Jouji Nakata, Takaya Hashi, Miho Yamada, Yoko Asagami, Masako Ikeda', null, 'Thirty-three years ago, an alien force known as the "JAM" invaded Earth through a dimensional portal over Antarctica. Earth’s forces managed to drive the JAM away to a distant planet designated as "Fairy." While the majority of Earth’s population is unaware of the JAM’s presence, the war continues on Fairy, where Rei Fukai is an SAF (Special Air Force) pilot assigned to pilot "Yukikaze"—an advanced reconnaissance fighter plane equipped with a near-sentient A.I. that detects the presence of the JAM within its path.', 'Thirty-three years ago, an alien force known as the "JAM" invaded Earth through a dimensional portal over Antarctica. Earth’s forces managed to drive the JAM away to a distant planet designated as "Fairy." While the majority of Earth’s population is unaware of the JAM’s presence, the war continues on Fairy, where Rei Fukai is an SAF (Special Air Force) pilot assigned to pilot "Yukikaze"—an advanced reconnaissance fighter plane equipped with a near-sentient A.I. that detects the presence of the JAM within its path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qBwbPqDD79lYm6orQ2knOpnNVxi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:69797'),
  ('767518082156818467', 'Yukon Gold', 2013, 'Reality', 'David Paperny', null, 'Al Mc Gregor, Ken Foy, Guillaume Brodeur, Karl Knutson, Cam Johnson, Chris St. Jean, Nika Guilbault, Bill Courage', null, 'Five family-run mining camps risk everything in the hope of hitting the paystreak. Working grueling days under the midnight sun, the crews give it their all to battle the elements ... and each other.', 'Five family-run mining camps risk everything in the hope of hitting the paystreak. Working grueling days under the midnight sun, the crews give it their all to battle the elements ... and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNl4ozPVGHcuqX1MroZPXsEV5ll.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:46875'),
  ('856932661224045255', 'Yumeiro Patissiere', 2009, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Aoi Yuuki, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Shinya Hamazoe, Tsubasa Yonaga, Sachika Misawa, Mayu Iino, Ayana Taketatsu, Yuri Yamaoka', null, 'The episodes from the anime Yumeiro Patissiere are based on the manga of the same name written and illustrated by Natsumi Matsumoto. The series is produced by Studio Pierrot and directed by Ko Suzuki. The story is about 14 yr old Ichigo who dreams of becoming a pastry chef. She attends St. Marie Academy in hopes of following her grandmother''s footsteps. Along the way, she meets boys, enemies, and sweets spirits.', 'The episodes from the anime Yumeiro Patissiere are based on the manga of the same name written and illustrated by Natsumi Matsumoto. The series is produced by Studio Pierrot and directed by Ko Suzuki. The story is about 14 yr old Ichigo who dreams of becoming a pastry chef. She attends St. Marie Academy in hopes of following her grandmother''s footsteps. Along the way, she meets boys, enemies, and sweets spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCKoeh4EcHGUnWtVcoqD5OqFjlV.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:45999'),
  ('953597627360474606', 'Yumi''s Cells', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Song Jae-jung, Kim Yoon-joo', null, 'Kim Go-eun, Kim Jae-won, Jun Suk-ho, Choi Daniel, Cho Hye-jeong, Mi Ram, Park Se-in', null, 'Yumi is a 30-year old, ordinary woman who struggles with expressing her feelings. Told from the perspective of the many brain cells in her head, she experiences growth in both her love life, her career, and finds happiness in the small joys of everyday life.', 'Yumi is a 30-year old, ordinary woman who struggles with expressing her feelings. Told from the perspective of the many brain cells in her head, she experiences growth in both her love life, her career, and finds happiness in the small joys of everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXzjgrIAKaxwMppa4LrKdwdMDC6.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:128995'),
  ('241735856606917670', 'Yummy Yummy Yummy', 2025, 'Drama', null, null, 'Wang Yinglu, Li Yunrui, Chang Long, Feng Jiayi, Sui Junbo, Dong Siyi, Hu Wei, Han Mo', null, 'A chance encounter brings the Shen family to Yong''an City, where they meet Lin Yan, a magistrate. Their journey unfolds into a whimsical tale of gourmet delights, local traditions, and an unexpected romance.', 'A chance encounter brings the Shen family to Yong''an City, where they meet Lin Yan, a magistrate. Their journey unfolds into a whimsical tale of gourmet delights, local traditions, and an unexpected romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i6uYOLRQcGnMSqaRYa4kHYOTEO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:273274'),
  ('304600160907929237', 'Yunus Emre', 2015, 'Drama', 'Mehmet Bozdağ', null, 'Gökhan Atalay, Payidar Tüfekçioğlu, Baran Akbulut, Pelin Orhuner, Mehmet Çepiç, Asuman Çakır, Mehmet Ali Kaptanlar, Ceyda Kasabalı', null, 'As Mongol invasions are getting more frequent, Yunus travels to Nallihan where he establishes himself as Seldjuk official. After joining Taptuk Emre''s dergâh (dervish monastery), he proceeds to follow his journey on becoming a dervish.', 'As Mongol invasions are getting more frequent, Yunus travels to Nallihan where he establishes himself as Seldjuk official. After joining Taptuk Emre''s dergâh (dervish monastery), he proceeds to follow his journey on becoming a dervish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2kTvitWN7tnpZGf4vb5MxK4TGf.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67144'),
  ('274363914894850908', 'YUREI DECO', 2022, 'Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mira Kawakatsu, Anna Nagase, Miyu Irino, Setsuji Sato, Sayuri Sadaoka, Rie Kugimiya', 'TV-14', 'The story begins when Berry, an average girl from an average home, meets Hack, a girl who looks like a boy. Charmed by Hack, Berry meets up with the team Hack leads, the Ghost Detectives Club. Members of this club are “socially dead,” working invisibly within the digitally controlled society of Tom Sawyer. As she works with the group, Berry learns about Zero, a mysterious figure who lurks within Tom Sawyer’s underground. She and Hack decide to chase down this figure, and in time, the truth behind the city is revealed...', 'The story begins when Berry, an average girl from an average home, meets Hack, a girl who looks like a boy. Charmed by Hack, Berry meets up with the team Hack leads, the Ghost Detectives Club. Members of this club are “socially dead,” working invisibly within the digitally controlled society of Tom Sawyer. As she works with the group, Berry learns about Zero, a mysterious figure who lurks within Tom Sawyer’s underground. She and Hack decide to chase down this figure, and in time, the truth behind the city is revealed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNfXL2jZBZCuSjrdHoDlBWOLCpa.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:158131'),
  ('162620653947542847', 'Yuri Is My Job!', 2023, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Yui Ogura, Sumire Uesaka, Minami Tanaka, Makoto Koichi, Yukari Tamura, Asami Seto', 'TV-14', 'Worried about her reputation, Hime covers shifts for a cafe manager she accidentally injures to maintain her picture-perfect princess image. But this cafe has a peculiar theme—private school. To put on her best barista schoolgirl act, she’ll be trained by the most graceful girl there, Mitsuki. Under her guidance, Hime’s feelings start to brew, but there’s just one problem—Mitsuki can’t stand her!', 'Worried about her reputation, Hime covers shifts for a cafe manager she accidentally injures to maintain her picture-perfect princess image. But this cafe has a peculiar theme—private school. To put on her best barista schoolgirl act, she’ll be trained by the most graceful girl there, Mitsuki. Under her guidance, Hime’s feelings start to brew, but there’s just one problem—Mitsuki can’t stand her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z35BRoqjMpcVmQmDTx2xh5twQoi.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:201949'),
  ('747475388387979048', 'Yuri!!! on Ice', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Toshiyuki Toyonaga, Junichi Suwabe, Koki Uchiyama, Yoshimasa Hosoya, Mamoru Miyano, Kensho Ono, Yuka Komatsu', 'TV-14', 'While on the verge of retirement, skater Yuri Katsuki meets Yuri Plisetsky and Victor Nikiforov, two skaters who rekindle his competitive fire.', 'While on the verge of retirement, skater Yuri Katsuki meets Yuri Plisetsky and Victor Nikiforov, two skaters who rekindle his competitive fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oxenakJNCj06JrWHENjvwaWGcSz.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68129'),
  ('602828214413375420', 'Yurikuma Arashi', 2015, 'Animation, Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Nozomi Yamane, Miho Arakawa, Yoshiko Ikuta, Junichi Suwabe, Mitsuki Saiga, Kazutomi Yamamoto, Yui Ogura, Aoi Yuuki', 'NR', 'Humans have created a Wall of Severance to separate themselves from the bears, who grew violent and attacked humans after a far-off planet known as Kumalia exploded many years ago, turning into a meteor shower that fell upon earth. Two bears, Ginko Yurishiro and Lulu Yurigasaki, sneak through the Wall of Severance and disguise themselves as humans, enrolling in Arashigaoka Academy and taking an interest in Kureha Tsubaki, a human girl who despises bears.', 'Humans have created a Wall of Severance to separate themselves from the bears, who grew violent and attacked humans after a far-off planet known as Kumalia exploded many years ago, turning into a meteor shower that fell upon earth. Two bears, Ginko Yurishiro and Lulu Yurigasaki, sneak through the Wall of Severance and disguise themselves as humans, enrolling in Arashigaoka Academy and taking an interest in Kureha Tsubaki, a human girl who despises bears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ni3vJW3daz68dbsw2pYqTCPx0Em.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:68642'),
  ('762297580065413512', 'Yuru Camp△', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', null, null, 'Haruka Fukuhara, Yuno Ohara, Momoko Tanabe, Yumena Yanai, Yurina Yanagi, Kaho Tsuchimura', 'NR', 'This is the story of a winter day. Kagamihara Nadeshiko, a female high school student who moved from Shizuoka to Yamanashi, rode a bicycle to see Mt. Fuji, but unfortunately, the weather was cloudy and Mt. Fuji cannot be seen. Tired, Nadeshiko falls asleep on the spot and wakes up at night. This is her first time going there and she didn''t know how to return. Fortunately, Shima Rin, a girl who loves camping, saves her. They lit a bonfire to warm up and the sound of the blazing firewood permeates the silence of the lake.', 'This is the story of a winter day. Kagamihara Nadeshiko, a female high school student who moved from Shizuoka to Yamanashi, rode a bicycle to see Mt. Fuji, but unfortunately, the weather was cloudy and Mt. Fuji cannot be seen. Tired, Nadeshiko falls asleep on the spot and wakes up at night. This is her first time going there and she didn''t know how to return. Fortunately, Shima Rin, a girl who loves camping, saves her. They lit a bonfire to warm up and the sound of the blazing firewood permeates the silence of the lake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wJK1IMsWtWl1zyx7Uy4lg7rbNL.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:95623'),
  ('538388780809535800', 'YuruYuri: Happy Go Lily', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Shiori Mikami, Yuka Otsubo, Minami Tsuda, Rumi Okubo, Saki Fujita, Aki Toyosaki, Emiri Kato, Suzuko Mimori', 'TV-14', 'On her first day attending the all-girls Nanamori Middle School in Takaoka, Toyama Akaza Akari oversleeps, to be awakened by her one-year-senior childhood friends: the level-headed Funami Yui and the often self-centered Toshinou Kyouko. Planning on exciting club activities at school, Akari joins the club her older friends have set up. But as it turns out Kyouko and Yui simply took over the former room of the now defunct tea ceremony club for their own Amusement Club. In regard to what the club does, Kyouko explains: "We just hang out and do whatever we want!" This is not exactly what the helpful and energetic Akari had hoped for. Surprisingly a few days later Yoshikawa Chinatsu joins the club even though she mistook it for the former tea ceremony club. And so the four fun-loving girls could enjoy spending their spare time at the club were it not for the student council, in person of vice president Sugiura Ayano, who does her very best to shut down this unauthorized club.', 'On her first day attending the all-girls Nanamori Middle School in Takaoka, Toyama Akaza Akari oversleeps, to be awakened by her one-year-senior childhood friends: the level-headed Funami Yui and the often self-centered Toshinou Kyouko. Planning on exciting club activities at school, Akari joins the club her older friends have set up. But as it turns out Kyouko and Yui simply took over the former room of the now defunct tea ceremony club for their own Amusement Club. In regard to what the club does, Kyouko explains: "We just hang out and do whatever we want!" This is not exactly what the helpful and energetic Akari had hoped for. Surprisingly a few days later Yoshikawa Chinatsu joins the club even though she mistook it for the former tea ceremony club. And so the four fun-loving girls could enjoy spending their spare time at the club were it not for the student council, in person of vice president Sugiura Ayano, who does her very best to shut down this unauthorized club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syLTfsI9B1JzvKz27btK0xK97Y8.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:52891'),
  ('903046509036622203', 'Yuuki Yuuna Is a Hero', 2014, 'Animation, Drama, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', 'Takahiro', null, 'Haruka Terui, Suzuko Mimori, Yumi Uchiyama, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Juri Nagatsuma, Kana Hanazawa, Ayaka Ohashi, Yumiri Hanamori', 'TV-14', 'Yuuki Yuuna is an ordinary second-year middle school student. She gets up in the morning, gets ready for school, goes to classes, participates in club activities, and has fun with her friends. But there is one extraordinary thing about Yuuna -- she belongs to the “Brave Hero Club.” What does the Brave Hero Club do? Who is the mysterious being called “Vertex?” Yuuki Yuuna and her friends’ story takes place in Year 300, Divine Era', 'Yuuki Yuuna is an ordinary second-year middle school student. She gets up in the morning, gets ready for school, goes to classes, participates in club activities, and has fun with her friends. But there is one extraordinary thing about Yuuna -- she belongs to the “Brave Hero Club.” What does the Brave Hero Club do? Who is the mysterious being called “Vertex?” Yuuki Yuuna and her friends’ story takes place in Year 300, Divine Era', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lRoC9nB6lJApAkua1d7IfV3pmoM.jpg', 3, 'tmdb:tv:71493'),
  ('1053746543461180965', 'Yuuki Yuuna is a Hero: Churutto!', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy', null, null, 'Haruka Terui, Suzuko Mimori, Yumi Uchiyama, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Juri Nagatsuma, Kana Hanazawa, Yumiri Hanamori, Ayaka Ohashi', null, 'Set in year 300 of the Divine Era, heroes and shrine maidens were summoned after a crisis befell on the sacred tree. The Sanshuu Middle School Hero Club was transformed into a bountiful household with 27 of them gathered together. Headed by someone who has a strong sense of companionship, Inubouzaki Fuu, she is determined to make it a Hero Club Udon!', 'Set in year 300 of the Divine Era, heroes and shrine maidens were summoned after a crisis befell on the sacred tree. The Sanshuu Middle School Hero Club was transformed into a bountiful household with 27 of them gathered together. Headed by someone who has a strong sense of companionship, Inubouzaki Fuu, she is determined to make it a Hero Club Udon!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eK8UZ0UR31qHhttiGQmjgcqIxPM.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:117786'),
  ('739574142033728210', 'Yuuna and the Haunted Hot Springs', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Yuki Ono, Miyuri Shimabukuro, Rie Takahashi, Ai Kakuma, Yui Ogura, Eri Suzuki, Sayaka Harada, Anzu Haruno', 'TV-14', 'Kogarashi Fuyuzora is a "hands on" psychic. Ever since the day he got possessed by an evil ghost, he has been burdened with debt. Needing a cheap room to rent, he winds up at a haunted hot springs inn, Yuragi Inn, where only incredibly beautiful girls reside. Amongst the residents is a ghost, Yuuna, who cannot move on to the spirit world. Despite the resistance from the current tenants that are all girls, Kogarashi manages to start his new life at Yuragi Inn.', 'Kogarashi Fuyuzora is a "hands on" psychic. Ever since the day he got possessed by an evil ghost, he has been burdened with debt. Needing a cheap room to rent, he winds up at a haunted hot springs inn, Yuragi Inn, where only incredibly beautiful girls reside. Amongst the residents is a ghost, Yuuna, who cannot move on to the spirit world. Despite the resistance from the current tenants that are all girls, Kogarashi manages to start his new life at Yuragi Inn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fuZemw0UoF8aMD77FSmDom3VvW1.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:80504'),
  ('751323477029113836', 'Yuyushiki', 2013, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mikami Komata', 'Natsuko Takahashi', 'Minami Tsuda, Rumi Okubo, Risa Taneda, Ai Kayano, Mana Shimizu, Megumi Han, Yui Horie', 'TV-14', 'The daily school life of three girls, Yuzuko, Yukari, and Yui, who join their high school''s Data Processing Club. The odd friendship between the three make for wacky humor in even the most mundane of events.', 'The daily school life of three girls, Yuzuko, Yukari, and Yui, who join their high school''s Data Processing Club. The odd friendship between the three make for wacky humor in even the most mundane of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9KEXv0sJVHzq1rEZxlqxCPl4sx.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:52890'),
  ('495889387113656444', 'Z Nation', 2014, 'Mystery, Action & Adventure, Drama', 'Karl Schaefer, Craig Engler', null, 'Keith Allan, Kellita Smith, Anastasia Baranova, Nat Zang, Russell Hodgkinson, Katy O''Brian, Gracie Gillam, DJ Qualls', 'TV-14', 'Three years after the zombie virus has gutted the country, a team of everyday heroes must transport the only known survivor of the plague from New York to California, where the last functioning viral lab waits for his blood.', 'Three years after the zombie virus has gutted the country, a team of everyday heroes must transport the only known survivor of the plague from New York to California, where the last functioning viral lab waits for his blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXfeDMkEcHoYBvtkbU11g3F81b.jpg', 5, 'tmdb:tv:61345'),
  ('835809333036232517', 'Z-Cars', 1962, 'Drama', 'Troy Kennedy Martin, Allan Prior', null, 'Frank Windsor, James Ellis, Douglas Fielding', null, 'Z-Cars or Z Cars is a British television drama series centred on the work of mobile uniformed police in the fictional town of Newtown, based on Kirkby, Merseyside. Produced by the BBC, it debuted in January 1962 and ran until September 1978.', 'Z-Cars or Z Cars is a British television drama series centred on the work of mobile uniformed police in the fictional town of Newtown, based on Kirkby, Merseyside. Produced by the BBC, it debuted in January 1962 and ran until September 1978.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUcvEC9WLgRgvnmbsSnaB8Gf3xS.jpg', 12, 'tmdb:tv:2379'),
  ('729737710806971580', 'Z: The Beginning of Everything', 2015, 'Drama', 'Dawn Prestwich, Nicole Yorkin', null, 'Christina Ricci, David Hoflin, David Strathairn', 'TV-MA', 'A biography series based on the life of Zelda Sayre Fitzgerald, the brilliant, beautiful and talented Southern Belle who becomes the original flapper and icon of the wild, flamboyant Jazz Age in the 20s. Z starts before Zelda Fitzgerald meets the unpublished writer F. Scott Fitzgerald and moves through their passionate, turbulent love affair and their marriage-made in heaven, lived out in hell as the celebrity couple of their time.', 'A biography series based on the life of Zelda Sayre Fitzgerald, the brilliant, beautiful and talented Southern Belle who becomes the original flapper and icon of the wild, flamboyant Jazz Age in the 20s. Z starts before Zelda Fitzgerald meets the unpublished writer F. Scott Fitzgerald and moves through their passionate, turbulent love affair and their marriage-made in heaven, lived out in hell as the celebrity couple of their time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJxnK0conCaxk3HU4YPb3aQs9UZ.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:64506'),
  ('187060337778675239', 'Z/X: Ignition', 2014, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy, Comedy', null, null, 'Hiro Shimono, Miyuki Sawashiro, Yui Ogura, Yuichi Nakamura, Maaya Uchida, Hisako Kanemoto', 'TV-PG', 'The story is set in the not-so-distant future. Five "Black Points" suddenly appeared around the world as portals to parallel worlds. Immediately after, strange creatures began their invasion from these portals. These creatures are the inhabitants of five worlds—the same worlds in different timeframes. In order to ensure their own future timeframe survives, each of the five invasion forces battle to wipe the other future timeframes out. The key is one card-shaped device.', 'The story is set in the not-so-distant future. Five "Black Points" suddenly appeared around the world as portals to parallel worlds. Immediately after, strange creatures began their invasion from these portals. These creatures are the inhabitants of five worlds—the same worlds in different timeframes. In order to ensure their own future timeframe survives, each of the five invasion forces battle to wipe the other future timeframes out. The key is one card-shaped device.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oeUCXn41raVtge7wT3BAw0gN3El.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:66229'),
  ('1020805574775015289', 'Zach Stone Is Gonna Be Famous', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Bo Burnham, Dan Lagana', null, 'Bo Burnham, Kari Coleman, Thomas F. Wilson, Cameron Palatas, Caitlin Gerard, Armen Weitzman', 'TV-PG', 'Zach hires a camera crew to film him throughout his daily life as a part of his quest to become an over-night celebrity - even though he possesses no real talent. From Zach''s attempts to become a celebrity chef or a ring-tone recording artist to purposefully going missing, he''ll try any avenue to get noticed and stop at nothing until he reaches fame.', 'Zach hires a camera crew to film him throughout his daily life as a part of his quest to become an over-night celebrity - even though he possesses no real talent. From Zach''s attempts to become a celebrity chef or a ring-tone recording artist to purposefully going missing, he''ll try any avenue to get noticed and stop at nothing until he reaches fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKanycHEsO40jxDnFeCCEytnTW4.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:57606'),
  ('822081760874557774', 'Zak Storm', 2016, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Family, Comedy, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Hervé Grull, Marie Nonnenmacher', null, 'The adventures of Zak Storm - a headstrong and adventurous kid swept into the Bermuda Triangle while trying to win a surfing competition. Once inside, Zak partners up with a magical sword that allows him to transform into a swashbuckling, renegade hero to face the numerous perils of the unique and diverse Seven Seas of the Triangle.', 'The adventures of Zak Storm - a headstrong and adventurous kid swept into the Bermuda Triangle while trying to win a surfing competition. Once inside, Zak partners up with a magical sword that allows him to transform into a swashbuckling, renegade hero to face the numerous perils of the unique and diverse Seven Seas of the Triangle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vT0AngQDHgBUqDmdhMJr1kGo6NF.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:73945'),
  ('281228047714132118', 'Zakuro', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Mai Nakahara, Takahiro Sakurai, Kana Hanazawa, Satoshi Hino, Aki Toyosaki, Yui Horie, Yuki Kaji, Akihiko Ishizumi', 'TV-14', 'The story takes place during the Westernization Movement in an alternate world where humans and spirits coexist. To solve the problems that arise between the two, human lieutenants are partnered with half-spirit girls to form the Ministry of Spirit Affairs.', 'The story takes place during the Westernization Movement in an alternate world where humans and spirits coexist. To solve the problems that arise between the two, human lieutenants are partnered with half-spirit girls to form the Ministry of Spirit Affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wzZwwIl9ICpMCk6ADhsJsAJKDHB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:36836'),
