  ('492384480225317714', 'Zerosum Game', 2022, 'Reality', null, null, 'Jang Sung-kyu, Han Hye-jin, Lee Yi-kyung, Song Yuqi', null, 'Ten contestants participate in a fierce, high-level psychological survival game to keep the sum of everyone''s weight. From 40kg to 200kg, contestants with different weights and jobs got to survive to win the prize. If they fail to keep the total sum, $1,000 per 100 grams will be deducted from the prize money.', 'Ten contestants participate in a fierce, high-level psychological survival game to keep the sum of everyone''s weight. From 40kg to 200kg, contestants with different weights and jobs got to survive to win the prize. If they fail to keep the total sum, $1,000 per 100 grams will be deducted from the prize money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJ2nkagh99NV5C0S7SQoZH92lwy.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:205174'),
  ('331811277765302791', 'ZeroZeroZero', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Leonardo Fasoli, Mauricio Katz, Stefano Sollima', null, 'Andrea Riseborough, Giuseppe De Domenico, Harold Torres, Dane DeHaan, Adriano Chiaramida, Nika Perrone, Erick Israel Consuelo, Mauricio Mendez', 'TV-MA', 'Based on the book of the same name by bestselling author Roberto Saviano, ZeroZeroZero is an unforgettable exploration of the inner workings of the global cocaine trade.', 'Based on the book of the same name by bestselling author Roberto Saviano, ZeroZeroZero is an unforgettable exploration of the inner workings of the global cocaine trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c0AISx9tx6crOih0KdjQsfAm3Uo.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:92137'),
  ('229154284404282509', 'Zetman', 2012, 'Action & Adventure, Animation, Sci-Fi & Fantasy', null, null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Romi Park, Mariya Ise, Mamoru Miyano, Yuki Kaida, Kana Hanazawa, Koji Yusa', 'TV-MA', 'The story starts off with a face-off between two rival heroes, ZET and ALPHAS, and then traces their origins - Jin Kanzaki, a young man with the ability to transform into a superhuman being known as ZET, and Kouga Amagi, a young man with a strong sense of justice who uses technology to fight as ALPHAS. The fates of these two men and those around them intertwine as they fight to protect mankind and destroy monstrous abominations known as Players.', 'The story starts off with a face-off between two rival heroes, ZET and ALPHAS, and then traces their origins - Jin Kanzaki, a young man with the ability to transform into a superhuman being known as ZET, and Kouga Amagi, a young man with a strong sense of justice who uses technology to fight as ALPHAS. The fates of these two men and those around them intertwine as they fight to protect mankind and destroy monstrous abominations known as Players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cujranWhuh2d6iKw88hgVQvGWJe.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:61384'),
  ('990310156492259497', 'Zhao Jiadi', 2022, 'Drama', 'Chen Zhenghua', '吴海霞', 'He Peng, Ding Xiaoying, Ling Zhuo, Chang Di, Yang Qiru, Yang Yuxin, Wang Zheng', null, 'Heir to a powerful business empire, Zhao Jiadi escapes to Haicheng for a fresh start, but as love and family tensions collide, he must confront his past and fight for the simple life he truly wants.', 'Heir to a powerful business empire, Zhao Jiadi escapes to Haicheng for a fresh start, but as love and family tensions collide, he must confront his past and fight for the simple life he truly wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mtT0fgkj4rFrFusdP69FYYlB8wX.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:196615'),
  ('1041840760377055086', 'Zhì zuìchū de wǒmen', 2026, 'Drama', null, null, 'Ding Zeren, Zhu Rongjun, Lan Bo, Qiao Jingwen, Chen Yesheng', null, 'Orphan Xiong Yuanbao and his neighbor Mu Qingyun grow up side by side, supporting each other through life’s hardships as their deep bond and shared dreams are tested in a changing era.', 'Orphan Xiong Yuanbao and his neighbor Mu Qingyun grow up side by side, supporting each other through life’s hardships as their deep bond and shared dreams are tested in a changing era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rld71SetxjIyI83e1ThmmLQ8SmB.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:318545'),
