  ('410958719246097411', 'Zorra Total', 1999, 'Comedy', null, 'Gugu Olimecha', 'Karina Dohme, Renata Palis, Agildo Ribeiro', null, 'Zorra Total is a Brazilian television comedy broadcast by Globo Network. It was launched on March 25, 1999 and has aired on Saturdays, at 10p.m., ever since May 1999. The show is a sketch comedy show. It is the audience leader on its slot.', 'Zorra Total is a Brazilian television comedy broadcast by Globo Network. It was launched on March 25, 1999 and has aired on Saturdays, at 10p.m., ever since May 1999. The show is a sketch comedy show. It is the audience leader on its slot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68a9LyKQC6gNgDSbl6vMwc7dtTZ.jpg', 16, 'tmdb:tv:17111'),
  ('698099948009151491', 'Zorras', 2023, 'Drama', 'Estíbaliz Burgaleta, Flora González Villanueva', null, 'Andrea Ros, Mirela Balić, Tai Fati, Pilar Castro, Nico Romero, Iacopo Ricciotti, Laura Galán, Chelis Quinzá', null, 'Follows three women who unintentionally launch a feminine revolution when they create a secret group to fulfill their sexual fantasies.', 'Follows three women who unintentionally launch a feminine revolution when they create a secret group to fulfill their sexual fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQXrIVJ8ojWmD0TK937bNS0w8jO.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:227512'),
  ('851779246224638208', 'Zorro', 1957, 'Western, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Guy Williams, Gene Sheldon, Henry Calvin', 'TV-G', 'Diego de la Vega, the son of a wealthy landowner, returns from his studies in Spain and discovers that Los Angeles is under the command of Capitan Monastario, a cruel man who relishes in the misuse of his power for personal gain. Knowing that he cannot hope to single-handedly defeat Monastario and his troops, Diego resorts to subterfuge. He adopts the secret identity of Zorro, a sinister figure dressed in black, and rides to fight Monastario''s injustice.', 'Diego de la Vega, the son of a wealthy landowner, returns from his studies in Spain and discovers that Los Angeles is under the command of Capitan Monastario, a cruel man who relishes in the misuse of his power for personal gain. Knowing that he cannot hope to single-handedly defeat Monastario and his troops, Diego resorts to subterfuge. He adopts the secret identity of Zorro, a sinister figure dressed in black, and rides to fight Monastario''s injustice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i4HdLMCRfEXLeA6JGTsQj6WU3k.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:4681'),
  ('797363348950347400', 'Zorro', 1990, 'Action & Adventure, Drama', null, null, 'Henry Darrow, J.G. Hertzler, Duncan Regehr, Juan Diego Botto, Daniel Craig, James Victor, Deborah Moore', null, 'Zorro, also known as The New Zorro, New World Zorro, and Zorro 1990, is an American action-adventure drama series featuring Duncan Regehr as the character of Zorro. Regehr portrayed the fearless Latino hero and fencer on The Family Channel from 1990 to 1993. The series was shot entirely in Madrid, Spain and produced by New World Television, The Family Channel, Ellipse Programme of Canal Plus, Beta TV, and RAI. 88 episodes of the series were produced, 10 more than the first Zorro television series, which was produced by Disney in the late 1950s. Since 2011, the series is currently airing in the United States on the Retro Television Network as The New Zorro. Peter Rodgers Organization is the distributor for this version of Zorro.', 'Zorro, also known as The New Zorro, New World Zorro, and Zorro 1990, is an American action-adventure drama series featuring Duncan Regehr as the character of Zorro. Regehr portrayed the fearless Latino hero and fencer on The Family Channel from 1990 to 1993. The series was shot entirely in Madrid, Spain and produced by New World Television, The Family Channel, Ellipse Programme of Canal Plus, Beta TV, and RAI. 88 episodes of the series were produced, 10 more than the first Zorro television series, which was produced by Disney in the late 1950s. Since 2011, the series is currently airing in the United States on the Retro Television Network as The New Zorro. Peter Rodgers Organization is the distributor for this version of Zorro.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuo9I7AF6HSs4RdpwHb2QFOkZjk.jpg', 4, 'tmdb:tv:15822'),
  ('800936921787806539', 'Zorro', 2024, 'Action & Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Noé Debré, Benjamin Charbit', null, 'Jean Dujardin, Grégory Gadebois, André Dussollier, Audrey Dana, Éric Elmosnino, Salvatore Ficarra, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Virginie Emane', null, 'In 1821, Don Diego de la Vega becomes mayor of his beloved city of Los Angeles, which he intends to make prosperous. However, the municipality is facing financial problems due to the greed of a local businessman, Don Emmanuel, against whom the mayor''s powers prove insufficient to fight injustice. Don Diego has not called upon his double Zorro for 20 years. But in the name of the general interest, he has no choice but to take out his mask and his sword. Very quickly, Diego will encounter difficulties in reconciling his dual identity as Zorro and mayor, which puts a strain on his marriage to Gabriella, who is unaware of his secret. Will Diego be able to save his marriage and his sanity in the midst of chaos?', 'In 1821, Don Diego de la Vega becomes mayor of his beloved city of Los Angeles, which he intends to make prosperous. However, the municipality is facing financial problems due to the greed of a local businessman, Don Emmanuel, against whom the mayor''s powers prove insufficient to fight injustice. Don Diego has not called upon his double Zorro for 20 years. But in the name of the general interest, he has no choice but to take out his mask and his sword. Very quickly, Diego will encounter difficulties in reconciling his dual identity as Zorro and mayor, which puts a strain on his marriage to Gabriella, who is unaware of his secret. Will Diego be able to save his marriage and his sanity in the midst of chaos?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tvmNQMsXJJvkxKrutUI59fHPKhg.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:212286'),
  ('905058285382928312', 'Zorro the Chronicles', 2015, 'Animation, Kids, Action & Adventure', null, null, 'Valéry Schatz, Michel Voletti, Fabrice Fara, Sandra Lou, Pascal Casanova', 'NR', 'The masked fox returns to fight against injustice and evil, with his witty banter and his trademark swordsmanship. The Chronicles go back to basics as they focus on the original Zorro''s qualities and his formative years. On his spectacular quest, we meet the villains plotting against him and his brave twin Ines and his best friend Bernardo who support Zorro through thick and thin', 'The masked fox returns to fight against injustice and evil, with his witty banter and his trademark swordsmanship. The Chronicles go back to basics as they focus on the original Zorro''s qualities and his formative years. On his spectacular quest, we meet the villains plotting against him and his brave twin Ines and his best friend Bernardo who support Zorro through thick and thin', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBQzLSYdFYqDdGpQVvqubuiD7Om.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:72805'),
  ('417572826738993785', 'Zorro: La espada y la rosa', 2007, 'Western, Drama, Soap', 'Johnston McCulley', null, 'Christian Meier, Osvaldo Ríos, Natasha Klauss, Marlene Favela, Andrea Montenegro, Arturo Peniche, Héctor Suárez Gomís, Harry Geithner', 'NR', 'Spanish telenovela based on Johnston McCulley''s characters. Don Diego Dela Vega, adopts the secret identity of Zorro. Diego born in the 1790s to a white father, Don Alejandro Dela Vega, and his wife, Native American warrior named Toypurnia. Diego learned his acrobatics and fencing skills in Spain, under a great swordmaster, than he returned to his family''s California hacienda. He lives as both a nobleman and a vigilante, fighting imperialist oppression. He is backed by the brotherhood of Zorro, a secret society called the Knights of the Broken Thorn. Zorro falls in love with a beautiful young widow, Esmeralda Sánchez de Moncada. She arrives in California with her sister Mariángel Sánchez de Moncada and her father, Fernando, the newly appointed governor—and villainous dictator—of Los Angeles. The story arc focuses on mysteries concerning Esmeralda''s long-lost mother and the man whose atrocities changed Diego''s life forever. Their resolution threatens to shake the Spanish Empire.', 'Spanish telenovela based on Johnston McCulley''s characters. Don Diego Dela Vega, adopts the secret identity of Zorro. Diego born in the 1790s to a white father, Don Alejandro Dela Vega, and his wife, Native American warrior named Toypurnia. Diego learned his acrobatics and fencing skills in Spain, under a great swordmaster, than he returned to his family''s California hacienda. He lives as both a nobleman and a vigilante, fighting imperialist oppression. He is backed by the brotherhood of Zorro, a secret society called the Knights of the Broken Thorn. Zorro falls in love with a beautiful young widow, Esmeralda Sánchez de Moncada. She arrives in California with her sister Mariángel Sánchez de Moncada and her father, Fernando, the newly appointed governor—and villainous dictator—of Los Angeles. The story arc focuses on mysteries concerning Esmeralda''s long-lost mother and the man whose atrocities changed Diego''s life forever. Their resolution threatens to shake the Spanish Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6XZeLzt6mKJsUMc5S59Td0mt3g.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:5144'),
  ('497138412598259533', 'Zum blauen Bock', 1957, 'News, Comedy, Talk', null, null, 'Reno Nonsens, Franz Grothe, Heinz Schenk, Lia Wöhr', 'NR', 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', null, 1, 'tmdb:tv:63024'),
  ('84524554439656', 'Zumbo''s Just Desserts', 2016, 'Reality', null, null, 'Adriano Zumbo, Gigi Falanga, Rachel Khoo', 'TV-PG', 'Australia’s very own Willy Wonka Adriano Zumbo and acclaimed British chef Rachel Khoo go in search of Australia’s sweetest home cooks. Amateur dessert makers from around the country will put their sweet baking skills to the test until the ultimate dessert king or queen is crowned.', 'Australia’s very own Willy Wonka Adriano Zumbo and acclaimed British chef Rachel Khoo go in search of Australia’s sweetest home cooks. Amateur dessert makers from around the country will put their sweet baking skills to the test until the ultimate dessert king or queen is crowned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HRjQL4Umbt8RDN3PInX4jHzZNi.jpg', 2, 'tmdb:tv:67855'),
  ('4672334387371396', 'Zwei Weihnachtsmänner', 2008, 'Comedy', null, null, 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Bastian Pastewka, Floriane Daniel, Sophie von Kessel, Armin Rohde, Anja Franke, Michael Lott', null, 'A tough lawyer and a childish pool-noodle salesman become mismatched traveling companions as they try to get home to Berlin in time for Christmas.', 'A tough lawyer and a childish pool-noodle salesman become mismatched traveling companions as they try to get home to Berlin in time for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/of2eind0EcfjQQOQWq8YH5fsf3j.jpg', 1, 'tmdb:tv:235886'),
